hadiths[600]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ibn Uyayna Abu Muhammad ne humein khabar di, farmaya: Mis'ar ibn Kidam ne hum se bayan kiya, Uthman ibn al-Mughira al-Thaqafi se, Ali ibn Rabi'a al-Walibi se, Asma ibn al-Hakam al-Fazari se, unhon ne farmaya: main ne Ali ibn Abi Talib Razi Allahu Anhu ko farmate hue suna: jab bhi main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se koi hadith sunta to Allah Ta'ala mujhe us se jitna chahta faida pahunchata, aur jab koi aur mujhe bayan karta to main us se qasam leta, phir jab woh mujhe qasam khata to main us ki tasdiq karta. Phir Abu Bakr ne mujhe bayan kiya - aur Abu Bakr ne sach farmaya - farmaya: main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: koi banda aisa nahin jo gunah kare, phir khara ho aur wuzu kare aur use khoob achhi tarah kare, phir do rak'atein namaz parhe, phir Allah se maghfirat mange, magar Allah use bakhsh deta hai. Sufyan ne farmaya: aur Asim al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah, us mein izafa karte hue: magar unhon ne farmaya: aur woh khushu ikhtiyar karta hai, yani woh namaz parhta hai."
"2","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Al-Walid ibn Muslim al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya: main ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Yazid ibn Jabir ko farmate hue suna: main ne Sulaym ibn Amir ko farmate hue suna: main ne Awsat al-Bajali ko Hims ke minbar par farmate hue suna: main ne Abu Bakr al-Siddiq ko Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke minbar par farmate hue suna: main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko suna - phir aansuon ne un ka gala rok diya, phir woh laute aur aansuon ne un ka gala rok diya, phir unhon ne farmaya: main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko pichhle saal farmate hue suna: Allah se muafi aur aafiyat mango, kyunke yaqeen ke baad kisi bande ko aafiyat se behtar koi cheez nahin di gayi."
"3","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Marwan ibn Mu'awiya al-Fazari ne hum se bayan kiya: Isma'il ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Qays ibn Abi Hazim se: ke Abu Bakr al-Siddiq khare hue, Allah ki hamd ki aur Us ki sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: ae logon, tum ye ayat parhte ho: ae iman walon, apni fikr karo; jab tum hidayat par ho to jo gumrah ho woh tumhein nuqsan nahin pahuncha sakta. Aur hum ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: jab log zalim ko dekhen aur us ka hath na pakren to qareeb hai ke Allah un sab ko azaab mein gher le."
"4","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Waki' ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya: Mis'ar ibn Kidam aur Sufyan al-Thawri ne hum se bayan kiya, Uthman ibn al-Mughira al-Thaqafi se, Ali ibn Rabi'a al-Walibi se, Asma ibn al-Hakam al-Fazari se, Ali ibn Abi Talib se, unhon ne farmaya: jab bhi main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se koi hadith sunta to Allah mujhe us se jitna chahta faida deta, aur jab koi aur mujhe bayan karta to main us se qasam leta, phir jab woh mujhe qasam khata to main us ki tasdiq karta, aur Abu Bakr ne mujhe bayan kiya - aur Abu Bakr ne sach farmaya - farmaya: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: koi shakhs aisa nahin jo gunah kare aur wuzu kare aur use khoob achhi tarah kare. Mis'ar ne farmaya: phir woh namaz parhe. Aur Sufyan ne farmaya: phir woh do rak'atein namaz parhe aur Allah se maghfirat mange, magar use bakhsh diya jata hai."
"5","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sa'd ibn Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi ne hum se bayan kiya: mere bhai Abdullah ibn Sa'id ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne dada Abu Sa'id al-Maqburi se, ke unhon ne Ali ibn Abi Talib ko farmate hue suna: mujhe koi rawi aisi hadith bayan nahin karta jo main ne khud Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se na suni ho magar main use hukm deta ke Allah ki qasam khaye ke us ne use Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suna hai - siwaye Abu Bakr ke, kyunke unhon ne kabhi jhoot nahin bola. Phir Abu Bakr ne mujhe bayan kiya ke unhon ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: koi banda aisa nahin jo apne kiye hue gunah ka zikr kare, phir jab use woh gunah yaad aaye khara ho, wuzu kare aur use khoob achhi tarah kare, phir do rak'atein namaz parhe, phir us gunah ke liye Allah se maghfirat mange, magar Woh use bakhsh deta hai."
"6","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya: al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Murra se, Abu al-Bakhtari se, Abu Barza se, unhon ne farmaya: main Abu Bakr al-Siddiq ke paas se guzra jabke woh apne sathiyon mein se ek par ghusse mein the, aur main ne farmaya: ae Rasulullah ke Khalifa, ye kaun hai jis par aap ghusse mein hain? Unhon ne farmaya: tumhein us se kya gharz? Main ne farmaya: main us ki gardan maar dunga. Unhon ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, jo main ne kaha us ne un ka ghussa door kar diya. Phir unhon ne farmaya: ye Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke baad kisi ke liye nahin tha."
"7","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abd al-Rahman ibn Ziyad al-Rassasi ne hum se bayan kiya: Shu'ba ne hum se bayan kiya: Yazid ibn Khumayr ne mujhe khabar di, farmaya: main ne Sulaym ibn Amir - Himyar ke ek shakhs - ko Awsat ibn Isma'il ibn Awsat al-Bajali se, Abu Bakr se bayan karte hue suna, ke unhon ne use suna, jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam wafaat pa gaye, farmate hue: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam pichhle saal meri is jagah par khare hue, phir roye aur farmaya: sachchai ko thaame raho, kyunke woh neki ke sath hai, aur dono Jannat mein hain; aur jhoot se bacho, kyunke woh burai ke sath hai, aur dono Aag mein hain; aur Allah se aafiyat mango, kyunke yaqeen ke baad kisi bande ko aafiyat se behtar koi cheez nahin di gayi. Unhon ne farmaya: aur qata ta'alluq na karo, aur ek dusre se munh na phero, aur ek dusre se bughz na rakho, aur ek dusre se hasad na karo, aur Allah ke bande bhai bhai ban jao."
"8","Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se Umar ibn al-Khattab Razi Allahu Anhu ki marviyat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ibn Uyayna ne hum se bayan kiya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya: main ne Abu Ubayd ko farmate hue suna: main Umar ibn al-Khattab ke sath Eid mein hazir hua, aur unhon ne khutbe se pehle namaz se aaghaz kiya aur farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne in do dinon mein roza rakhne se mana farmaya: Fitr ka din aur Adha ka din. Raha Fitr ka din to woh tumhare roze se iftar ka din hai, aur raha Adha ka din to us mein apni qurbaniyon ke gosht mein se khao. Phir main Uthman ibn Affan ke sath Eid mein hazir hua, aur woh Jumu'a ke din aayi, aur unhon ne khutbe se pehle namaz se aaghaz kiya, phir farmaya: ye aisa din hai jis mein Musalmanon ke liye do Eidein jama ho gayi hain, to jo yahan al-Awali walon mein se ho aur jana chahe to hum ne use ijazat di, aur jo rehna chahe to rahe. Phir main Ali ibn Abi Talib ke sath Eid mein hazir hua, aur unhon ne khutbe se pehle namaz se aaghaz kiya aur farmaya: koi shakhs apni qurbani ke gosht mein se teen din ke baad na khaye. Abu Bakr al-Humaydi ne farmaya: main ne Sufyan se kaha: woh Ali ibn Abi Talib se is aakhri qaul ko marfu'an bayan karte hain. Sufyan ne farmaya: main use Nabi tak marfu' hone ke taur par yaad nahin rakhta, aur ye mansukh hai."
"9","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Asim al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya: main ne Abdullah ibn Sarjis ko farmate hue suna: main ne ganje Umar ibn al-Khattab ko dekha ke woh Hajar-e-Aswad ke paas aaye aur use bosa diya, phir farmaya: Allah ki qasam, main janta hun ke tu ek patthar hai jo na nuqsan pahunchata hai aur na faida deta hai, aur agar main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko tujhe bosa dete hue na dekha hota to main tujhe bosa na deta."
"10","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Yahya ibn Subayh al-Khurasani ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Ma'dan ibn Abi Talha al-Ya'mari se, Umar ibn al-Khattab se, ke unhon ne farmaya: mera khayal hai ke tum do darakht khate ho - yani do gandi - pyaaz aur lehsan; agar tumhein aisa karna hi ho to pakane se unhein maar do, phir unhein khao, kyunke main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha, jab unhon ne kisi shakhs par un ki bu payi to unhon ne hukm diya ke use al-Baqi' ki taraf nikal diya jaye."
"11","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko Umar ibn al-Khattab se isi ki manind Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se riwayat karte hue suna, siwa is ke ke Husayn ne Ma'dan ka zikr nahin kiya."
"12","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, pehle qabl is ke ke hum al-Zuhri se mile, Ibn Shihab al-Zuhri se, Malik ibn Aws ibn al-Hadathan se, unhon ne farmaya: Main sau dinar le kar sarf ke liye aaya, aur Talha ne kaha: Hamare paas sarf hai; intezar karo yahan tak ke hamara khazanchi al-Ghaba se aa jaye, aur us ne mujh se sau dinar le liye, phir Umar ne mujh se farmaya: Use na chhorna, kyun ke maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Sona chandi ke badle riba hai magar dast ba dast, gehun gehun ke badle riba hai magar dast ba dast, jau jau ke badle riba hai magar dast ba dast, aur khajoor khajoor ke badle riba hai magar dast ba dast, phir jab al-Zuhri aaye to unhon ne is tamheedi waqia ka zikr nahin kiya, aur maine al-Zuhri ko farmate hue suna: Maine Malik ibn Aws ibn al-Hadathan al-Nasri ko farmate hue suna: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko farmate hue suna: Maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Sona chandi ke badle riba hai magar dast ba dast, gehun gehun ke badle riba hai magar dast ba dast, jau jau ke badle riba hai magar dast ba dast, aur khajoor khajoor ke badle riba hai magar dast ba dast, Al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur ye Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se is mauzu par sab se sahih riwayat karda hadith hai, yani sarf ke bare mein."
"13","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Tawus ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Umar ibn al-Khattab ko khabar pahunchi ke Samura ne sharab farokht ki, to unhon ne farmaya: Allah Samura ko halak kare; kya use maloom nahin ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Yahud par la'nat farmayi; charbiyan un par haram ki gayin, to unhon ne unhein pighlaya aur farokht kiya, yani unhon ne unhein hal kiya."
"14","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ibn Uyayna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mis'ar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Fulan ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko minbar par farmate hue dekha jabke un ka hath minbar par is tarah tha, yani use daayen aur baayen harkat dete hue: Iraq mein hamara ek mamuli karkun, Iraq mein hamara ek mamuli karkun, Musalmanon ke fay' mein sharab aur khinzeeron ki qeematein mila raha hai, halanke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Yahud par la'nat farmayi; charbiyan un par haram ki gayin, to unhon ne unhein pighlaya aur farokht kiya, yani unhon ne unhein hal kiya."
"15","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Malik ibn Anas ko Zayd ibn Aslam se sawal karte hue suna, aur Zayd ne farmaya: Maine apne walid ko farmate hue suna: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne farmaya: Maine Allah ki rah mein ek ghora diya, phir maine use farokht hote hue dekha, to maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se daryaft kiya: Kya main use khareed lun, Aap ne farmaya: Use mat khareedo, aur apne sadqe se ruju mat karo."
"16","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani se, Ibn Sirin se, Umar ibn al-Khattab se isi tarah, siwa is ke ke unhon ne farmaya: Unhon ne use farokht hote hue dekha, ya us ki nasal mein se kuch ko."
"17","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Asim ibn Ubaydillah al-Umari ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Amir ibn Rabi'a se, un ke walid se, Umar ibn al-Khattab se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hajj aur Umra ke darmiyan paiham amal karo, kyun ke in dono ke darmiyan paiham amal umr mein izafa karta hai aur ghurbat aur gunahon ko door karta hai, jaise dhamonki mail ko door karti hai, Sufyan ne farmaya: Abd al-Karim al-Jazari ne hum se ye hadith Abda se, Asim se bayan ki, phir jab Abda tashreef laye to hum un ke paas is ke bare mein daryaft karne ke liye gaye, aur unhon ne farmaya: Asim ne sirf mujh se ye riwayat ki hai, aur ye Asim maujood hain, to hum Asim ke paas gaye aur un se is ke bare mein daryaft kiya, aur unhon ne hum se is tarah bayan kiya, phir maine us ke baad un se ise suna, kabhi wo use Umar par mauqoof karte aur us mein un ke walid ka zikr nahin karte, lekin aksar auqat wo ise Abdullah ibn Amir se, un ke walid se, Umar se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se riwayat karte, Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur kabhi hum is jumle umr mein izafa karta hai par khamosh rehte aur ise bayan nahin karte, in logon ke jhagde ke khauf se yani Qadariyya, halanke un ke liye is mein koi daleel nahin hai."
"18","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Abda ibn Abi Lubaba ne hum se bayan kiya hum ne ise un se ek se zyada martaba yaad kiya unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abu Wa'il Shaqiq ibn Salama ko aksar farmate hue suna: Masruq aur main al-Subayy ibn Ma'bad ke paas is hadith ko un ke sath tazkira karne ke liye gaye, aur al-Subayy ne farmaya: Main ek Eisai shakhs tha, phir main Musalman hua aur Hajj ka irada karke rawana hua, jab main al-Qadisiyya mein tha to maine Hajj aur Umra ka ikattha ehram bandha, aur Salman ibn Rabi'a aur Zayd ibn Suhan ne mujhe suna aur farmaya: Ye apne ghar ke oont se zyada gumrah hai, goya un donon ke do kalimon se mujh par pahar rakh diya gaya, phir main Umar ibn al-Khattab se mila aur unhein ittila di, aur wo un donon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur unhein malamat ki, phir meri taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Tum apne Nabi ki Sunnat ki taraf hidayat diye gaye ho, tum apne Nabi ki Sunnat ki taraf hidayat diye gaye ho, Sufyan ne farmaya: Yani is liye ke unhon ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Hajj aur Umra ko jama kiya tha aur Aap ne is ki ijazat di thi, ye nahin ke Aap ne khud ise kiya tha."
"19","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Walid ibn Muslim aur Bishr ibn Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Awza'i ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Yahya ibn Abi Kathir ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ikrima, Ibn Abbas ke aazad karda ghulam, ne mujh se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko farmate hue suna: Maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Wadi al-Aqiq mein farmate hue suna: Aaj raat mere Rabb ki taraf se ek aane wala mere paas aaya aur farmaya: Is mubarak wadi mein namaz parho aur kaho: Hajj ke andar ek Umra."
"20","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Asim ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab ko apne walid se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab raat idhar se aa jaye, aur din idhar se chala jaye, aur suraj ghuroob ho jaye, to rozedar ne iftar kar liya."
"21","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar aur dusron se, Al-Zuhri se, Al-Sa'ib ibn Yazid se, Huwaytib ibn Abd al-Uzza se, Ibn al-Sa'di se: ke wo Syria se Umar ibn al-Khattab ke paas aaye, aur Umar ne un se farmaya: Kya mujhe ye khabar nahi di gayi ke tum Musalmanon ke kuch kaamon ki khidmat sar-anjam dete ho aur tumhein tumhari ujrat di jati hai lekin tum use qubool nahi karte? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; mere paas ghore aur ghulam hain, aur main khush-haal hun, aur main chahta hun ke mera kaam Musalmanon ke liye sadqa ho. To Umar ne farmaya: Aisa na karo, kyunke maine bhi wahi irada kiya tha jo tumne irada kiya, aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mujhe atiye diya karte the, to main kehta: Ise mujh se zyada muhtaj ko de dijiye; aur ek martaba unhon ne mujhe maal diya, to maine kaha: Ise mujh se zyada muhtaj ko de dijiye. To unhon ne farmaya: Aye Umar, is maal me se jo kuch Allah tumhein baghair mange aur baghair nafs ke khwahish ke pahunchaye, use le lo, us se maal banao aur us me se sadqa do; aur jo is ke siwa ho, us ke peeche apne nafs ko na lagao."
"22","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar aur Ma'mar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, ke unhon ne Malik ibn Aws ibn al-Hadathan ko kehte hue suna: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko kehte hue suna: Banu al-Nadir ka maal us me se tha jo Allah ne Apne Rasool ko fay ke taur par ata farmaya, jis par Musalmanon ne na ghore daudaye aur na oont, to wo khaas Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ka tha; aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam us me se apne ghar walon par ek saal ka kharch kharch karte the, aur jo baqi rehta use Allah ke raste me tayyari ke taur par ghoron aur hathiyaron me lagate the. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Aur Sufyan ne is hadith me sirf yahi kaha: wo us me se ek saal ka kharch rok rakhte the."
"23","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Abu al-Ajfa al-Sulami se, jinhon ne kaha: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko kehte hue suna: Khabardar, aurton ke mehar na badhao, kyunke agar ye duniya me izzat ya Allah ke nazdeek taqwa hota, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam tum me se is ke sab se zyada mustahiq hote; main nahi janta ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apni kisi biwi se nikah kiya ho ya apni kisi beti ka nikah kiya ho barah uqiyya se zyada par; phir bhi aaj tum me se koi aurat ka mehar badhata hai hatta ke wo us ke apne nafs me dushmani ban jata hai, aur wo kehta hai: Maine tumhare liye mashkize ka tasma uthane ki mashaqqat uthayi. Unhon ne kaha: Main kam-umr ladka tha aur nahi janta tha ke mashkize ka tasma kya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur ek aur baat tum kehte ho un me se jo tumhare in lashkaron me qatl kiye jate hain: Fulan shaheed qatl hua, ya fulan shaheed faut hua, halanke shayad us ne apni sawari ke pehlu ya pichhle hisse par tijarat chahte hue sona ya chandi lada ho; to aisa na kaho, balke waisa kaho jaisa Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya - ya jaisa Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke raste me qatl kiya jaye wo Jannat me hai. Sufyan ne farmaya: Ayyub hamesha is tarah shak karte the, aur Sufyan ne farmaya: Agar Hammad ibn Zayd ne is tarah bayan kiya to khoob, warna ye mehfooz nahi hua."
"24","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ubaydullah ibn Abi Yazid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne hamare muhalle ke Banu Zuhra ke ek budhe aadmi ko bulaya jo zamana-e-jahiliyyat ko pa chuka tha, aur main us budhe ke sath Umar ke paas aaya jabke wo Al-Hijr me the; Umar ne un se zamana-e-jahiliyyat ke bachon ke bare me pucha, to budhe ne kaha: Raha nutfa, to wo fulan se hai, aur raha bachcha, to wo fulan ke bistar par hai. To Umar ne farmaya: Tumne sach kaha, lekin Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne bistar ke haq me faisla farmaya. Phir jab budha chala gaya, Umar ne use bulaya aur farmaya: Mujhe Ka'ba ki tameer ke bare me khabar do. Unhon ne kaha: Quraysh ne Ka'ba ki tameer ke liye quwwat jama ki lekin kami reh gayi aur aajiz rahe, to unhon ne us ka kuch hissa Al-Hijr me chhod diya. To Umar ne farmaya: Tumne sach kaha."
"25","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ma'mar ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba se, Ibn Abbas se, jinhon ne kaha: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko mimbar par kehte hue suna: Allah ne Muhammad ko haq ke sath bheja aur un par Kitab nazil farmayi, aur jo kuch un par nazil farmaya gaya us me se rajm ki ayat thi; to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne rajm farmaya, aur humne un ke baad rajm kiya. Sufyan ne farmaya: Maine ye Al-Zuhri se taveel tor par suna aur us me se kuch cheezen yaad kin, aur ye us me se hai jo maine us din us me se yaad nahi kiya tha."
"26","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Al-Zuhri ke paas Ibn al-Jawwaz ke ghar me aaye, to unhon ne kaha: Agar tum chaho to main tumhein bees hadeesen bayan karun, aur agar tum chaho to tumhein Al-Saqifa ki hadith bayan karun; aur main logon me sab se chhota tha, aur maine chaha ke wo use us ki tawalat ki wajah se bayan na karen; lekin logon ne kaha: Humain Al-Saqifa ki hadith bayan kijiye. To Al-Zuhri ne hum se use bayan kiya, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Mas'ud se, Ibn Abbas se, Umar se, aur maine us me se kuch cheezen yaad kin; phir Ma'mar ne us ka baqi hissa mujhe baad me bayan kiya."
"27","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Al-Zuhri ko kehte hue suna: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, ke unhon ne Umar ibn al-Khattab ko mimbar par kehte hue suna: Maine Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Meri had se zyada badha-chadha kar tareef na karo jaise Isaaiyon ne Ibn-e-Maryam ki had se zyada tareef ki; main sirf Us ka banda hun, to kaho: Us ka banda aur Us ka Rasool."
"28","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad ibn Ibrahim al-Taymi ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Alqama ibn Waqqas al-Laythi ko kehte hue suna: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko mimbar par Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se ye riwayat karte hue suna, kehte hue: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Aamaal sirf niyyaton se hain, aur har aadmi ke liye wahi hai jo us ne niyyat ki; to jis ki hijrat Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki taraf thi, us ki hijrat Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki taraf hai, aur jis ki hijrat duniyawi faide ke liye thi jise wo pata hai ya kisi aurat ke liye thi jis se wo nikah karta hai, us ki hijrat usi ki taraf hai jis ki taraf us ne hijrat ki."
"29","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Yahya ibn Subayh al-Khurasani ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Ma'dan ibn Abi Talha al-Ya'mari se, Umar ibn al-Khattab se, ke unhon ne mimbar par farmaya: Maine khwab me dekha goya ek murgh ne mujhe teen martaba thonga, ya teen thongen marien; aur maine kaha: ek ghair-Arab; aur maine apne baad ye muamla in chhe afrad ko saunp diya hai jin se Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam is haal me wafaat pa gaye ke wo un se raazi the: Uthman, Ali, Al-Zubayr, Talha, Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf, aur Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas; to jo bhi khalifa muqarrar kiya jaye, wahi khalifa hai."
"30","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Asim ibn Kulayb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Jab Umar ibn al-Khattab koi namaz padhte to logon ke liye baithte; jis ki koi hajat hoti wo un se baat karta, aur agar kisi ki koi hajat na hoti to wo khade hote aur andar dakhil ho jate. Phir unhon ne kuch namazen padhin jin me wo logon ke liye na baithe. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: To main darwaze par hazir hua aur maine kaha: Aye Yarfa, kya Ameer al-Mu'minin beemar hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ameer al-Mu'minin ko koi shikayat nahi. To main baith gaya, phir Uthman ibn Affan aaye aur baithe; phir Yarfa bahar aaye aur unhon ne kaha: Khade ho, Aye Ibn Affan; khade ho, Aye Ibn Abbas. To hum Umar ke paas dakhil hue, aur un ke samne maal ke dher the, har dher par ek dhampne wala kapda tha; aur Umar ne farmaya: Maine Madina ke logon me dekha aur tum donon ko qabile ke lihaz se sab se bade paya, to ye maal lo aur ise taqseem karo, aur jo zayed ho use wapas kar do. Raha Uthman, to unhon ne lap bhar kar uthaya, aur raha main, to main ghutnon ke bal baitha aur maine kaha: Aur agar kami reh jaye, to kya tum hamari taraf se use pura karoge? To Umar ne farmaya: Sanglakh pahad se ek kankar - yani pahad se ek pathar - kya ye Allah ke paas na tha jab Muhammad aur un ke sahabi khushk gosht khate the? Maine kaha: Haan beshak, Allah ki qasam, ye Allah ke paas tha jabke Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam zinda the, aur agar ye un ke liye khol diya jata to wo us ke sath wo karte jo tum karte ho us ke siwa kuch aur karte. Unhon ne kaha: To Umar ghussa hue aur farmaya: To wo kya karte? Maine kaha: To wo khate aur humain khilate. Unhon ne kaha: To Umar is qadar roye ke un ki pasliyan kanpne lagin, phir farmaya: Meri khwahish hai ke main ise barabar chhod jaun, na mere haq me na mere khilaf."
"31","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mis'ar aur digar se, Qays ibn Muslim se, Tariq ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Ek Yahudi aadmi ne Umar ibn al-Khattab se kaha: Agar ye ayat hum par nazil hoti, Aaj Main ne tumhare liye tumhara deen mukammal kar diya aur tum par apni nemat tamam kar di aur tumhare liye Islam ko deen ki haisiyat se pasand kar liya, to hum us din ko eid bana lete, to Umar ne farmaya: Main janta hun ye ayat kis din nazil hui; ye Arafa ke din, Juma ke din nazil hui."
"32","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Labid se, Ibn Sulayman ibn Yasar se, un ke walid se, Umar ibn al-Khattab se: ke unhon ne al-Jabiya me logon se khutba diya aur farmaya: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam humare darmiyan khade hue jaise main tumhare darmiyan khada hun, aur farmaya: Mere sahaba ki izzat karo, phir un ki jo un ke baad aayen, phir un ki jo un ke baad aayen; phir jhoot phail jayega, yahan tak ke aadmi gawahi dega halanke us se gawahi talab nahi ki gayi hogi, aur qasam khayega halanke us se qasam talab nahi ki gayi hogi; khabardar, koi mard kisi aurat ke sath tanhai me na rahe, kyunke un me teesra shaitan hota hai; khabardar, jo Jannat ki naimaton se khush hona chahe to jamaat ko lazmi pakde, kyunke shaitan akele ke sath hota hai aur do se zyada door hota hai; khabardar, jo apni neki se khush ho aur apni burai se ghamgeen ho to woh momin hai."
"33","Uthman ibn Affan Raziallahu Anhu ki riwayaat; Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ayyub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Nubayh ibn Wahb al-Hajabi ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Aban ibn Uthman ibn Affan se suna, woh apne walid se riwayat karte the ke Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ehram wala na nikah kare aur na paigham-e-nikah de."
"34","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Ayyub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Nubayh ibn Wahb ne mujhe khabar di, farmaya: Umar ibn Ubaydillah ibn Ma'mar ne Malal me halat-e-ehram me apni aankhon ki shikayat ki, to unhon ne Aban ibn Uthman ibn Affan ki taraf paigham bheja ke woh un se poochen ke woh is ka ilaj kis se karen; aur Aban ibn Uthman ne un se kaha: In par sabr (aloes) se patti bandho, kyunke main ne Uthman ibn Affan se suna, woh Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se riwayat karte the, ke Aap ne farmaya: Woh is par sabr se patti bandhe."
"35","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Humran jo Uthman ke azaad karda ghulam hain, se, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ne maqaid par teen martaba teen teen bar wuzu kiya, aur farmaya: Isi tarah main ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko wuzu karte dekha; phir unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs bhi wuzu kare aur achhi tarah wuzu kare, phir namaz parhe, magar Allah us ke liye is namaz aur agli namaz tak ke darmiyani gunahon ko bakhsh deta hai, yahan tak ke woh use parh le."
"36","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu Sa'id jo Banu Hashim ke azaad karda hain, ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ikrima ibn Ibrahim ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhu'bab se, un ke walid se, Uthman ibn Affan Raziallahu Anhu se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Unhon ne Mina walon ke sath char rakat namaz parhai, aur logon ne is ko napasand kiya; to unhon ne farmaya: Jab main yahan aaya to main ne yahan biwi bana li, aur main ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jab koi aadmi kisi sarzameen me biwi bana le to use wahan muqeem ki namaz parhni chahiye."
"37","Ali ibn Abi Talib Raziallahu Anhu ki riwayaat; Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Hasan aur Abdullah jo Muhammad ibn Ali ke dono bete hain, ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, ke Ali Raziallahu Anhu ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu Anhuma se farmaya: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Khaybar ke mauqe par muta nikah aur gharailu gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya; Sufyan ne farmaya: Matlab unhon ne Khaybar ke mauqe par gharailu gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya, is se muta nikah murad nahi liya."
"38","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abdullah ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe us shakhs ne khabar di jis ne Ali Raziallahu Anhu ko farmate hue suna: Main ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se un ki sahabzadi ke liye paigham-e-nikah ka irada kiya, phir mujhe yaad aaya ke mere pas kuch nahi hai; phir mujhe Aap ki narmi aur sakhawat yaad aayi, to main ne un se paigham kiya; Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Kya tumhare pas use dene ke liye kuch hai? Main ne kaha: Nahi; Aap ne farmaya: Phir tumhari Hutami zirah kahan hai jo main ne tumhen falan din di thi? Main ne kaha: Woh mere pas hai; Aap ne farmaya: Phir use le aao; farmaya: To main use le aaya aur Aap ko de di, aur Aap ne un ka nikah mujh se kar diya; phir jab Aap unhen mere pas le aaye to farmaya: Kuch na karna yahan tak ke main tumhare pas aaun; phir Aap humare pas tashreef laye jabke hum par ek chadar ya kambal tha; jab hum ne Aap ko dekha to hum us me simat gaye, aur Aap ne farmaya: Apni jagah raho; phir Aap ne pani ka bartan mangwaya, us me dua farmayi, phir use hum par chhidka; main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya woh Aap ko mujh se zyada mehboob hain ya main? Aap ne farmaya: Woh mujhe tum se zyada mehboob hain, aur tum mujhe un se zyada azeez ho."
"39","Abu Ali al-Sawwaf ne farmaya: Ibrahim ibn Abdullah al-Basri ne hum se bayan kiya: Ibrahim ibn Bashshar al-Ramadi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ibn Uyayna ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Najih se, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe us shakhs ne khabar di jis ne Ali ibn Abi Talib ko Kufa ke minbar par suna, aur unhon ne is ke mafhoom ka zikr kiya."
"40","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ata ibn Abi Rabah ne mujhe khabar di, farmaya: Main ne A'ish ibn Anas ko suna, kehte the: Main ne Ali ibn Abi Talib ko Kufa ke minbar par farmate hue suna: Mujhe mazi se bahut takleef hoti thi, aur main Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se poochna chahta tha, magar Aap ki sahabzadi mere nikah me thin, to mujhe Aap se poochte hue sharm aayi; to main ne Ammar ko hukm diya aur unhon ne Aap se poocha, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ke liye sirf wuzu hi kafi hai."
"41","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Mutarrif ibn Tarif ne hum se bayan kiya: main ne al-Sha'bi ko kehte hue suna: Abu Juhayfa ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: main ne Ali ibn Abi Talib se kaha: kya tumhare paas Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki taraf se Quran ke siwa kuch hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, us Zaat ki qasam jis ne dane ko phara aur jaan ko paida kiya, magar ye ke Allah apne bande ko Apni Kitab ki samajh ata farmaye, ya jo us tehreeri saheefe mein hai. Main ne kaha: aur us saheefe mein kya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: diyat, qaidi ko azaad karana, aur ye ke koi Musalman kisi kafir ke badle qatl na kiya jaye."
"42","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Abd al-Karim al-Jazari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Mujahid ko suna: main ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla ko kehte hue suna: main ne Ali ibn Abi Talib ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujhe apne qurbani ke oonton ki dekh bhaal ka hukm farmaya, un ke jhol aur khaalen taqseem karne ka, aur qassab ko un mein se kuch na dene ka, farmate hue: hum use apni taraf se ujrat denge."
"43","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Ali ibn Abi Talib se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujhe apne qurbani ke oonton ki dekh bhaal ka hukm farmaya aur un ke jhol aur khaalen taqseem karne ka. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Sufyan ne kaha: Ibn Abi Najih ne mujhe is se zyada kuch bayan na kiya, lekin Abd al-Karim ne hum se is se zyada mukammal bayan kiya."
"44","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Ubaydullah ibn Abi Yazid ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Mujahid ko kehte hue suna: main ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla ko Ali ibn Abi Talib se riwayat karte hue suna ke Fatima, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki beti, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas khadim mangne aain. To Aap ne farmaya: kya main tumhen us cheez ki khabar na dun jo tumhare liye is se behtar hai? Apne bistar par sote waqt Allah ki tasbih taintees martaba karo, Allah ki hamd taintees martaba karo, aur Allah ki takbir chautis martaba karo. Phir Sufyan ne kaha: un mein se ek taintees hai aur ek chautis hai. Ali ne kaha: jab se main ne ise Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suna hai main ne ise kabhi tark na kiya. Logon ne un se kaha: Siffin ki raat bhi nahin? Unhon ne farmaya: Siffin ki raat bhi nahin."
"45","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Ata ibn al-Sa'ib ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ali ibn Abi Talib Raziallahu Anhu se ke Fatima Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas khadim mangne aain, to Aap ne farmaya: main tumhen khadim nahin dunga jabke Ahl al-Suffa ko bhook se pet liptaye hue chhor dun. Kya main tumhen us cheez ki khabar na dun jo tumhare liye is se behtar hai? Phir unhon ne Ubaydullah ki pehli hadees ki manind akhir tak zikr kiya."
"46","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, us se jis ne un se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdullah ibn Utba ne un se kaha: Siffin ki raat bhi nahin? Unhon ne farmaya: Siffin ki raat bhi nahin; mujhe raat ke akhri hisse mein yaad aaya."
"47","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne al-Qasim ibn Mukhaymira ko Shurayh ibn Hani se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: main ne A'isha se khuffon par masah ke bare mein pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Abi Talib ke paas jao aur un se pucho, kyunke wo Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke hamrah jangon par nikla karte the. To main ne Ali se pucha to unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam farmate hain: muqeem ke liye ek din aur ek raat, aur musafir ke liye teen din aur un ki raaten."
"48","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Sawda Amr al-Nahdi ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Abd Khayr se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Ali ibn Abi Talib ko apne dono paon ki upari satah par masah karte dekha, farmate hue: agar main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko un ki upari satah par masah karte na dekha hota to main samajhta ke un ki nichli satah zyada haqdar hai. Abu Bakr ne kaha: agar ye khuffon par tha to sunnat hai, aur agar khuffon ke siwa par tha to mansukh hai."
"49","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq al-Hamdani ne mujh se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Yuthay' se, unhon ne kaha: hum ne Ali se pucha: Hajj mein tumhen kis cheez ke sath bheja gaya tha? Unhon ne kaha: mujhe chaar cheezon ke sath bheja gaya tha: Jannat mein koi jaan dakhil na hogi magar momin jaan; koi nangaa shakhs Baitullah ka tawaf na karega; is saal ke baad Masjid-e-Haram mein koi Musalman aur koi mushrik jamaa na honge; aur jis ka Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke darmiyan ahad tha us ka ahad apni muddat tak qaim hai, aur jis ka koi ahad na tha us ki mohlat chaar mahine hai."
"50","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya: al-Hasan ibn Muhammad ibn Ali ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ubaydullah ibn Abi Rafi', Ali ibn Abi Talib ke katib, ko kehte hue suna: main ne Ali ibn Abi Talib ko suna: Muhammad, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujhe bheja, mujhe khud, al-Zubayr aur al-Miqdad ko, farmate hue: jao yahan tak ke Rawdat Khakh tak pahuncho; wahan ek musafir aurat hai jis ke paas ek khat hai, to use us se le lo. To hum nikle, hamare ghore hamen daurate hue le gaye, yahan tak ke hum bagh tak pahunche, aur wahan wo musafir aurat thi; hum ne kaha: khat nikalo. Us ne kaha: mere paas koi khat nahin hai. Hum ne kaha: tum khat zaroor nikalogi warna hum kapre utar denge. To us ne use apni chotiyon se nikala, aur hum Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaye, aur us mein tha: Hatib ibn Abi Balta'a ki taraf se Makkah mein maujud mushrikeen mein se kuch logon ki taraf, unhen Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke maamle ki kuch khabar dete hue. To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Hatib, ye kya hai? Hatib ne kaha: Ae Rasool Allah, mere khilaf jaldi na farmayen, kyunke main Quraysh se wabasta aadmi tha, un mein se na tha; aur Aap ke sath Muhajireen mein se rishtedar the jin ke zariye wo Makkah mein apne ghar walon aur maal ki hifazat karte the, to jabke mujhe un mein aisa nasab hasil na tha, main ne chaha ke un par ek ehsan lun jis ke zariye wo mere rishtedaron ki hifazat karen; aur main ne ye kufr ki wajah se na kiya, na apne deen se irtidad ki wajah se, aur na Islam ke baad kufr par razi hone ki wajah se. To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: us ne tumhen sach kaha hai. Phir Umar ne kaha: Ae Rasool Allah, mujhe is munafiq ki gardan marne den. To Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: is ne Badr mein hazri di hai; aur tum kya jano, shayad Allah ne Ahl-e-Badr par nazar farmai aur farmaya: jo chaho karo, pas main ne tumhen bakhsh diya hai. Amr ibn Dinar ne kaha: aur us ke bare mein nazil hua: Ae iman walo, Mere dushman aur apne dushman ko dost na banao, aayat. Sufyan ne kaha: main nahin janta ke aya ye hadees mein hai ya Amr ibn Dinar ka qaul hai."
"51","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Layth ibn Abi Sulaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abu Ma'mar Abdullah ibn Sakhbara al-Azdi se, unhon ne farmaya: Wo Ali ibn Abi Talib ke sath thay ke ek janaza un ke pas se guzra to wo us ke liye kharay ho gaye, to Ali ne farmaya: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Abu Musa al-Ash'ari ne is ka hukm diya hai, to Ali ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam sirf ek martaba kharay hue phir dohraya nahi."
"52","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Sa'id se, Waqid ibn Amr se, Nafi' ibn Jubayr se, Mas'ud ibn al-Hakam se, Ali se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam sirf ek martaba kharay hue phir dohraya nahi. Abu Bakr al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Aur Sufyan kabhi hamein Ibn Abi Najih aur Layth se, Mujahid se, Abu Ma'mar se bayan karte thay, aur jab hum is par un par zor dalte to wo Ibn Abi Najih ki hadith me Abu Ma'mar ko dakhil kar lete, halanke wo hum se bayan kiya na kehte magar jab un me se har ek ne hum se bayan kiya kaha ho."
"53","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Asim ibn Kulayb ne hum se bayan kiya: unhon ne ise Ibn Abi Musa se suna, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Ali se suna - aur unhon ne Abu Musa ko bheja tha aur unhein apni kisi hajat ka hukm diya tha - aur Ali ne un se farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Aye Ali, Allah se hidayat aur istiqamat mango, aur hidayat se raste ki hidayat murad lo aur istiqamat se teer ka tumhara nishana lagana murad lo. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujhe qassi resham aur surkh zin-posh se mana farmaya, aur ke me apni anguthi is me ya is me pehnun - shahadat aur darmiyani ungliyon ki taraf ishara karte hue. Al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Aur Sufyan ise Asim ibn Kulayb se, Abu Bakr ibn Abi Musa se riwayat karte thay, phir un se kaha gaya: Log to ise sirf Abu Burda se riwayat karte hain. To unhon ne farmaya: Jo maine yaad kiya hai wo Abu Bakr se hai, lekin agar log is me mujh se ikhtilaf karein to ise Ibn Abi Musa se qarar do. To is ke baad Sufyan kabhi Ibn Abi Musa se kehte aur kabhi bhool jate aur jaisa suna tha waisa hi Abu Bakr se bayan karte."
"54","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Abd al-Malik ibn A'yan ne hum se bayan kiya: unhon ne ise Abu Harb ibn Abi al-Aswad al-Dili se suna jo apne walid se riwayat karte thay, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Ali ko farmate hue suna: Abdullah ibn Salam mere pas aaye jab main ne rikab me apna paon rakh liya tha, aur mujh se farmaya: Tumhara rukh kidhar hai? Maine kaha: Iraq ki taraf. Unhon ne farmaya: Agar tum wahan gaye to wahan tum par talwar ki dhaar lagegi. To Ali ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko is se pehle ye farmate hue suna tha. Phir Abu Harb ne farmaya: Maine apne walid ko farmate hue suna: Mujhe un par ta'ajjub hua, kehte hue: Ek jangju apne bare me aisi baat riwayat karta hai."
"55","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Harith se, Ali se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhein ghoron aur ghulamon ke sadqe se muaf kar diya hai."
"56","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Harith se, Ali se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne faisala farmaya ke ek maan wale sagay bhai waris honge, mukhtalif maon wale bhaiyon ko chhor kar."
"57","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Harith se, Ali ibn Abi Talib se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne faisala farmaya ke qarz wasiyyat se muqaddam hai, jabke tum qarz se pehle wasiyyat parhte ho."
"58","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mis'ar, Ibn Abi Layla aur Shu'ba se, Amr ibn Murra se, Abdullah ibn Salima se, Ali se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko janabat ke siwa koi cheez Quran ki tilawat se nahi rokti thi."
"59","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Yahya ibn Isa ne hum se bayan kiya: al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya: Adi ibn Thabit ne hum se bayan kiya, Zirr ibn Hubaysh se, unhon ne farmaya: Ali ibn Abi Talib ne farmaya: Ummi Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se ahd liya: Tum se momin ke siwa koi mohabbat nahi karega aur munafiq ke siwa koi tum se bugz nahi rakhega."
"60","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abd al-Malik ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Isma'il ibn Muslim al-Abdi ne mujh se bayan kiya: Abu Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Me apne aaqa Ali ibn Abi Talib ke sath tha jab unhon ne al-Nahrawan walon se jang ki, aur logon ke dilon me un ke qatl par bechaini paida hui, to Ali ne farmaya: Aye logo, Allah ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se bayan farmaya: Log deen se is tarah nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai, phir kabhi is ki taraf nahi lautenge, aur is ki nishani ye hai ke un me ek siyah faam shakhs hoga jiska hath naqis hoga, us ka ek hath aurat ki chhati jaisa hoga jis ki ghundi aurat ki ghundi jaisi hogi. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur mera khayal hai unhon ne farmaya: Us ke gird saat baal honge. Pas use talash karo, kyunke me use inhi me dekhta hun; to unhon ne use nahar ke kinare maqtuleen ke niche paya, aur unhon ne farmaya: Allah aur Us ke Rasul ne sach farmaya. Aur Ali ke pas un ki ek Arabi kaman thi, wo us se us ke naqis hath ko koch rahe thay. Unhon ne farmaya: To jab logon ne use dekha to khush ho gaye aur shadman hue, aur jo kuch unhon ne mehsoos kiya tha wo un se door ho gaya."
"61","Al-Zubayr ibn al-Awwam Radi Allahu Anhu ki riwayaat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqama ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Hatib se, Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr se, unhon ne kaha: al-Zubayr ne kaha: Jab ye nazil hua, Phir tum Qayamat ke Din apne Rab ke huzoor jhagra karoge, to al-Zubayr ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya duniya me jo kuch hamare darmiyan hua us ke baad hum par jhagra dohraya jayega? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. To main ne kaha: Phir to muamla waqai sakht hai."
"62","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Hatib se, Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr se, unhon ne kaha: al-Zubayr ne kaha: Jab ye nazil hua, Phir us Din tum se zaroor nemat ke bare me poocha jayega, to main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, hum se kis nemat ke bare me poocha jayega? Wo to sirf do kali cheezen hain: khajoor aur pani. Aap ne farmaya: Ye to waqai hone wala hai. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Aur Sufyan kabhi yun kehte: al-Zubayr ne kaha, aur kabhi kehte: Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr se, phir kehte: aur al-Zubayr ne kaha."
"63","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Damra Anas ibn Iyad al-Laythi ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqama se, Yahya ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Hatib se, Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr se, al-Zubayr ibn al-Awwam se, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye nazil hua, Phir tum Qayamat ke Din apne Rab ke huzoor jhagra karoge, to al-Zubayr ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya duniya me jo kuch hamare darmiyan hua wo khas gunahon samet hum par dohraya jayega? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, yahan tak ke har haq wale ko us ka haq de diya jayega."
"64","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn al-Harith al-Makhzumi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Insan ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Urwa ibn al-Zubayr se, al-Zubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Layya se aaye yahan tak ke jab hum al-Sidra me the to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam kale pahaad ke kinare us ki taraf rukh karke khade hue, Nakhib ki taraf dekha aur khade rahe yahan tak ke log jama ho gaye; phir farmaya: Wajj ka shikar aur us ke kantedaar darakht Allah ki taraf se haram qarar diya gaya hurmat wala ilaqa hain. Aur ye al-Taif me utarne aur Thaqif ke muhasure se pehle tha."
"65","Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf Radi Allahu Anhu ki riwayaat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Bajala ko kehte hue suna: Umar Majoosiyon se jizya na lete the yahan tak ke Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne gawahi di ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Hajar ke Majoosiyon se jizya liya tha."
"66","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salama ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Raddad bimar hue, aur Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf un ki iyadat ko aaye; aur Abu al-Raddad ne kaha: Mere ilm ke mutabiq un me sab se behtar aur sab se zyada silah rehmi karne wala Abu Muhammad hai. To Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah farmata hai: Main Allah hun aur Main al-Rahman hun; Main ne reham ke rishte ko paida kiya aur us ke liye Apne Naam se ek naam nikala; pas jo use jodega, Main use jodunga, aur jo use katega, Main use kat dunga."
"67","Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas Radi Allahu Anhu ki riwayaat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya: Amir ibn Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Fatah wale saal Makka me ek aisi bimari me bimar hua jis se main maut ke qareeb tha; aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam meri iyadat ke liye mere paas tashreef laye, aur main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, mere paas bahut maal hai aur meri beti ke siwa koi mujh se wirasat nahi pata; kya main apne maal ka do tihai sadqa kar dun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin. Main ne kaha: Phir aadha? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin. Main ne kaha: Phir tihai? Aap ne farmaya: Tihai, aur tihai bahut hai; tum apne warison ko ghani chhodo ye is se behtar hai ke unhen mohtaj chhodo, logon se mangte phiren; aur tum jo kharch bhi kharch karoge us par tumhen ajar diya jayega, yahan tak ke wo luqma bhi jo tum apni biwi ke munh tak uthate ho. Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya main apni hijrat se peeche chhod diya jaunga? Aap ne farmaya: Mere baad tum peeche na rahoge aur Allah ka Chehra chahte hue koi amal karoge magar us se darje aur martabe me badhoge; aur shayed tum mere baad peeche zinda raho pas kuch qaum tum se faida uthaye aur dusre tum se nuqsan uthayen. Ae Allah, mere sahabiyon ke liye un ki hijrat mukammal farma, aur unhen un ki aidiyon par wapas na pher. Lekin badnaseeb Sa'd ibn Khawla - Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us par reham khate hue izhar kiya ke wo Makka me faut hua. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Sa'd ibn Khawla Banu Amir ibn Lu'ayy ka ek aadmi hai."
"68","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Amir ibn Sa'd se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon me Musalmanon ke khilaf jurm me sab se bada wo hai jo kisi aisi baat ke bare me sawal kare jo haram na ki gayi ho, phir wo us ke sawal ki wajah se logon par haram kar di jaye."
"69","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Amir ibn Sa'd se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek taqseem taqseem ki, aur main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, falan ko dijiye, kyunke wo momin hai. To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ya Musalman. Phir farmaya: Main ek aadmi ko deta hun jabke dusra mujhe us se zyada pyara hota hai, is khauf se ke Allah use Aag me aundha gira de."
"70","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Razzaq se, Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se, Amir ibn Sa'd se, un ke walid se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, is hadith ki manind, us me ye izafa karte hue: al-Zuhri ne kaha: Pas hum Islam ko kalma samajhte hain, aur iman ko aamal samajhte hain."
"71","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan ibn Muawiya Al-Fazari aur Abu Damra ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hashim ibn Hashim ibn Utba ibn Abi Waqqas ne hum se bayan kiya, Amir ibn Sad se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs subah ko saat Ajwa khajooren kha le, us din use na zeher nuqsan dega aur na jadu."
"72","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Zayd ibn Judan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Said ibn Al-Musayyib ko kehte hue suna: Mujhe Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se hadees pahunchi, phir main Sad se mila aur unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Ali ibn Abi Talib se farmaya: Kya tum is par raazi nahi ke mere nazdeek tumhari manzil waisi ho jaisi Harun ki Musa ke nazdeek thi?"
"73","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd Al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Samura Al-Suwai ko kehte hue suna: Maine Umar ibn Al-Khattab ko Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se kehte hue suna: Allah ki qasam, Ahle Kufa ne har cheez me tumhari shikayat ki hai, hatta ke ye kehte hain ke tum unke sath namaz achhi tarah nahi padhte, to Sad ne kaha: Raha main, to Allah ki qasam, maine unhen Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki Zuhr aur Asr ki namaz padhane me kabhi kotahi nahi ki, main pehli do rakaton ko lamba karta hun aur aakhri do ko halka karta hun, unhon ne kaha: To maine Umar ko kehte hue suna: Tumhare bare me mera yehi khayal hai, tumhare bare me mera yehi khayal hai."
"74","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ibn Abd Al-Hamid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd Al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Jabir ibn Samura se, isi ki manind, siwa iske ke unhon ne kaha: Tumhare bare me mera yehi khayal hai, Ai Abu Ishaq, Sufyan ne is me ye izafa kiya: To Umar ne hukm diya ke unhen logon ke samne pesh kiya jaye, aur wo kisi qabile ke paas se na guzarte magar wo unki achhai ke sath tareef karte, yahan tak ke wo Banu Abs ki ek majlis ke paas se guzre, to un me se ek bad-bakht shakhs, kunyat Abu Sada, khada hua aur kaha: Main use janta hun: wo riaya me insaf nahi karta, jihad par nahi jata aur barabar taqseem nahi karta, to Sad ne kaha: Ai Allah, agar ye jhoota hai to iski umr lambi kar de, iski aulad zyada kar de, ise faqr me mubtala kar de aur ise fitne me daal de, Abd Al-Malik ibn Umayr ne kaha: To maine use dekha ke bahut buri umr ko pahuncha hua raston me laundiyon ko ghoorta tha, jab is bare me us se kaha jata to kehta: Ek burha, faqeer, fitne me mubtala shakhs, nek mard Sad ki dua laga hua hai, koi fitna waqe nahi hota magar wo us me ghus jata hai."
"75","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Ala ibn Abi Al-Abbas ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu Al-Tufayl ko bayan karte hue suna, Bakr ibn Qirwash se, Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Dhu Al-Thudayya ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Garhe ka shaitan, ghodon ka nigran, ya farmaya pahaad ka nigran, Bajila ka ek mard jise Al-Ashhab ya Ibn Al-Ashhab kaha jata hai, use nikal kar layega, ek zalim qaum me nishani ke taur par, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Ammar Al-Duhni ne mujhe khabar di ke un me se ek mard jise Al-Ashhab ya Ibn Al-Ashhab kaha jata hai, use nikal kar laya."
"76","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Umayya ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Yazid se, Ibn Ayyash se, unhon ne kaha: Sad ibn Abi Waqqas ke zamane me do aadmiyon ne silt-ghalle ke badle jau ki tijarat ki, to Sad ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke zamane me do aadmiyon ne khushk khajoor ke badle taaza khajoor ki tijarat ki, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya taaza khajoor khushk ho kar kam nahi hoti? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: Phir nahi."
"77","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulayka se, Ubaydullah ibn Abi Nahik se, Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Wo hum me se nahi jo Quran ko taghanni ke sath na padhe, Sufyan ne kaha: yani jo is par iktifa kare."
"78","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Mulayka se, Abdullah ibn Abi Nahik se, unhon ne kaha: Sad ibn Abi Waqqas mujhe bazaar me mile aur kaha: Ai kamane wale tajiro, ai kamane wale tajiro! Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Wo hum me se nahi jo Quran ko taghanni ke sath na padhe."
"79","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya: Maine Qays ibn Abi Hazim ko kehte hue suna: Maine Sad ibn Abi Waqqas ko kehte hue suna: Main pehla shakhs hun jis ne Allah ke raste me teer chalaya, aur mujhe apne bare me yaad hai ke main Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath saat me se ek tha, aur hamare paas deslab aur keekar ke patton ke siwa koi khana na tha, yahan tak ke hamare honthon ke kinare phat gaye, yahan tak ke ham me se ek bakri ki tarah mengni karta tha jis me aamezish na hoti, phir ab Banu Asad mujhe deen ke bare me malamat karte hain, tab to main gumrah hua aur mera amal zaya gaya."
"80","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Yafur ne hum se bayan kiya, Musab ibn Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine apne walid ke pehlu me namaz padhi aur ruku me apne hathon ko mila kar ghutnon ke darmiyan rakha, to unhon ne mujhe mana kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum aisa kiya karte the phir humen is se mana kar diya gaya, yani Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki taraf se."
"81","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Musa Al-Juhani se, Mus'ab bin Sa'd se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi har roz ek hazaar nekiyan kamane se aajiz hai? Aap ke sahaba mein se ek sawal karne wale ne Aap se poocha: Hum mein se koi har roz ek hazaar nekiyan kaise kamaye? Aap ne farmaya: Wo sau martaba Allah ki tasbeeh kare, ya sau martaba Uski takbeer kahe, to ye ek hazaar nekiyan hongi."
"82","Sa'id bin Zayd bin Amr bin Nufayl Al-Adawi Raziallahu Anhu ki riwayaat. Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Abd al-Malik bin Umayr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Amr bin Hurayth ko kehte hue suna: Maine Sa'id bin Zayd bin Amr bin Nufayl ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Khumbi us mann mein se hai jo Allah ne Bani Isra'il par nazil farmaya, aur us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai."
"83","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya: Humein Al-A'mash ne bayan kiya, Shimmir bin Atiya se, Shahr bin Hawshab se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Khumbi mann mein se hai, us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai, aur Ajwa khajoor - us ka nar Jannat se utra hai - aur us mein zeher se shifa hai."
"84","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Talha bin Abdullah bin Awf, jo Abd al-Rahman bin Awf ke bhatije hain, ne khabar di, Sa'id bin Zayd bin Amr bin Nufayl se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs na-haq ek balisht zameen le lega use saat zameenon mein se us ka tauq pehnaya jayega, aur jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatal kiya gaya wo shaheed hai. Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya: Sufyan se kaha gaya: Ma'mar Talha aur Sa'id ke darmiyan ek aadmi ka izafa karte hain. To Sufyan ne kaha: Maine kabhi Al-Zuhri ko un dono ke darmiyan kisi ko dakhil karte hue nahi suna."
"85","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Husayn bin Abd al-Rahman Al-Sulami ne bayan kiya, Hilal bin Yasaf se, Ibn Zalim se, Sa'id bin Zayd bin Amr bin Nufayl se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Quraish mein se das Jannat mein hain: Main Jannat mein hun, Abu Bakr Jannat mein hain, Umar Jannat mein hain, Uthman Jannat mein hain, Ali Jannat mein hain, Al-Zubayr Jannat mein hain, Talha Jannat mein hain, Abd al-Rahman bin Awf Jannat mein hain, aur Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas Jannat mein hain. Phir Sa'id khamosh ho gaye, aur logon ne kaha: Daswan kaun hai? Sa'id ne kaha: Main."
"86","Abu Ubayda bin Al-Jarrah Raziallahu Anhu ki riwayaat. Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Ibrahim bin Maymun, jo Aale Samura ke aazad karda hain, ne bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Samura se, unhon ne apne walid se, Abu Ubayda bin Al-Jarrah se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hijaz ke Yahudiyon ko Hijaz se nikal do."
"87","Abdullah bin Mas'ud ki riwayaat. Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Ibn Abi Najih ne bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abu Ma'mar se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Fath ke din Makkah mein dakhil hue jabke Baitullah ke gird teen sau saath but the; aur Aap apne hath mein chhadi se un par marne lage, farmate hue: Haq aa gaya, aur batil na pehli baar paida karta hai na dobara lautata hai; Haq aa gaya aur batil mit gaya; beshak batil hamesha mitne wala hai."
"88","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya: Humein Ibn Abi Najih ne bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abu Ma'mar se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke zamane mein chaand do tukron mein phat gaya, aur Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Gawah raho, gawah raho. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Sufyan ne kaha: Ibn Abi Najih ne humare liye Abu Ma'mar se ye dono hadisein sabit kin."
"89","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya: Humein Ibn Abi Najih ne bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abu Ma'mar se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Baitullah ke paas teen aadmi jama hue: do Quraishi aur ek Thaqafi, ya do Thaqafi aur ek Quraishi, un ke dilon mein samajh thodi thi aur un ke peton mein charbi zyada thi. Un mein se ek ne kaha: Kya tumhara khayal hai ke Allah sunta hai jo hum kehte hain? Dusre ne kaha: Wo sunta hai agar hum buland awaz se kahen. Dusre ne kaha: Agar Wo sunta hai jab hum buland awaz se kehte hain, to Wo sunta hai jab hum chhupate hain. Unhon ne kaha: To Allah ne nazil farmaya: Tum is khauf se parda nahi karte the ke tumhare kaan, tumhari aankhen tumhare khilaf gawahi dengi, Ayah tak. Aur Sufyan pehle is hadith mein kehte the: Humein Mansur ne bayan kiya, ya Ibn Abi Najih ne, ya Humayd Al-A'raj ne - un mein se ek ya do ne. Phir wo is hadith mein Mansur par jam gaye."
"90","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein Abd al-Malik bin Umayr ne ek se zyada martaba bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman bin Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah us bande ko tar-o-taza rakhe jo meri baat sune, use mehfooz rakhe, yaad kare aur aage pahunchaye; kyunke bahut se samajh uthane wale faqeeh nahi hote, aur bahut se samajh uthane wale use apne se zyada samajhdar tak pahunchate hain. Teen cheezen hain jin par Musalman ka dil kabhi keena nahi rakhta: amal mein ikhlas, Musalmanon ke hukmaranon ki khairkhwahi, aur un ki jamaat se wabastagi, kyunke un ki dua unhen peeche se ghere hue hai."
"91","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Yahya ibn Abdullah al-Jabir ne mujh se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu Majid al-Hanafi ko kehte hue suna: Main Abdullah ke paas tha jab ek moonchon wala aadmi un ke paas laya gaya, to Abdullah ne farmaya: Ise hilao, jhatko aur is se saans bahar nikalwao, pas use hilaya gaya aur saans nikalwai gayi to maloom hua ke woh nashe mein hai, to Abdullah ibn Masud ne farmaya: Ise rok rakho, pas use rok rakha gaya, phir agle din use laya gaya aur main aaya, aur Abdullah ne kode ka mutalba kiya, to girhadar sire wala koda laya gaya, to unhon ne use kaatne ka hukm diya, phir us ke sire ko koota gaya yahan tak ke woh us ke liye durra ban gaya, unhon ne farmaya: Aur unhon ne apni ungli se is tarah ishara kiya, aur marne wale se kaha: Maar aur apna haath kheench, aur har azu ko us ka haq de, aur unhon ne use qamees aur tehband mein kode mare, aur qamees aur shalwar mein, phir Abdullah ne farmaya: Koi hakim jis ke paas hadd layi jaye use qaim kiye baghair nahi reh sakta, Allah Muaf farmane wala hai aur muafi ko pasand farmata hai, to us aadmi ne kaha: Aye Abu Abd al-Rahman, yeh mere bhai ka beta hai, aur meri koi aulad nahi, aur main us ke liye waisi bechaini mehsoos karta hun jaisi aulad ke liye hoti hai, to Abdullah ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam phir tum yateem ke kitne bure sarparast ho, na tum ne achhi tarbiyat ki aur na aib ko chhupaya, phir Abdullah ne farmaya: Main us pehle aadmi ko janta hun jis ka Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne haath kaata: Ansar ka ek aadmi jo chori karke laya gaya tha to Aap ne us ka haath kaata, aur goya Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke chehre par raakh bichha di gayi thi, aur Sufyan ne apni hatheli se apne chehre ki taraf ishara kiya, use kuch bhenche hue, logon ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, goya Aap ne ise napasand farmaya, Aap ne farmaya: Aur mujhe kya rokta hai, apne bhai ke khilaf Shaitan ke madadgar na bano, koi hakim jis ke paas hadd layi jaye use qaim kiye baghair nahi reh sakta, aur Allah Muaf farmane wala hai aur muafi ko pasand farmata hai, phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne tilawat farmayi: Unhe muaf karna chahiye aur darguzar karna chahiye, kya tum pasand nahi karte ke Allah tumhe bakhshe, Sufyan ne farmaya: Main Yahya al-Jabir ke paas aaya to unhon ne mujh se kaha: Apni takhtiyan nikalo, maine kaha: Mere paas takhtiyan nahi hain, to unhon ne mujh se yeh hadith aur is ke sath doosri hadithen bayan kin, aur maine is hadith ko yaad na kiya yahan tak ke unhon ne ise mere liye dohraya, Sufyan ne farmaya: Pas maine ise do martaba sunne se yaad kiya."
"92","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ata ibn al-Saib ne hum se bayan kiya - aur hum un se Makkah mein mile the - farmaya: Main Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Sulami ke paas ayadat ke liye hazir hua jab woh beemar the, aur un ke ek ghulam ne un ka ilaj karna chaha to maine use mana kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Ise chhod do, kyunke maine Abdullah ibn Masud ko Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se riwayat karte hue suna ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne koi beemari nazil nahi farmayi magar us ke liye shifa bhi nazil farmayi, aur Sufyan kabhi kehte: dawa - jo ise janta hai woh janta hai, aur jo is se jahil raha woh jahil raha."
"93","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mansur ne hum se jo bayan kiya, Abu Wail se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abdullah ibn Masud ko farmate hue suna: Is Quran ko lazmi pakde raho, kyunke yeh logon ke seenon se rasiyon se oonton se bhi zyada tez nikal jata hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Un mein se kisi ka yeh kehna bura hai: Main falan falan ayat bhool gaya, balke use bhula diya gaya."
"94","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Dharr al-Hamdani ne hum se bayan kiya, Wail ibn Muhana se, Abdullah ibn Masud se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aye aurton ki jamaat, sadqa do chahe apne zewaron se hi, kyunke tum Jahannam walon ki aksariyat ho, to ek aurat jo numaya aurton mein se na thi khadi hui aur kaha: Kyun, Aye Allah ke Rasool, Aap ne farmaya: Kyunke tum lanat bahut karti ho aur shohar ki nashukri karti ho, phir Abdullah ne farmaya: Aql aur deen mein naqis mein se aurton se badh kar pukhta mardon par un ke mamlat mein ghalib aane wala koi nahi paya gaya, unhon ne farmaya: Kaha gaya: Aye Abu Abd al-Rahman, us ka aql aur deen mein nuqsan kya hai, unhon ne farmaya: Raha us ka aql mein nuqsan: to Allah ne do aurton ki gawahi ko ek mard ki gawahi ke barabar kiya hai, aur raha us ka deen mein nuqsan: to woh itne din Allah ko ek sajda bhi kiye baghair rehti hai."
"95","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Jami ibn Abi Rashid aur Abd al-Malik ibn Ayan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Wail se, Abdullah ibn Masud se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne maal ki zakat rokta hai us ke liye Qayamat ke din ganja saanp banaya jayega jo use tauq ban kar lipta hoga, phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Allah ki Kitab se is ki tasdeeq tilawat farmayi: Jo log usay rok rakhte hain jo Allah ne unhe apne fazl se diya hai woh ise apne liye behtar na samjhen, balke woh un ke liye bura hai, Qayamat ke din unhe us ka tauq pehnaya jayega jo unhon ne roka tha, poori ayat."
"96","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Asim ibn Abi al-Nujud ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Wail se, Abdullah ibn Masud se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Habsha ki sarzameen mein aane se pehle namaz mein Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko salam kehte the aur Aap humen jawab dete the, phir jab hum wapas aaye to maine Aap ko namaz padhte hue salam kaha aur Aap ne mujhe jawab na diya, to mujhe qareeb aur door ki fikr ne gher liya, pas main baitha raha yahan tak ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam namaz se farigh hue, to maine Aap se kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, maine Aap ko namaz mein salam kaha aur Aap ne mujhe salam ka jawab na diya, to Aap ne farmaya: Allah apne mamle mein jo chahta hai naya hukm farmata hai, aur jo us ne naya farmaya us mein se hai ke tum namaz mein baat na karo, Sufyan ne farmaya: Is riwayat mein Asim ke paas yahi behtareen hai jo hum ne paya."
"97","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abd al-Malik ibn Ayan aur Jami ibn Abi Rashid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Wail se, Abdullah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi Musalman ka maal jhooti qasam se kaat le woh Allah se is haal mein milega ke Allah us par ghazabnak hoga, Abdullah ne farmaya: Phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humen Allah Taala ki Kitab se is ki tasdeeq tilawat farmayi: Jo log Allah ke ahd aur apni qasmon se mol lete hain, poori ayat."
"98","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mansur ne hum se is hadith ko ek se zyada martaba bayan kiya, Ibrahim se, Alqama se, ke Abdullah ibn Masud ne salam ke baad bhool ke do sajde kiye, aur riwayat kiya ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhe salam ke baad ada farmaya, Sufyan ne farmaya: Yeh taweel thi, aur maine is mein se yahi yaad kiya."
"99","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, Alqama se, ke Banu Asad ki ek aurat Ibn Masud ke paas aayi aur un se kaha: Mujhe khabar pahunchi ke aap falan falan par lanat karte hain, aur godna banane wali aur godna banwane wali par, aur maine do jildon ke darmiyan jo hai padha hai magar aap jo kehte hain woh nahi paya, halanke mera gumaan hai ke aap ke ghar walon mein se kuch is par amal karte hain, to Abdullah ne us se farmaya: Phir andar ja kar dekho, pas woh andar gayi aur dekha aur kuch na dekha, unhon ne farmaya: To Abdullah ne us se farmaya: Kya tum ne nahi padha: Jo kuch Rasool tumhe de use le lo, aur jis se roke us se ruk jao, us ne kaha: Haan, unhon ne farmaya: To wohi hai."
"100","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ibrahim al-Hajari Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu al-Ahwas ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abdullah ibn Masud ko farmate hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Shaitan tumhari is sarzameen mein - ya is sheher mein - buton ke puje jane se mayoos ho chuka hai, lekin woh tumhare amalon mein se haqeer samjhe jane wale amalon par raazi hai, pas haqeer amalon se bacho, kyunke woh halak karne walon mein se hain, kya main tumhe us ki misaal na bataun, sawaron jaisi jo be-aab-o-giyah zameen mein utren jahan indhan na ho, phir muntashir hon: ek lakdi laye, ek haddi laye, ek gobar laye, yahan tak ke unhon ne jo pakana chaha paka liya, isi tarah gunah hain."
"101","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se yeh hadith is se mukhtalif taur par bayan ki jis taur par al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan ki thi, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Qays ibn Abi Hazim ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hasad nahi magar do (shakhson) mein: ek woh aadmi jise Allah ne maal diya phir use haq mein kharch kar daalne par qudrat di, aur ek woh aadmi jise Allah ne hikmat di to woh us ke zariye faisla karta hai ya use sikhata hai."
"102","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Qays ibn Abi Hazim ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ko kehte hue suna: Hum Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath ghazwon par nikla karte the aur hamare saath aurten na hotin, aur hum ne khassi hone ka irada kiya to Aap ne hamen is se mana farmaya."
"103","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: al-Mas'udi ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Qasim se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se farmaya: Parho. Unhon ne kaha: Kya main parhun jabke yeh Aap par nazil hua hai? Aap ne farmaya: Main ise apne siwa kisi aur se sunna pasand karta hun. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne Surat al-Nisa parhi yahan tak ke jab main is (ayat) par pahuncha: To kya haal hoga jab Hum har ummat se ek gawah layenge aur Aap ko in par gawah bana kar layenge, to Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ro pade aur Abdullah ruk gaye."
"104","Sufyan ne kaha: al-Mas'udi ne kaha: Aur Ja'far ibn Amr ibn Hurayth ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abdullah se: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: In par gawah jab tak main in mein hun; phir jab Tu ne mujhe utha liya to Tu hi in par nigran tha, aur Tu har cheez par gawah hai."
"105","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Nakha' ke ek buzurg jin ka naam Amr, kuniyat Abu Mu'awiya hai, ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Abu Amr al-Shaybani ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se poocha: Kaun sa amal sab se afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah par iman aur Us ke raste mein jihad. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Phir namaz apne waqt par. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Phir walidain se husn-e-suluk. Main ne kaha: Phir kabira gunahon mein se kaun sa sab se bara hai? Aap ne farmaya: Yeh ke tu Allah ke saath shareek banaye jabke Us ne tujhe paida kiya. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Yeh ke tu apne bache ko is dar se qatl kare ke woh tere saath khayega. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Phir yeh ke tu apne padosi ki biwi se zina kare. Phir Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne tilawat farmayi: Aur woh jo Allah ke saath kisi dusre mabud ko nahi pukarte, aur us jaan ko qatl nahi karte jise Allah ne haram kiya magar haq ke saath, aur na zina karte hain; aur jo yeh karega woh saza payega, yeh ayat."
"106","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Fudayl ibn Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Abu Wa'il se, Ibn Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Musalman ko gali dena fisq hai, aur us se ladna kufr hai."
"107","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Karim al-Jazari ne hum se bayan kiya, Ziyad ibn Abi Maryam se, Abdullah ibn Ma'qil se, unhon ne kaha: Main apne walid ke saath Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ki khidmat mein hazir hua, aur mere walid ne un se kaha: Kya aap ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Nadamat tauba hai? To Abdullah ne kaha: Haan; main ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Nadamat tauba hai."
"108","Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Abu Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Ma'qil se, Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi ki manind. Aur jo Abd al-Karim ne hum se bayan kiya woh mujhe zyada mehboob hai, kyunke woh Abu Sa'd se zyada zabt wale hain."
"109","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim ibn Bahdala ne hum se bayan kiya, Zirr ibn Hubaysh se, Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath ek ghaar mein tha jab Aap par Wal-mursalat urfa nazil hui; to main ne use Aap ke munh se hasil ki jabke Aap ka munh abhi us se tar tha, aur main nahi janta Aap ne in do mein se kis par khatm farmaya: Phir is ke baad woh kis baat par iman layenge, ya: Aur jab un se kaha jata hai ke ruku karo to woh ruku nahi karte. Unhon ne kaha: Aur ek saanp ek surakh se hamari taraf nikla aur hum se bach nikla, dusre surakh mein dakhil ho gaya; to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum us ke shar se bacha liye gaye, aur woh tumhare shar se bacha liya gaya."
"110","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il Shaqiq ibn Salama ko kehte hue suna: Hum Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ke intezar mein baithe the jab Yazid ibn Mu'awiya al-Nakha'i hamare paas aye aur kaha: Tumhen kya hua hai? Hum ne kaha: Hum Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ka intezar kar rahe hain. Unhon ne kaha: Tumhara kya khayal hai woh kahan hain? Hum ne kaha: Ghar mein. Unhon ne kaha: Kya main ja kar unhen tumhare paas bahar na laaun? To woh gaye, aur zyada der na guzri ke Abdullah bahar aaye yahan tak ke hamare upar khade ho gaye, aur Yazid ibn Mu'awiya (bhi saath) tha; aur Abdullah ne kaha: Mujhe tumhare ijtema ki khabar mil gayi hai, aur mujhe tumhari taraf bahar aane se sirf is ne roka ke main tumhen ukta dena napasand karta hun; aur Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam dinon mein naseehat ke liye munasib waqt chunte the, hamare liye uktahat ko napasand karte hue."
"111","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Al-A'mash ko kehte hue suna: Maine Al-Hajjaj ibn Yusuf ko kehte hue suna: Surat Al-Baqara mat kaho aur na falan surat, pas maine is ka zikr Ibrahim ibn Yazid Al-Nakha'i se kiya to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abd Al-Rahman ibn Yazid ne khabar di ke woh Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ke sath wadi ke nashib mein chale aur jab woh jamra tak pahunche to unhon ne use apni dayen janib rakha phir us ke samne ho kar use kankariyan maren, maine un se kaha: Ai Abu Abd Al-Rahman, log use us ke upar se kankariyan marte hain, unhon ne kaha: Yahin se, qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke siwa koi mabood nahin, maine us hasti ko kankariyan marte dekha jin par Surat Al-Baqara nazil hui."
"112","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Al-A'mash se, unhon ne Abu Wa'il se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se riwayat kiya, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se marfu'an, Aap ne farmaya: Do aadmi teesre ko chhor kar aapas mein sargoshi na karen kyunke ye baat use ranjida karti hai."
"113","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Al-A'mash se, unhon ne Abu Wa'il se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek taqseem taqseem farmayi to ek aadmi ne kaha: Ye aisi taqseem hai jis se Allah ke Chehre ka irada nahin kiya gaya, Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ne kaha: Main Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas ja kar Aap ko ittila dene se khud ko rok na saka aur Aap ka chehra mutaghayyir ho gaya, Abdullah ne kaha: Phir maine tamanna ki ke kash main usi din Musalman hua hota, phir Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Musa ko is se sakht tar aza di gayi phir unhon ne sabr kiya."
"114","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Al-A'mash ko kehte hue suna: Maine Al-Hajjaj ibn Yusuf ko kehte hue suna: Surah Al-Baqarah mat kaho aur na falan Surah, maine is ka zikr Ibrahim ibn Yazid Al-Nakha'i se kiya to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abd Al-Rahman ibn Yazid ne khabar di ke woh Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ke sath wadi ke nashib mein chale aur jab woh Jamrah ke paas aaye to unhon ne use apne dayen taraf rakha phir us ke muqabil us ki taraf rukh kar ke use kankariyan maren, maine un se kaha: Ai Abu Abd Al-Rahman, kuch log use us ke upar se kankariyan marte hain, unhon ne kaha: Yahin se, qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke siwa koi mabood nahin, maine us hasti ko kankariyan marte dekha jin par Surah Al-Baqarah nazil hui."
"115","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim se, Alqamah se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Sham aaye aur unhon ne Surah Yusuf ki tilawat ki to ek aadmi ne un se kaha: Ye is tarah nazil nahin hui, Abdullah ne kaha: Tera bura ho, maine use Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko sunaya to Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne achha kiya, jabke woh un se jhagad raha tha to Abdullah ne us se sharab ki bu mehsoos ki to Abdullah ne kaha: Kya tum sharab pite ho aur Qur'an ka inkar karte ho, main yahan se nahin halunga yahan tak ke tumhe kode lagaye jayen, pas use kode lagaye gaye."
"116","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne hum se ek se zyada martaba bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Murrah se, Abu Al-Ahwas se, Abdullah se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main har khalil ki khullat se Allah ke huzur bara'at ka izhar karta hun aur agar main kisi ko khalil banata to Abu Bakr ko khalil banata, aur tumhare Sahib Allah ke khalil hain, ya'ni apni zaat murad li."
"117","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Umarah ibn Umayr se, Abd Al-Rahman ibn Yazid se, Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko kabhi koi namaz us ke waqt ke baghair padhte nahin dekha siwa Muzdalifah ke kyunke Aap ne wahan do namazon Maghrib aur Isha ko jama kiya aur us din fajr ki namaz apne waqt se pehle padhi, Sufyan ne kaha: Ya'ni us waqt se pehle jis par woh is se pehle use padha karte the."
"118","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Al-A'mash se, unhon ne Umarah ibn Umayr se, unhon ne Abd Al-Rahman ibn Yazid se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hum se farmaya: Ai naujawanon ki jama'at, tum mein se jo nikah ki istita'at rakhta ho use nikah karna chahiye kyunke ye nigah ko neechi rakhta hai aur sharmgah ki hifazat karta hai, aur jo istita'at na rakhe use roza rakhna chahiye kyunke roza us ke liye"
"119","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se Al-Amash se bayan kiya, ya mujhe un se riwayat pahunchi, Muslim ibn Subayh se, yani Masruq se, unhon ne farmaya: Abdullah se kaha gaya: Masjid mein ek shakhs keh raha hai: Jab Qayamat ka din aayega to logon ko ek dhuan lapeit mein le lega jo kafiron ko un ki samaat se pakdega, aur mominon ko zukam ki tarah pakdega, Abdullah tek lagaye hue the, phir seedhe baith gaye aur farmaya: Ae logo, tum mein se jo koi kuch janta hai to use chahiye ke woh use bayan kare, aur jo nahin janta to use chahiye ke jis cheez ko woh nahin janta us ke liye kahe: Allah behtar janta hai, kyunke aadmi ke ilm ka hissa hai ke jis cheez ko woh nahin janta us ke liye kahe: Allah behtar janta hai, Allah ne Apne Nabi se farmaya: Keh dijiye: Main tum se is par koi ajr nahin mangta, aur main takalluf karne walon mein se nahin hun, jab Quraish ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke muqable mein susti dikhayi to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah, Yusuf ke saat ki tarah saat se in ke khilaf meri madad farma, un par aisa qaht pada jo har cheez ko kha gaya, yahan tak ke woh haddiyan khane lage, aur aadmi aasman ki taraf dekhta to apne aur us ke darmiyan dhuein jaisi cheez dekhta, Allah Taala ne farmaya: Pas us din ka intezar karo jab aasman wazeh dhuan layega, jo logon ko dhaanp lega; ye dardnak azab hai, Allah ne farmaya: Hum azab ko thoda hatane wale hain; tum laut jaoge, ye is duniya mein tha; kya Qayamat ke din un se hata diya jayega, phir Abdullah ne farmaya: Dhuan guzar chuka, aur lazmi guzar chuka, aur chand guzar chuka, aur Roomi guzar chuke, aur sakht pakad guzar chuki."
"120","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, Muslim ibn Subayh se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Masruq ke sath Yasar ibn Numair ke ghar mein the, aur Masruq ne un ke dehlan mein tasveeren dekhin, to unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abdullah ibn Masud ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Qayamat ke din logon mein sab se sakht azab wale tasveer banane wale honge."
"121","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se al-A'mash se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Murrah se, unhon ne Masruq se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi jaan na-haq qatal nahi ki jati magar Adam ke pehle bete par us mein se ek hissa hota hai, kyunke us ne sab se pehle qatal ki bunyad rakhi."
"122","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se Abdullah ibn Murrah se, unhon ne Masruq se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se bayan kiya, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Us Musalman mard ka khoon jo gawahi deta hai ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur ke main Allah ka Rasool hun, halal nahi magar teen mein se ek surat mein: woh shakhs jo apne Islam ke baad kufr kare, ya shadi-shuda ho kar zina kare, ya jaan ke badle jaan."
"123","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se Abdullah ibn Murrah se, unhon ne Masruq se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne us ke baare mein pucha, yani shuhada ki roohon ke baare mein, to kaha gaya: Woh sabz parindon ke peton mein rakhi jati hain jo Arsh ke neeche chiraaghon par panah leti hain, Jannat mein jahan chahti hain sair karti hain, tumhare Rabb ne un ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Kya tum chahte ho ke Main tumhein kisi cheez mein mazeed ata karun to Main tumhein zyada dun, unhon ne kaha: Hum Tujh se aur kya zyada chahenge jabke hum Jannat mein hain us mein jahan chahte hain sair karte hain, phir tumhare Rabb ne un ki taraf dobara dekha aur farmaya: Kya tum chahte ho ke Main tumhein kisi cheez mein mazeed ata karun to Main tumhein zyada dun, jab unhon ne dekha ke unhein Us se mangna hi hoga to unhon ne kaha: Hamari roohon ko hamare jismon mein lota de taake hum Tere raste mein ek baar phir qatal kiye jayen."
"124","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ibn al-Sa'ib ne hum se Abu Ubaydah se, unhon ne Abdullah se bayan kiya, isi ki manind, aur unhon ne izafa kiya: Aur hamare Nabi ko hamari taraf se salam pohunchao, aur hamari qaum ko khabar karo ke hum raazi hain aur Woh hum se raazi hai."
"125","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se Shimmar ibn Atiyyah se, unhon ne al-Mughirah ibn Sa'd ibn al-Akhram se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ibn Mas'ud se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hum se farmaya: Jaidadein mat banao, kahin tum duniya se lag na jao, phir Abdullah ne kaha: Aur Baradhan, Baradhan kya hai, aur Madinah, Madinah kya hai."
"126","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Mis'ar se, unhon ne Amr ibn Murrah se, unhon ne Abu Ubaydah se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Masruq ne mujh se kaha: Tumhare walid ne mujhe khabar di ke ek darakht ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko jinnon se khabardar kiya."
"127","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Mis'ar se, unhon ne Amr ibn Murrah se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Salamah se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Mas'ud se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Tumhare Nabi ko paanch ke siwa har cheez ka ilm diya gaya tha: Beshak Allah, Usi ke paas Qayamat ka ilm hai, surat ke aakhir tak."
"128","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mis'ar ne hum se Murrah se, unhon ne Alqamah ibn Marthad se, unhon ne al-Mughirah al-Yashkuri se, unhon ne al-Ma'rur ibn Suwayd se, unhon ne Ibn Mas'ud se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umm Habibah ne kaha: Ae Allah, mujhe mere shohar Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke zariye, aur mere walid Abu Sufyan ke zariye, aur mere bhai Mu'awiyah ke zariye faida pohuncha, Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum ne Allah se muqarrar muddaton aur taqseem shuda umron aur bante hue rizqon ka sawal kiya hai, un mein se koi cheez apni muddat se pehle nahi aati, aur un mein se koi cheez apne waqt se peeche nahi hatti, agar tum Allah se Jahannam ke azaab se aur qabr ke azaab se bachne ka sawal karti to behtar hota, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se bandaron aur khinzeeron ke baare mein pucha gaya: kya aap samajhte hain ke woh maskh kiye gaye logon ki nasal se hain ya us se pehle ki makhluq mein se hain, unhon ne farmaya: Nahi, balke us se pehle ki makhluq mein se hain, Allah Azza wa Jalla kabhi kisi qaum ko halak nahi karta phir unhein nasal ya aulad ata kare, balke woh us se pehle ki makhluq mein se hain."
"129","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd al-Tanafisi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se Zayd ibn Wahb se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Mas'ud ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hum se bayan farmaya, aur woh sadiq-o-masduq hain: Tum mein se har ek ki takhleeq uski maa ke pet mein chalees din tak jama ki jati hai, phir woh isi tarah jam hua khoon hota hai, phir woh isi tarah gosht ka lothra hota hai, phir Allah uski taraf farishte ko chaar kalimon ke saath bhejta hai, kehte hue: Uska amal, aur uski muddat, aur badbakht ya khushbakht hona likh de, phir us mein rooh phunki jati hai, phir unhon ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam Jiske Haath mein meri jaan hai, ek aadmi Jahannam walon ke kaam karta rehta hai yahan tak ke uske aur uske darmiyan sirf ek haath ka fasla reh jata hai, phir taqdeer us par ghalib aati hai aur woh Jannat walon ke kaam karta hai aur us mein dakhil ho jata hai, aur ek aadmi Jannat walon ke kaam karta rehta hai yahan tak ke uske aur uske darmiyan sirf ek haath ka fasla reh jata hai, phir taqdeer us par ghalib aati hai aur woh Jahannam walon ke kaam karta hai aur us mein dakhil ho jata hai."
"130","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se Umarah ibn Umayr se, unhon ne al-Aswad ibn Yazid se, unhon ne Abdullah se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne kaha: Tum mein se koi apni namaz mein se shaitan ko hissa na de, yeh samajhte hue ke us par lazim hai ke woh dayen taraf ke siwa se na nikle, aur main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha ke woh aksar bayen taraf se nikalte the."
"131","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abu al-Ahwas ko bayan karte hue suna ke unhon ne Abu Dharr ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz ke liye khada ho to rehmat us ke samne hoti hai, pas use kankariyon ko saaf nahin karna chahiye. Sufyan ne farmaya: Sa'd ibn Ibrahim ne un se kaha: Abu al-Ahwas kaun hai? Goya ek ghair maroof aadmi se riwayat karne par jo use nahin janta tha us par naraz hue. Al-Zuhri ne un se farmaya: Kya tum us shaikh ko nahin jante, Banu Ghifar ke azad karda ghulam ko, jo Rawdah mein namaz padha karta tha? Aur unhon ne un ke samne us ka huliya bayan kiya, jabke Sa'd use nahin jante the."
"132","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Amr ibn Dinar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Yazid ibn Judubah al-Laythi ne khabar di ke unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Mikhraq ko Abu Dharr se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Jannat mein ek hawa ke baad saat saal baad ek hawa paida ki, aur us ke aage ek band darwaza hai, aur tumhare paas hawa sirf us darwaze ke khulne se aati hai. Agar woh khol diya jata to aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan har cheez ko bikher deta, aur Allah ke nazdeek woh al-Azyab hai, aur tumhare nazdeek woh junubi hawa hai."
"133","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Muhammad ibn al-Saib ibn Barakah se kaha: Kya tum ne Amr ibn Maymun al-Awdi ko dekha hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Haan, woh hamare paas thehra karta tha. Maine kaha: Kya tum ne us se kuch suna hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Haan, maine Amr ibn Maymun ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Dharr ko kehte hue suna: Main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke peeche chal raha tha, aur unhon ne mujh se farmaya: Ai Abu Dharr, kya main tumhein Jannat ke khazanon mein se ek khazane ka pata na bataun? Maine kaha: Haan, Ai Allah ke Rasul. Unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke siwa na koi taqat hai na quwwat."
"134","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Hisham ibn Urwah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe mere walid ne khabar di, Abu Murawih al-Ghifari se, Abu Dharr se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, kaun sa amal sab se afzal hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Allah par iman, aur Allah ke raste mein jihad. Unhon ne farmaya: Maine kaha: Azad karne ke liye kaun si gardein sab se afzal hain? Unhon ne farmaya: Qeemat mein sab se mehngi aur apne malikon ke nazdeek sab se qeemti. Maine kaha: Agar main ye na kar sakun? Unhon ne farmaya: To tum kisi hunarmand ki madad karo, ya us ke liye kaam karo jo hunar se kaam nahin kar sakta. Maine kaha: Agar main ye na kar sakun? Unhon ne farmaya: To tum apna nuqsan logon se rok lo, kyunke woh ek sadqa hai jo tum apni taraf se doge."
"135","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne Yahya ibn Said se bayan kiya, al-Muraqqa se, Abu Dharr se, unhon ne farmaya: Hajj ka faskh Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki taraf se khaas hamare liye tha."
"136","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Bishr ibn Asim ibn Sufyan al-Thaqafi ne apne walid se, Abu Dharr se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, maal wale log sawab mein hum se aage badh gaye; woh wahi kehte hain jo hum kehte hain, aur woh kharch karte hain jabke hum kharch nahin karte. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein ek amal na bataun, jab tum use kahoge to apne se pehle walon ko pa loge, aur tumhare baad wale tum se aage nahin badh sakenge magar woh jo wahi kahe jo tum kehte ho? Har namaz ke baad Allah ki tasbeeh taintees martaba karo, Allah ki hamd taintees martaba karo, aur Allah ki takbeer chauttees martaba karo. Al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Phir Sufyan ne farmaya: Un mein se ek chauttees hai: aur apne bistar par bhi isi tarah."
"137","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Ibrahim al-Taymi se, unhon ne farmaya: Main apne walid ke sath chal raha tha jab unhon ne sajde wali ayat tilawat ki aur sajda kiya, phir unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abu Dharr ko kehte hue suna: Maine kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, zameen ke chehre par sab se pehle kaun si masjid rakhi gayi? Unhon ne farmaya: Masjid-e-Haram. Maine kaha: Phir kaun si? Unhon ne farmaya: Masjid-e-Aqsa. Maine kaha: Un dono ke darmiyan kitna arsa tha? Unhon ne farmaya: Chalees saal. Maine kaha: Phir kaun si? Unhon ne farmaya: Phir jahan bhi namaz tumhein pa le, namaz padh lo, kyunke sari zameen masjid hai."
"138","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne Yahya ibn Said se bayan kiya, al-Muraqqa se, Abu Dharr se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Hajj ka faskh Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki taraf se khaas hamare liye tha."
"139","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman, aal-e-Talhah ke azad karda ghulam, aur Hakim ibn Jubayr ne bayan kiya, dono ne use Musa ibn Talhah se suna: ke unhon ne Banu Tamim mein se apne khaluon mein se Ibn al-Hawtakiyyah naam ke ek aadmi ko kehte hue suna: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne farmaya: Hum mein se kaun al-Qahah ke din maujood tha, jab Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas ek khargosh laya gaya? Abu Dharr ne farmaya: Main tha. Ek dehati Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas ek khargosh laya aur kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, maine use khoon behta hue dekha tha. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us se parhez kiya aur nahin khaya, aur apne Sahaba ko khane ka hukm diya, jabke dehati alag raha aur na khaya, kehte hue: Main roze se hun. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhara roza kya hai? Us ne kaha: Har mahine ke teen din. Unhon ne farmaya: Safed roshan dinon ke bare mein tum kahan ho: tehrvin, chaudhvin aur pandhrvin?"
"140","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humein Sufyan ne Amr ibn Uthman se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Talhah se, Abu Dharr se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi ki manind, siwa is ke ke unhon ne us mein Ibn al-Hawtakiyyah ka zikr nahin kiya."
"141","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya Muhammad ibn Ajlan se, Saeed ibn Abi Saeed al-Maqburi se, mera khayal hai, apne walid se, Abdullah ibn Wadiah se, Abu Dharr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Jumuah ke din ghusl kare aur khoob achhi tarah ghusl kare, ya taharat hasil kare aur khoob achhi tarah taharat kare, phir apne achhe kapdon mein se kuch pehne, aur apne ghar walon ki khushbu mein se jo Allah ne us ke liye muqaddar ki ho lagaye, phir Jumuah ki namaz ke liye jaye baghair do aadmiyon ke darmiyan judai daley, to us ke liye do Jumuon ke darmiyan ka aur mazeed teen din ka gunaah bakhsh diya jata hai."
"142","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Aziz ibn Abd al-Samad al-Ammi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Imran al-Jawni ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn al-Samit se, Abu Dharr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Ai Abu Dharr, jab tum salan pakao to shorba zyada karo aur apne hamsayon ka khayal rakho, ya apne hamsayon ko shareek karo."
"143","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya al-Amash se, al-Marur ibn Suwayd se, Abu Dharr se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur unhen farmate hue suna: Rab-e-Kabah ki qasam woh sab se kamtar hain. Main ne kaha: Woh kaun hain, Ai Allah ke Rasool? Unhon ne farmaya: Sab se zyada maaldar log, siwaye us ke jo maal se yun aur yun aur yun kahe, aur aise log bahut kam hain."
"144","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya Asim ibn Ubaydullah se, Abdullah ibn Amir ibn Rabiah se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko beshumar martaba roze ki halat mein miswak karte hue dekha."
"145","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salim ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, Amir ibn Rabiah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum janaza dekho to us ke liye khare ho jao hatta ke woh tum se aage nikal jaye ya rakh diya jaye."
"146","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah se, apne walid se, Ammar ibn Yasir se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath kandhon tak tayammum kiya. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Main Sufyan ke paas maujood tha jab Yahya ibn Saeed al-Qattan ne un se is ke bare mein pucha, to unhon ne un se bayan kiya, is mein kehte hue: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya. Phir unhon ne kaha: Main maujood tha jab Ismail ibn Umayyah al-Zuhri ke paas aye aur kaha: Ai Abu Bakr, log aap ki bayan karda do hadeeson par etiraz karte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Woh kaun si hain? Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath kandhon tak tayammum kiya. al-Zuhri ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, Ammar se. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Umar ki hadees ke unhon ne baghal chhone se wuzu ka hukm diya. Main ne al-Zuhri ko dekha goya ke unhon ne ise napasand kiya, halanke Amr ibn Dinar ne is se pehle hamen al-Zuhri se ise bayan kiya tha; main ne is ka zikr Amr se kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Ji haan, unhon ne beshak hamen ise bayan kiya tha."
"147","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Khufaf, Najiyah ibn Kab se, unhon ne kaha: Ammar ne Umar se kaha: Kya aap ko yaad nahin jab aap aur main oonton ke sath the aur main junbi ho gaya, to main mitti mein is tarah lota jis tarah janwar lotta hai, phir main Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aya aur hum ne un se is ka zikr kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Is ke liye tumhen sirf tayammum hi kafi hota."
"148","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya Muhammad ibn Ajlan se, Saeed ibn Abi Saeed al-Maqburi se, Banu Sulaym ke ek aadmi se, Abdullah ibn Anamah al-Juhani se, ke ek aadmi ne Ammar ibn Yasir ko ek namaz parhte hue dekha jise unhon ne mukhtasar kiya, aur jab woh farigh hue to us ne un se kaha: Ai Abu al-Yaqzan, aap ne ek namaz parhi jise aap ne mukhtasar kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne dekha ke main ne us ke ruku aur sajde mein se kuch kam kiya? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Main bhool ke muqable mein jaldi ki, aur main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Aadmi ek namaz parhta hai aur farigh hota hai, aur us mein se us ke liye daswen hisse, nawen, aathwen, chhate, panchwen, chauthe, teesre, aadhe ke siwa kuch nahin likha jata."
"149","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya Abd al-Karim Abu Umayyah se, Hassan ibn Bilal al-Muzani se, unhon ne kaha: Ammar ibn Yasir ko dadhi mein khilal karte hue wuzu karte dekha gaya. Un se kaha gaya: Kya aap dadhi mein khilal karte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe kya cheez rokti hai, jabke main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko apni dadhi mein khilal karte hue dekha hai?"
"150","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya Saeed ibn Abi Arubah se, Qatadah se, Hassan ibn Bilal se, Ammar se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi ki manind."
"151","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Zayd ibn Aslam ne Mina me hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Umar ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Quba me Banu Amr ibn Awf ki masjid ki taraf tashreef le gaye taake us me namaz parhen, aur Ansar me se kuch aadmi un ki khidmat me aaye unhen salam karte hue, to main ne Suhayb se pucha, jo un ke sath thay: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam namaz ki halat me un ke salam ka jawab kis tarah dete thay jab wo unhen salam karte thay? Suhayb ne farmaya: Wo apne hath se un ki taraf ishara farmate thay, Sufyan ne farmaya: Main ne ek aadmi se kaha: Un se pucho: Kya tum ne ye Ibn Umar se suna hai? To us ne kaha: Ae Abu Usamah, kya tum ne ye Ibn Umar se suna hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Jahan tak mera talluq hai to main ne un se baat ki aur unhon ne mujh se baat ki, lekin unhon ne ye nahin farmaya: Main ne un se suna hai."
"152","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Bilal se pucha: Unhon ne Baitullah me kahan namaz parhi? Unhon ne farmaya: Agli do sutoonon ke darmiyan, aur main un se ye puchna bhool gaya: Unhon ne kitni namaz parhi?"
"153","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Aban ibn Taghlib aur Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Bilal se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha ke Aap ne dono mozon aur sarposh par masah farmaya."
"154","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Yahya ibn Jadah se, unhon ne farmaya: Kuch log Khabbab ki ayadat ke liye un ke paas aaye jab wo bimar thay, aur farmaya: Khush ho jaiye Ae Abu Abdullah, aap Hawz par Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se milenge, to unhon ne farmaya: Is ka kya hoga aur is ka kya hoga? Apni imarat ki taraf, ghar ki chhat aur us ki diwaron ki taraf ishara karte hue, aur farmaya: Is ka kya hoga, jabke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hum se farmaya tha: Tum me se har ek ke liye is duniya se bas sawari ke toshe ke barabar hi kafi hai."
"155","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan al-Thawri se, Abu Ishaq se, Said ibn Wahb se, Khabbab se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se dhoop se tapti hui zameen ki shikayat ki, to unhon ne hamari shikayat door na farmayi."
"156","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Harithah ibn Mudarrib se, Khabbab se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se tapti hui zameen ki shikayat ki, to unhon ne hamari shikayat door na farmayi."
"157","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Khabbab ki ayadat ke liye aaye jab un ke pet par saat dagh lagaye gaye thay, to unhon ne farmaya: Agar Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamen maut ki dua mangne se mana na farmaya hota to main us ki dua mangta, phir unhon ne farmaya: Hum se pehle log guzre jinhon ne is duniya se kuch hasil na kiya, jabke hum un ke baad baqi rahe aur hum ne is duniya se itna paya ke hum me se koi nahin janta ke wo use kis cheez me kharch karta hai siwaye mitti me, Musalman ko har us cheez me ajr diya jata hai jo wo kharch karta hai siwaye us ke jo wo mitti me kharch karta hai."
"158","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Abu Wail ko farmate hue suna: Hum Khabbab ki ayadat ke liye aaye jab wo bimar thay, to unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Allah ke Chehre ko talash karte hue hijrat ki, to hamara ajr Allah ke zimme ho gaya, hum me se kuch guzar gaye aur unhon ne apne ajr me se kuch na paya, un me se Musab ibn Umayr thay jo Uhud ke din shaheed hue, ek dhari daar ooni chadar chhorte hue, jab hum un ke paon dhampte thay to un ka sar khul jata tha aur jab hum un ka sar dhampte thay to un ke paon khul jate thay, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamen hukm farmaya ke hum un ka sar dhamp den aur un ke paon par kuch izkhir ghaas rakh den, aur hum me se kuch aise hain jin ka phal un ke liye pak gaya hai aur wo use chun rahe hain."
"159","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, Umarah ibn Umayr se, Abu Mamar se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne Khabbab se pucha: Kya Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Zuhr aur Asr me qirat farmate thay? Unhon ne farmaya: Ji han, hum ne kaha: Tum ne ye kis se pehchana? Unhon ne farmaya: Un ki dadhi mubarak ki harkat se."
"160","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Bayan ibn Bishr aur Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne farmaya: Hum ne Qays ko farmate hue suna: Main ne Khabbab ko farmate hue suna: Main Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me hazir hua jabke Aap Kaaba ke saye me apni chadar ka takiya lagaye hue thay, aur hamen mushrikon se sakht takleef pahunchi thi, to main ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya Aap hamare liye Allah se dua nahin farmayenge? To Aap baith gaye aur Aap ka chehra surkh ho gaya aur farmaya: Tum se pehle logon me se ek aadmi ko lohe ki kanghiyon se khurchta jata tha, us ki haddi ke neeche ka gosht ya pattha tak, phir bhi ye use us ke deen se na pherta tha, aur us ke sar ki mang par aara rakha jata aur do tukre kar diya jata, phir bhi ye use us ke deen se na pherta tha, Allah is muamle ko zaroor mukammal farmayega yahan tak ke sawar Sana se Hadramawt tak safar karega aur Allah ke siwa kisi se nahin darega, Bayan ne izafa kiya: Aur apni bakriyon par bheriye ke siwa."
"161","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne Mis'ar se, unhon ne Qais ibn Muslim se, unhon ne Tariq ibn Shihab se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke baqi mandah Sahaba Khabbab ki ayadat ke liye un ki bimari mein aaye aur farmaya: Khushkhabri ho, ae Abu Abdullah, tum Hauz par apne bhaiyon se miloge, unhon ne farmaya: Aur us par mard hain, tum ne mere samne qaumon ka zikr kiya aur mere liye bhaiyon ke naam liye jo guzar gaye baghair is ke ke unhon ne apne ajar mein se kuch paya, jabke hum un ke baad baqi rahe aur is duniya mein se itna paya jis ke bare mein hum darte hain ke kahin wahi un a'mal ka badla ho."
"162","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Urwah ibn Zubair ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Aisha Razi Allahu Anha ko farmate hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam pyale mein ghusl farmate the, jo faraq hai, aur main aur Aap ek hi bartan se ghusl karte the."
"163","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Zuhri ne Amrah se, unhon ne Aisha se bayan kiya ke Umm Habibah bint Jahsh saat saal tak istihaze mein mubtala rahin aur unhon ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sawal kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Ye sirf ek rag hai aur ye haiz nahi hai, Aap ne unhein ghusl karke namaz padhne ka hukm diya, wo har namaz ke liye ghusl kartin thin aur ghusl ke tasht mein baithtin jabke khoon us se upar ubhar aata tha."
"164","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se Saeed ibn Abi Saeed se, unhon ne Abu Salamah ibn Abdur Rahman se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Bakr ne Aisha ke samne wuzu kiya to unhon ne farmaya: Wuzu mukammal karo, ae Abdur Rahman, kyunke main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Aediyon ke liye Aag se halakat ho."
"165","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se Ibn Abi Atiq se, unhon ne Aisha se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Miswak munh ke liye taharat hai aur Rab ki khushnudi ka zariya hai."
"166","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Jab Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam janabat se ghusl ka irada farmate to pehle apne hathon ko bartan mein dalne se pehle dhote, phir apni sharmgah dhote, phir namaz ke liye apna wuzu farmate, phir apne balon ko pani se bhigote, phir apne sar par teen lap pani bahate."
"167","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Bachche Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein laye jate aur Aap un ke liye dua farmate, ek ladka laya gaya to us ne Aap par peshab kar diya to Aap ne us ke peshab par pani bahaya."
"168","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha se bayan kiya ke al-Abwa ki raat un ka haar gir gaya, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne do Musalman mardon ko us ki talash mein bheja, namaz aa gayi jabke un ke paas pani nahi tha aur wo nahi jante the ke kya karein, tayammum ki ayat nazil hui, Usaid ibn Hudair ne kaha: Allah tumhein bhalai ka badla de, tumhein kabhi koi aisa muamla pesh nahi aaya jise tum napasand karti ho magar Allah ne tumhare liye us se nikalne ka rasta banaya aur us mein Musalmanon ke liye bhalai rakhi."
"169","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mis'ar ibn Kidam ne hum se Miqdam ibn Shuraih se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha se bayan kiya ke unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mujhe haddi dete jabke main haiza hoti aur main use chabati, phir Aap use lete aur use pherte yahan tak ke Apna munh mere munh ki jagah par rakhte."
"170","Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mansur ibn Abdur Rahman Hajabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Meri walida ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Aisha ko farmate hue suna: Ek aurat ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se haiz se ghusl ke bare mein sawal kiya, Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mushk lagi rui ka tukda lo aur us se taharat hasil karo, us ne kaha: Main us se kis tarah taharat hasil karun, Aap ne farmaya: Us se taharat hasil karo, us ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Us se kis tarah taharat hasil karun, Aap ne apne hath se is tarah ishara farmaya: Subhan Allah, us se taharat hasil karo, aur Aap ne apne kapde se apne aap ko chhupa liya, Aisha ne farmaya: Main samajh gayi ke Aap ka kya matlab hai to main ne use ek taraf kiya aur us se kaha: Us se khoon ke nishanat ka ta'aqqub karo."
"171","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, Muadhah al-Adawiyyah se, Aishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ek hi bartan se ghusl kiya karte thay, aur woh kabhi mujh se farmate thay: Mere liye kuch chhor do, mere liye kuch chhor do."
"172","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Meri walida Safiyyah bint Shaybah ne mujhe khabar di, Aishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hum me se kisi ek ki god me apna sar rakhte thay aur Quran ki tilawat karte thay jabke woh haiz ki halat me hotin."
"173","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di, Aishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Asr ki namaz padhte thay jabke suraj mere hujre me abhi buland hota tha, is se pehle ke us par saya zahir hota."
"174","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apni raat ki namaz padhte thay jabke main un ke aur qibla ke darmiyan aarh leti hoti thi, janaze ke letne ki tarah."
"175","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aishah se ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne naqshdar ooni kapde me namaz padhi, aur farmaya: Us ke naqshon ne mujhe mashghul kar diya, ise Abu Jahm ke paas le jao aur mujhe us ki sada chadar la do."
"176","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Abi Labid ne hum se bayan kiya jo ahl-e-Madinah ke ibadat guzaron me se thay, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ko kehte hue suna: Main Aishah ki khidmat me hazir hua aur kaha: Ai ammi, mujhe Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki raat ki namaz aur un ke roze ke bare me khabar dijiye, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam roza rakhte thay yahan tak ke hum kehte ke unhon ne musalsal roza rakh liya hai, aur iftar karte thay yahan tak ke hum kehte ke unhon ne iftar kar liya hai, maine unhe Shaban me roza rakhne se zyada kisi mahine me roza rakhte hue nahi dekha, woh use mukammal rakhte thay, balke thore se hisse ke siwa use rakhte thay, Ramazan me aur us ke ilawa un ki raat ki namaz terah rakat thi, jin me Fajr ki do rakaten shamil thin."
"177","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Momin aurten Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Fajr ki namaz padhtin apni ooni chadron me lipti hui, phir apne gharon ko wapas jatin, andhere ki wajah se koi unhe pehchan na pata."
"178","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Nadr ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Aishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Fajr ki do rakaten padhte thay, agar main jaagi hui hoti to mujh se guftagu farmate, warna let jate yahan tak ke namaz ke liye khade hote."
"179","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad ibn Sad al-Khurasani ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Attab se, Abu Salamah se, Aishah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi ki manind."
"180","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqamah al-Laythi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Aishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apni raat ki namaz padhte thay jabke main un ke aur qibla ke darmiyan aarh leti hoti thi, jab witr padhne ka irada farmate to mujhe apne paon se hatate, phir do rakaten padhte, agar main jaagi hui hoti to mujh se guftagu farmate, warna let jate yahan tak ke namaz ke liye khade hote, aur Sufyan Abu al-Nadr ki hadith me shak karte thay, us me mutaraddid hote thay, aur kabhi Ziyad ki hadith me shak karte thay, farmate thay: Mujh par mushtabah ho jati hai, phir unhon ne humein ek se zyada martaba bataya: Abu al-Nadr ki hadith aisi hai, aur Ziyad ki hadith aisi hai, aur Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqamah ki hadith aisi hai, jaisa maine zikr kiya, ye sab."
"181","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se beshumar martaba bayan kiya, Amrah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Log apne liye khud kaam kiya karte thay, aur woh Jumuah ke din apne kaam ke kapron mein aate thay, to un se kaha gaya: Kash tum ghusl kar lete."
"182","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Yahya ibn Sa'id ko kehte hue suna: Maine Amrah ko A'ishah se rivayat karte hue suna, keh unhon ne farmaya: Ek Yahudi aurat aayi aur kaha: Allah tumhein qabr ke azab se mehfooz rakhe, maine kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, kya hum apni qabron mein azab diye jayenge, to unhon ne is se Allah ki panah mangne ka kalima farmaya, unhon ne farmaya: Phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ek din sawari par bahar tashreef le gaye, aur suraj ko grahan lag gaya, main kuch aurton ke hamrah hujron ke darmiyan se bahar nikli, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apni sawari se jaldi se aaye yahan tak keh apni namaz ki jagah par khare hue, unhon ne Allah ki takbeer kahi aur taweel qiyam kiya, phir taweel ruku kiya, phir sar uthaya aur taweel qiyam kiya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir taweel ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sar uthaya, phir taweel sajda kiya, phir sar uthaya, phir taweel sajda kiya jo pehle sajde se kam tha, phir dusri rakat mein bhi isi tarah kiya, unki namaz chaar ruku aur chaar sajde thi, unhon ne farmaya: Maine us ke baad unhein qabr ke azab se panah mangte hue suna, farmate thay: Tum apni qabron mein Masih ki fitne ki tarah, ya Dajjal ki fitne ki tarah aazmae jao ge."
"183","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, A'ishah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi ki manind chaar sajdon mein chaar rukuon ke bare mein, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur unhon ne is ke siwa kuch aur zikr nahin kiya."
"184","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Amrah se, A'ishah se, keh unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Fajr ki do rakatein itni halki parhte thay keh main kehti: Kya unhon ne un mein Fatihatul Kitab parhi hai."
"185","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, A'ishah se, keh Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ka khana rakh diya jaye aur namaz qaim ho jaye to pehle raat ke khane se ibteda karo."
"186","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id al-Maqburi se, Abu Salamah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas ek chatai thi jise woh din mein bichate thay, aur raat mein use hujre ki tarah bana lete aur us mein namaz parhte thay, to kuch log unki pairwi mein unki namaz ke sath namaz parhne lage, unhon ne farmaya: To Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhein mehsoos kar liya, to use tark kar diya, aur farmaya: Mujhe dar hua keh un par koi cheez farz kar di jayegi jiski woh taqat na rakh sakeinge, phir farmaya: Aamal mein se utna ikhtiyar karo jitna tum bardasht kar sakte ho, kyunkeh Allah nahin uktata yahan tak keh tum ukta jao, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko sab se mehboob amal woh tha jis par hameshgi ki jaye agarche thora ho, aur jab woh koi namaz parhte to us par mudawamat farmate thay."
"187","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam masjid mein etikaf mein thay aur apna sar meri taraf barhaya, aur maine use dhoya jabkeh main haiza thin."
"188","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, A'ishah se, keh Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein oonghne lage to use hat jana chahiye, kyunkeh woh nahin janta, shayad woh istighfar ka irada kare lekin apne aap ko bura kahe, ya unhon ne farmaya: Phir woh apne khilaf dua karta hai."
"189","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim se, Hammam se, unhon ne kaha: Ek mehmaan A'ishah ke paas thehra to unhon ne use bulane ke liye kehla bheja, logon ne un se kaha: Woh junbi ho gaya hai aur apna kapra dhone gaya hai, to A'ishah ne farmaya: Use kyun dhota hai, main Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke kapre se mani mal diya karti thi."
"190","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Yafur ibn Ubayd ibn Nistas ne hum se bayan kiya, Muslim ibn Subayh se, Masruq se, A'ishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan ka aakhri ashra dakhil hota to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apne ghar walon ko jagate, raat ko zinda rakhte, aur tehband kas lete, unhon ne kaha: Kisi aur ne kaha: Aur mehnat farmate thay."
"191","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Yafur bin Ubaid bin Nistas ne hum se bayan kiya, Muslim bin Subaih se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam raat ke har hisse mein witr parhte the, aur Aap ka witr sahar par khatam hota tha."
"192","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Saad bin Ibrahim se, Abu Salamah se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mere paas aakhri sahar ko soye hue ke siwa kabhi na paya."
"193","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha bin Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, apni phuphi Aisha bint Talha se, unhon ne apni khala Ummul Momineen Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mere paas tashreef laye aur farmaya: Kya koi khana hai? Maine kaha: Ji haan, aur maine Aap ke qareeb ek pyala kar diya jisme hays tha jo humne Aap ke liye sambhal kar rakha tha, to Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apna haath badhaya aur khaya, aur farmaya: Main to roze se tha."
"194","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha bin Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, apni phuphi Aisha bint Talha se, unhon ne apni khala Ummul Momineen Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ek din mere paas tashreef laye aur farmaya: Kya koi khana hai? Maine kaha: Hamare paas koi khana nahin hai, Aap ne farmaya: To phir main rozedar hun."
"195","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya Hisham bin Urwah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam raat ko khare ho kar namaz parhte the, phir jab Aap umr raseeda ho gaye to baith kar namaz parhne lage, phir jab tees ya chalis aayatein Aap par baqi reh jatin to khare ho jate, unki tilawat farmate, phir ruku farmate."
"196","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham bin Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha se ke Fatima bint Abi Hubaysh ko kasrat se khoon aata tha, to unhon ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se pucha, to Aap ne un se farmaya: Yeh to sirf ek rag hai aur yeh haiz nahin hai, jab haiz aaye to namaz chhor do aur jab woh chala jaye to ghusl karo aur namaz parho, ya farmaya: Khoon ko apne se dho dalo aur namaz parho."
"197","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham bin Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mere paas Asr ke baad ki do rakatein kabhi tark na farmain."
"198","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya Hisham bin Urwah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha se ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam paanch ke saath witr parhte the, sirf unme se aakhri mein baithte the."
"199","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne kaha: Maine Yahya bin Said ko Amrah se, Amrah ko Aisha se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Ramazan ke aakhri ashre mein etikaf ka irada farmaya, maine is bare mein suna aur Aap se ijazat mangi to Aap ne mujhe ijazat de di, phir Hafsa ne Aap se ijazat mangi to Aap ne unhein ijazat de di, phir Zainab ne Aap se ijazat mangi to Aap ne unhein ijazat de di, unhon ne kaha: Jab Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam etikaf ka irada farmate to Fajr parh kar apni etikaf gaah mein dakhil hote, phir jab Aap ne Fajr parhi to masjid mein chaar khaime dekhe aur farmaya: Yeh kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Aisha aur Hafsa aur Zainab ke liye hain, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya is se unhon ne neki ka irada kiya hai? To Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un dus dino mein etikaf na farmaya aur Shawwal mein dus din etikaf farmaya, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Kabhi Sufyan is hadith mein yun kehte: Kya tum unke saath isko neki kehte ho?"
"200","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim se, Alqama se, unhon ne kaha: Hum hajj ke liye nikle aur logon ne guftagu ki: Kya rozedar bosa de sakta hai? Logon mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Ji haan, aur ek aur shakhs ne jisne do saal roze rakhe the aur unki raaton mein qiyam kiya tha kaha: Mera ji chahta hai ke apni is kaman ko lekar tumhein marun, phir jab hum Madina pahunche to hum Aisha ke paas gaye aur unhon ne kaha: Ae Abu Shibl, un se pucho, maine kaha: Allah ki qasam main aaj sara din unke samne koi fahash baat munh se nahin nikalunga, unhon ne unki guftagu sun li aur kaha: Tum kya keh rahe the? Main to sirf tumhari maan hun, unhon ne kaha: Ae Ummul Momineen, kya rozedar bosa de sakta hai? Aisha ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam rozedar hote hue bosa lete aur gale lagate the, aur Aap apni khwahish par tum sab se zyada qaabu rakhne wale the."
"201","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim se kaha: Kya tum ne apne walid ko Aisha se bayan karte hue suna hai ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam roze se hote hue un ka bosa lete thay? Wo kuch der khamosh rahe, phir kaha: Haan."
"202","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam roze se hote hue apni kuch azwaj ka bosa lete thay. Phir woh hansin."
"203","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ke azaad karda ghulam Sumayy ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Aisha ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko fajr halat-e-janabat mein paa leti thi, phir Wo ghusl karte aur us din roza rakhte."
"204","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, ke musalsal roze rakhne wale Hamzah ibn Amr al-Aslami ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, main musalsal roza rakhta hun; kya main safar mein roza rakhun? Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho to roza rakho, aur agar chaho to iftar karo."
"205","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri aur Hisham ibn Urwah dono ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Ramazan ka mahina nazil hone se pehle zamana-e-jahiliyat mein Ashura ka din roza rakha jata tha. Jab Ramazan ka mahina nazil hua to jo chahta us ka roza rakhta aur jo chahta na rakhta."
"206","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Safiyyah bint Huyayy ko tawaf-e-wida ke baad haiz aaya. Main ne un ke haiz ka zikr Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya wo hamein rok kar rakhegi? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, unhein tawaf-e-wida ke baad haiz aaya hai. Aap ne farmaya: Phir wo rawana ho jaye."
"207","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se is ki manind, siwa is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Phir nahi, koi harj nahi."
"208","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath rawana hue, aur Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo Hajj aur Umrah ka ehram bandhna chahe to ehram bandhe, aur jo Hajj ka ehram bandhna chahe to ehram bandhe, aur jo Umrah ka ehram bandhna chahe to ehram bandhe. Aisha ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Hajj ka ehram bandha, aur Aap ke sath kuch logon ne us ka ehram bandha, aur kuch logon ne Umrah ka ehram bandha, aur main un mein se thi jinhon ne Umrah ka ehram bandha. Sufyan ne kaha: Phir hadith mujh par ghalib aa gayi; yehi hai jo maine is mein se yaad rakha."
"209","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad al-Darawardi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Alqamah ne mujhe khabar di, apni walida se, Aisha se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo Umrah ka ehram bandhna chahe to bandhe. Aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Hajj-e-mufrad kiya aur Umrah nahi kiya."
"210","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Damrah Anas ibn Iyad al-Laythi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Urwah ke yateem Abu al-Aswad Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ne mujh se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aisha se, ke unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath rawana hue. Hum mein se kuch ne Hajj-e-mufrad kiya, kuch ne qiran kiya, aur kuch ne Umrah kiya. To jis ne Baitullah ka tawaf kiya aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sai ki wo ehram se nikal gaya; aur jis ne Hajj-e-mufrad ya qiran kiya wo Jamrah ki rami tak ehram se na nikla."
"211","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne A'ishah ko farmate hue suna: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Un ke Hajj me rawana hue, Hajj ke siwa kuch khayal me na tha, jab main Sarif me ya us ke qareeb thi to mujhe haiz aaya, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mere paas tashreef laye jabke main ro rahi thi, aur farmaya: Tumhe kya hua, kya tumhe haiz aaya hai, maine kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: Ye ek aisa muamla hai jo Allah ne Banat-e-Adam ke liye muqarrar farmaya hai, pas woh sab ada karo jo haji ada karta hai siwaye is ke ke tum Baitullah ka tawaf na karo, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apni azwaj ki taraf se gaayon ki qurbani ki."
"212","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Amrah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Dhu al-Qa'dah ki paanch raatein baqi hote hue rawana hue, Hajj ke siwa kuch khayal me na tha, jab hum Sarif me ya us ke qareeb the to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hukm farmaya ke jis ke sath qurbani ka janwar na ho woh use Umrah bana le, jab hum Mina me the to mere paas gaay ka gosht laya gaya, to maine kaha: Ye kya hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apni azwaj ki taraf se gaayen zibah ki hain, Yahya ne kaha: Maine ye Al-Qasim ko bayan kiya to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam unhon ne tumhe hadith durust bayan ki."
"213","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke qurbani ke janwaron ke haar apne inhi hathon se balti thi, phir Aap kisi cheez se parhez na farmate jis se ehram wala parhez karta hai."
"214","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se khabar dete hue, A'ishah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke qurbani ke janwaron ke haar apne inhi hathon se balti thi, phir Aap kisi cheez se door na rehte jis se ehram wala door rehta hai aur na use tark farmate, A'ishah ne farmaya: Aur hum nahi jante ke Baitullah ke tawaf ke siwa koi cheez haji ko halal karti hai."
"215","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine A'ishah ko suna, apna hath phelate hue farmati thin: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko apne inhi hathon se khushbu lagai Un ke ehram ke liye jab Aap ne ehram bandha aur Un ke ehram kholne ke liye qabl is ke ke Aap Baitullah ka tawaf karte, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Yehi woh hai jise hum ikhtiyar karte hain."
"216","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Al-Zuhri ko Urwah se, A'ishah se bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko apne inhi hathon se khushbu lagai Un ke ehram ke liye jab Aap ne ehram bandha aur Un ke ehram kholne ke liye qabl is ke ke Aap Baitullah ka tawaf karte, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ye un me se hai jo Sufyan ibtidai zamanay me Al-Zuhri se bayan nahi karte the, hum ne unhe is par roka to unhon ne kaha: Maine ise Al-Zuhri se suna hai."
"217","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim ibn Abdullah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne farmaya: Jab tum Jamrah ko kankariyan maro aur qurbani karo aur sar mundao to har woh cheez jo tum par haram thi halal ho jati hai siwaye auraton aur khushbu ke, Salim ibn Abdullah ne kaha: A'ishah ne farmaya: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Un ke ehram ke liye khushbu lagai jab Aap ne ehram bandha aur Un ke ehram kholne ke liye Jamrah ko kankariyan marne ke baad aur Baitullah ki ziyarat se pehle, Salim ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ka tareeqa sab se zyada mustahiq hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye."
"218","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne A'ishah ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Un ke ehram ke liye aur Un ke ehram kholne ke liye khushbu lagai, maine kaha: Kis khushbu se, unhon ne farmaya: Behtareen khushbu se."
"219","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne farmaya: Uthman ibn Urwah ne mujh se kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ye hadith sirf mujh se bayan karte hain."
"220","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ibn al-Sa'ib ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim se, Al-Aswad ibn Yazid se, A'ishah se ke unhon ne farmaya: Maine teen din ke baad Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke baalon ki maang me khushbu ki chamak dekhi jabke Aap ehram me the."
"221","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibrahim ibn Muhammad ibn al-Muntashir ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Ibn Umar se muhrim ke liye ehram ke waqt khushbu ke bare mein pucha, to unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand nahi ke main subah is halat mein ehram mein dakhil hun ke mujh se khushbu ki mehek phoot rahi ho; mere nazdeek qeer malna us se zyada mehboob hai; mere walid ne farmaya: Abdullah ke beton mein se ek ne Aisha ki taraf (aadmi) bheja taake us ke walid sun saken jo woh farmati hain, to qasid aaya aur bola: Unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko khushbu lagai thi, to Ibn Umar khamosh ho gaye."
"222","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Amash se, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad se, Aisha se ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek martaba bhedon ko qurbani ke janwaron ke tor par bheja; Al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Abu Muawiyah ne mere liye is mein izafa kiya: Aur unhon ne unhen qelade pehnaye."
"223","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Jarir ibn Abd al-Hamid al-Dabbi ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad se, Aisha se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke qurbani ke janwaron ke qelade bhed ki oon se maror kar banati thi, phir woh kisi cheez se parhez na karte the jis se muhrim parhez karta hai."
"224","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine al-Zuhri ko bayan karte hue suna, Urwah se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Aisha ke samne parha: Beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain; jo Baitullah ka Hajj kare ya Umra kare to us par un dono ka tawaf karne mein koi harj nahi, to maine kaha: Agar main un dono ka tawaf na karun to mujhe parwa nahi, to unhon ne farmaya: Ae meri behan ke bete, tum ne kitni buri baat kahi; baat sirf ye thi ke jo Manat ke liye ehram bandhte the, jo al-Mushallal par jhoota mabood tha, woh Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan tawaf na karte the, to Allah ne nazil farmaya: Beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain; jo Baitullah ka Hajj kare ya Umra kare to us par un dono ka tawaf karne mein koi harj nahi, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne tawaf kiya aur Musalmanon ne tawaf kiya; Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur Mujahid ne farmaya: To woh sunnat ban gaya; al-Zuhri ne farmaya: To maine ye Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ko bayan kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Ye to yaqeenan ilm hai; maine ahl-e-ilm ko kehte hue suna hai: Ahl-e-Arab mein se jo Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan tawaf na karte the woh kehte the: In dono patharon ke darmiyan hamara tawaf umoor-e-jahiliyat mein se hai, aur Ansar mein se dusre kehte the: Hamen to sirf Baitullah ke tawaf ka hukm diya gaya tha aur hamen Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan tawaf ka hukm nahi diya gaya tha, to Allah ne nazil farmaya: Beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain; Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ne farmaya: Shayad ye in ke aur un ke bare mein nazil hui thi."
"225","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ibn Abi Mulaykah ko kehte hue suna: Main Umm Aban bint Uthman ke janaze mein hazir tha, aur janaze mein Abdullah ibn Umar aur Abdullah ibn Abbas the, to main un dono ke darmiyan baitha, aur aurten ro rahi thin, to Ibn Umar ne farmaya: Zinda ka murde par rona murde ke liye azab hai; unhon ne farmaya: To Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Hum Umar Amir-ul-Momineen ke sath nikle hatta ke jab hum al-Bayda mein the to unhon ne sawaaron ko ek darakht ke neeche utre hue dekha aur farmaya: Jao ae Abdullah, dekho ye sawaar kaun hain, phir mere sath milo, unhon ne farmaya: To main gaya, phir main wapas aaya aur maine kaha: Ye Suhayb hain, Ibn Judan ke azaad karda ghulam, to unhon ne farmaya: Un se kaho ke mujh se milen; jab woh Madina pahunche to Umar zyada arsa na rahe the ke un par waar karke unhen zakhmi kar diya gaya, to Suhayb aaye kehte hue: Haaye mere bhai, haaye mere sathi, to Umar ne farmaya: Khamosh raho ae Suhayb, murde ko zinda ke us par rone se azab diya jata hai; Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: To main Aisha ke paas gaya aur un se pucha, to unhon ne farmaya: Allah Umar par rehem farmaye; Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne sirf ye farmaya tha: Allah kafir ke azab mein us ke ghar walon ke us par rone ki wajah se izafa karta hai; aur Allah ne faisla farma diya hai: Koi bojh uthane wala dusre ka bojh nahi uthayega."
"226","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Amrah se ke unhon ne Aisha ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne sirf ek Yahudi aurat ke bare mein farmaya tha, jabke woh us par ro rahe the: Us ke ghar wale ab us par ro rahe hain jabke use us ki qabr mein azab diya ja raha hai."
"227","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Qilabah se, Abdullah ibn Yazid se, jo Aisha ke razai bhai hain, Aisha se ke unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi mayyit aisi nahi jis par logon ki ek jamaat jo ek sau tak pahunche namaz parhe aur us ke liye sifarish kare magar us ke liye un ki sifarish qubool ki jati hai."
"228","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Madina tashreef laye to un ke Sahaba bukhar mein mubtala ho gaye, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Abu Bakr ki ayadat ke liye tashreef laye aur farmaya: Tum apne aap ko kaisa pate ho ae Abu Bakr, to Abu Bakr ne (shear ke tukde mein) kaha: Musabbahun shiraki; aur unhon ne Amir ibn Fuhayrah ki ayadat ki aur farmaya: Tum apne aap ko kaisa pate ho, to unhon ne (shear ke tukde mein) kaha: Hatfuhu; unhon ne farmaya: Aur unhon ne Bilal ki ayadat ki aur farmaya: Tum apne aap ko kaisa pate ho, to unhon ne (shear ke tukde mein) kaha: Bi-fakhkhin idhkhirun; unhon ne farmaya: To Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, Ibrahim Tere bande aur Tere khalil hain; unhon ne Ahl-e-Makkah ke liye Tujh se dua ki, aur main Tera banda aur Tera Rasul hun; main Ahl-e-Madina ke liye Tujh se usi jaisi dua karta hun jaisi unhon ne Ahl-e-Makkah ke liye Tujh se ki thi; ae Allah, hamare sa mein barkat de, hamare mudd mein barkat de, aur hamare sheher mein barkat de; Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur main is mein dekhta hun: aur hamare faraq mein: Ae Allah, use hamen mehboob bana de jaisa Tune Makkah ko hamen mehboob banaya tha ya us se zyada, use sehatmand bana de, aur us ki waba aur us ke bukhar ko Khumm ya al-Juhfah ki taraf muntaqil kar de."
"229","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se ke unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne sirf ye farmaya tha: Woh ab jante hain ke jo main unhen duniya mein bataya karta tha woh sach hai; aur Allah ne Apne Nabi se farmaya hai: Beshak aap murdon ko nahi suna sakte."
"230","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zakariyya ibn Abi Zaidah se, al-Shabi se, Shurayh ibn Hani se, Aisha se ke unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah se mulaqat ko mehboob rakhe Allah us se mulaqat ko mehboob rakhta hai, aur jo Allah se mulaqat ko napasand kare Allah us se mulaqat ko napasand karta hai; aur Us se mulaqat (Allah se mulaqat) maut ke baad hai."
"231","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Urwah ne mujhe khabar di, Aisha se, ke unhon ne unhein kehte hue suna: Rifa’ah al-Qurazi ki biwi Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein aayin aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, main Rifa’ah al-Qurazi ke nikah mein thi aur us ne mujhe teesri aakhri talaq de di, phir main ne Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Zubayr se nikah kar liya, aur us ke paas jo hai woh is jhalar ki tarah hai. To Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam muskuraye aur farmaya: “Kya tum Rifa’ah ki taraf lautna chahti ho? Nahin, jab tak tum us ka zara sa shehad na chakh lo aur woh tumhara zara sa shehad na chakh le.” Unhon ne farmaya: Aur Abu Bakr Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas the, aur Khalid ibn Sa’id ibn al-As darwaze par ijazat ke intezar mein tha, to us ne pukara: Ai Abu Bakr, kya tum nahin sunte jo yeh aurat Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke samne khule taur par keh rahi hai? Sufyan se kaha gaya: Malik ise al-Zuhri se riwayat nahin karte; woh ise sirf al-Miswar ibn Rifa’ah se riwayat karte hain. To Sufyan ne farmaya: Lekin hum ne ise al-Zuhri se suna jaisa hum ne tumhein bayan kiya."
"232","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di, Aisha se, ke unhon ne un se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhne wali aurat ke liye halal nahin ke woh kisi mayyat par teen din se zyada sog manaye, siwaye shohar ke.” To Sufyan se kaha gaya: Lekin woh us par chaar mahine aur das din sog manati hai? To Sufyan ne farmaya: al-Zuhri ne humein apni hadith mein yeh nahin bataya; Ayyub ibn Musa ne humein apni hadith mein yeh bataya."
"233","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan aur Abdullah ibn Raja al-Muzani ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Musa se, al-Zuhri se, Urwah ibn al-Zubayr se, Aisha se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Jo aurat apne wali ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare, us ka nikah batil hai, us ka nikah batil hai, us ka nikah batil hai. Phir agar woh us se sohbat kar le to us ke liye mahr hai, us cheez ke badle jo us ne us ki sharmgah se halal ki; aur agar woh jhagda karein to hukmaran us ka wali hai jis ka koi wali na ho."
"234","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne al-Zuhri ko bayan karte hue suna, Urwah se, Aisha se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Raza’at ke rishte se mere chacha Aflah ibn Abi al-Qu’ays parda farz hone ke baad mujh se mulaqat ki ijazat mangne aaye, aur main ne unhein ijazat na di. Jab Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam tashreef laye to main ne Aap ko ittela di, to Aap ne farmaya: “Woh tumhare chacha hain, to unhein ijazat do."
"235","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Aur Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi ki manind, is izafe ke saath ke unhon ne farmaya: To main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe to sirf aurat ne doodh pilaya tha; mard ne mujhe doodh nahin pilaya tha. To Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Tumhara dahina haath khaak aalood ho; woh tumhare chacha hain, to unhein ijazat do."
"236","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya — aur yeh un ki behtareen riwayaat mein se thi — apne walid se, Aisha se, jinhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se nikah kiya jab main chhe ya saat baras ki thi, aur Aap ne mujh se sohbat ki jab main nau baras ki thi."
"237","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sa’id ibn al-Marzuban ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Aswad se, apne walid se, Aisha se, jinhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se nikah kiya jab main hawf pehne hue thi, aur jab Aap ne mujh se nikah kiya to mujh par haya daal di gayi. Sufyan ne farmaya: Al-hawf tasmon se bane libas hain jo dehati apne bachchon ko pehnate hain."
"238","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya — aur main ne ise un se yaad kiya, aur woh taweel thi, to main ne us mein se yeh yaad kiya — unhon ne farmaya: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Aisha se pucha, kehte hue: Ai ammi, mujhe Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki us bimari ke baare mein khabar dijiye jis mein Aap ki wafaat hui. To unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam us bimari mein shadeed bimar ho gaye jis mein Aap ki wafaat hui, is tarah haanphte hue jaise kishmish khane wala haanphta hai, aur Aap apni biwiyon ke paas chakar lagate the. Jab Aap par bojh badh gaya aur takleef shadeed ho gayi to Aap ne un se mere paas rehne ki ijazat mangi, to unhon ne Aap ko ijazat de di. To Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mere paas do mardon ka sahara liye hue tashreef laye, jin mein se ek al-Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib the. Ubaydullah ne farmaya: To main ne ise Ibn Abbas ko bayan kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Kya unhon ne tumhein dusre ke baare mein khabar na di? Main ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne farmaya: Dusre Ali ibn Abi Talib the."
"239","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Isma’il ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne al-Sha’bi ko bayan karte hue suna, Masruq se, jinhon ne farmaya: Main ne Aisha ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apni biwiyon ko ikhtiyar diya tha, aur unhon ne Aap ko chun liya; to kya woh talaq thi?"
"240","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Aisha se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki wafaat na hui yahan tak ke Aap ke liye aurtein halal kar di gayin."
"241","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum se Mansur ibn Abd al-Rahman se un ki walida ke waste se Aisha se riwayat ki gayi ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apni ek zauja ka waleema jau ke sath kiya, Al-Humaydi ne kaha: To hum ne Sufyan ko roka to unhon ne kaha: Main ne ise nahi suna."
"242","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Uthman ibn Safwan al-Jumahi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Sadaqa (yaani ada na karda farz sadaqa) maal me kabhi shamil nahi hota magar ise tabah kar deta hai, unhon ne kaha: Ho sakta hai ke tumhare maal me se tum par sadaqa wajib hua ho aur tum use ada na karo to haram halal ko halak kar de."
"243","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne khabar di, ke unhon ne Aisha ko kehte hue suna: Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas aur Abd ibn Zam'ah ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke samne Zam'ah ki laundi ke bete ke bare me jhagda kiya, to Sa'd ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, mere bhai Utbah ne mujhe wasiyyat ki thi, kehte hue: Jab tum Makkah aao to Zam'ah ki laundi ke bete ko dekho aur use le lo kyunke woh mera beta hai, aur Abd ibn Zam'ah ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, woh mera bhai hai, mere walid ki laundi ka beta hai, aur woh mere walid ke bistar par paida hua, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Utbah se wazeh mushabihat dekhi aur farmaya: Woh tumhara hai, ae Abd ibn Zam'ah, bachcha (nikah ke) bistar ka hai, aur us se parda karo, ae Saudah, to Sufyan se kaha gaya: Malik kehte hain: Aur zani ke liye pathar hai, to Sufyan ne kaha: Lekin hum ne al-Zuhri se is hadith me yeh kehte hue mehfooz nahi kiya."
"244","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne khabar di, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ek din mere pas khush khush tashrif laye aur farmaya: Ae Aisha, kya tum ne nahi dekha ke Mujazziz al-Mudliji mere pas andar aya aur us ne Zayd aur Usamah ko dekha, un par ek makhmali chadar thi jis ne un ke sar dhanke hue the jabke un ke qadam khule the, to us ne kaha: Yeh qadam ek dusre ka hissa hain."
"245","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Jurayj ko ise al-Zuhri se riwayat karte hue suna, aur unhon ne is me kaha: Kya tum ne nahi dekha ke Muhriz al-Mudliji, to main ne kaha: Ae Abu al-Walid, woh to sirf Mujazziz al-Mudliji hai, to un ki tasheeh ki gayi to unhon ne ruju kar liya."
"246","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Amrah bint Abd al-Rahman se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Main Barirah ko khareed kar azad karna chahti thi magar us ke malikon ne mujh par shart lagayi ke main use azad karun jabke wala ka haq un ka hoga, to main ne is ke bare me Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se pucha to unhon ne farmaya: Use khareedo aur azad karo kyunke wala sirf usi ka hai jo azad kare, phir unhon ne logon se khitab farmaya, kehte hue: Logon ka kya haal hai jo aisi sharten lagate hain jo Allah ki Kitab me nahi hain, jo koi aisi shart lagaye jo Allah ki Kitab me nahi hai woh us ki nahi hai chahe woh sau martaba shart lagaye, wala sirf usi ka hai jo azad kare."
"247","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, ke Hind bint Utbah Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke pas ayin aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, Abu Sufyan bakhil mard hai, aur mujhe us se apne ghar walon ke liye us ke siwa kuch nahi milta jo main leti hun, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhe aur tumhare bachche ko dastur ke mutabiq kifayat kare woh le lo."
"248","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, ke ek mard ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se kaha: Meri walida faut ho gayin, aur mera khayal hai ke agar woh bolteen to sadaqa deteen, to kya un ke liye sawab hai agar main un ki taraf se sadaqa dun, unhon ne farmaya: Haan, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur logon ne Hisham se ek jumla mehfooz kiya jo main ne mehfooz nahi kiya, ke unhon ne kaha: Meri walida ki ruh achanak qabz ki gayi aur woh faut ho gayin, main ne ise Hisham se mehfooz nahi kiya, yeh jumla mujhe sirf Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne Hisham se khabar de kar bataya."
"249","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam qarz ke ghalbe se panah manga karte the."
"250","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aisha se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi ki manind, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Aur Sufyan ne ise al-Zuhri se nahi suna."
"251","Al-Humaydi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: A'mash ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim se, Umarah ibn Umayr se, un ki ek phuphi se, Aisha se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Tumhari aulad tumhari behtareen kamai me se hai, pas apni kamai me se khao."
"252","Al-Humaydi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Urwah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurayrah Aisha ke hujre ke pahlu me baithe jabke woh namaz padh rahi thin, aur bayan karne lage, kehte hue: Suno, ae hujre wali, pas jab unhon ne apni namaz khatm ki to mujh se kaha: Ae meri behan ke bete, kya tujhe is shakhs aur us ki riwayat par ta'ajjub nahi hota, Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam sirf aise kalimat farmate the ke agar unhen ginne wala ginta to unhen shumar kar leta, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Aur Sufyan ne ise Zuhri se nahi suna tha."
"253","Al-Humaydi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhri ne ham se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aisha se, ke Yahudiyon ka ek giroh Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me dakhil hua aur kaha: As-sam tum par ho, ae Abul Qasim, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Aur tum par,” pas Aisha ne kaha: Balke tum par maut aur la'nat ho, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Ae Aisha, Allah Azzawajalla har muamle me narmi ko pasand farmata hai,” unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya ap ne nahi suna, ae Allah ke Rasool, jo unhon ne kaha, unhon ne kaha: As-sam tum par ho, to unhon ne farmaya: “Main ne kaha hai: Tum par,” Abu Bakr ne kaha: Aur Sufyan kabhi kabhi is hadith me kehte the: “Wa alaykum,” lekin jab unhen is par roka gaya to unhon ne waw ko saqit kar diya (sirf: “Alaykum” kehte hue)."
"254","Al-Humaydi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne ham se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ko bayan karte hue suna, Aisha se, ke unhon ne un se kehte hue suna: Ek shakhs ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me hazir hone ki ijazat talab ki, to Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Use andar ane do, qabile ka kya hi bura beta hai” ya unhon ne farmaya: “Qabile ka bhai hai,” pas jab woh andar dakhil hua to unhon ne us se narmi se guftagu farmai, pas jab woh chala gaya to main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, ap ne us ke bare me jo farmaya tha woh farmaya, phir ap ne us se narmi se guftagu farmai, to unhon ne farmaya: “Ae Aisha, Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek martabe ke etebar se badtareen shakhs woh hai jise log us ki fahhash-goi ke khauf se chhod den ya unhon ne farmaya: jise log akele chhod den,” Sufyan ne kaha: Pas main ne Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se kaha: Main dekhta hun ke tum hamesha is hadith me shak karte ho."
"255","Al-Humaydi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhri ne ham se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aisha se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Kisi mal ne hamen kabhi aisa nafa nahi diya jaisa Abu Bakr ke mal ne hamen nafa diya,” Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Pas Sufyan se kaha gaya: Ma'mar ise Sa'id se riwayat karta hai, to unhon ne kaha: Ham ne ise Zuhri se sirf Urwah se, Aisha se suna hai."
"256","Al-Humaydi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhri ne ham se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Qasim ibn Muhammad ko bayan karte hue suna, ke unhon ne Aisha ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mere pas tashreef laye jabke main ne tasveeron wale ek parde se parda kiya hua tha, pas jab Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne use dekha to un ka chehra mutaghayyir ho gaya, phir unhon ne use phad diya aur farmaya: “Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek sab se sakht azab wale log woh honge jo Allah ki makhluq ki mushabihat karte hain, Azzawajalla,” Sufyan ne kaha: Jab Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim hamare pas aye to unhon ne ham se is se behtar aur rukhsat ke sath bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, ke unhon ne Aisha ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam tashreef laye jabke main ne apne ek chhote se store par tasveeron wale apne ek parde se parda kiya hua tha, pas jab Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne use dekha to use hata diya aur farmaya: “Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek sab se sakht azab wale log woh honge jo Allah ki makhluq Azzawajalla ki surat banate hain,” Aisha ne kaha: Pas ham ne us me se ek takiya ya do takiye kat liye."
"257","Al-Humaydi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd Rabbih ibn Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, Amrah bint Abd al-Rahman se, Aisha se, ke jab koi shakhs kisi cheez ki shikayat karta, ya use phoda ya zakhm hota, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apni ungli se is tarah farmate the aur Abu Bakr ne apni shahadat ki ungli zameen par rakhi, phir use uthaya: “Allah ke naam se, hamari zameen ki mitti ham me se baz ke luaab ke sath, hamara mareez hamare Rabb ki ijazat se shifa pata hai."
"258","Al-Humaydi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne ham se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Sa'd ibn Ibrahim ko bayan karte hue suna, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Aisha se, ke unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Tum se pehli ummaton me ilham kiye gaye mard (muhaddathun) hote the, pas agar is ummat me koi hai to woh Umar ibn al-Khattab hai."
"259","Al-Humaydi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Ya'qub ibn Zayd al-Taymi ne ham se bayan kiya, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Kuch Habshi apne nezon se khel rahe the, aur main Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke kan aur kandhe ke darmiyan se dekhti rahi, yahan tak ke main hi woh thi jis ne munh pher liya, Ya'qub ibn Zayd ne apni hadith me izafa kiya: Pas Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Un me se koi nahi hai magar ek shaitan ne us ka kapda pakad rakha hai, kehte hue: Dekho, lekin jab Umar aye to shaitan muntashir ho gaye,” unhon ne kaha: Aur Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Khelo, ae Banu Arfidah, taake Yahud aur Nasara jan len ke hamare deen me gunjaish hai,” Aisha ne kaha: Main ne un ki baton me se is jumle ke siwa kuch yaad nahi rakha: “Abul Qasim achhe hain, Abul Qasim achhe hain."
"260","Al-Humaydi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam kharbuze ko taza khajuron ke sath mila kar khaya karte the."
"261","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, unhon ne farmaya: al-Harith ibn Hisham ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se poocha: Aap ke paas wahi kis tarah aati hai? To Aap ne farmaya: “Kabhi mere paas ghanti ki jhankar ki tarah aati hai, phir mujh se juda hoti hai baad is ke ke main us me se baat ko mehfooz kar leta hun, aur wahi mujh par sab se zyada sakht hoti hai; aur kabhi mere paas naujawan ki soorat me aati hai, aur wo use mujh tak pahuncha deta hai, aur main use mehfooz kar leta hun, aur wahi mujh par sab se zyada aasan hoti hai."
"262","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ma’mar ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aisha se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko sab se zyada mehboob mashroob meetha thanda mashroob tha."
"263","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Fudayl ibn Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur ibn al-Mu’tamir se, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah se, Aisha se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko kabhi apni zaat par hone wali zyadti ka badla lete hue nahin dekha, jab tak Allah ki hurmaton ko pamal na kiya gaya ho; lekin jab Allah ki hurmaton me se kisi cheez ko pamal kiya jata to Aap is bare me sab se zyada ghazabnak hote; aur Aap ko kabhi do maamlon ke darmiyan ikhtiyar nahin diya gaya magar Aap ne un me se aasan tareen ko ikhtiyar kiya, jab tak wo gunah na ho."
"264","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam itni itni muddat tak ye khayal karte rahe ke Aap apni biwiyon ke paas jate hain halanke Aap un ke paas nahin jate the; unhon ne farmaya: Phir ek din Aap ne farmaya: “Ai Aisha, kya tum ne jana ke Allah Azza wa Jall ne mujhe us muamle me fatwa de diya jis me maine Us se fatwa manga tha? Mere paas do aadmi aaye; un me se ek mere paon ki taraf baitha aur dusra mere sar ki taraf; mere paon ki taraf wale ne mere sar ki taraf wale se kaha: Is shakhs ko kya hua hai? Us ne kaha: Ye matbub (sehr zadah) hai; us ne kaha: Aur ise kis ne sehr kiya hai? Us ne kaha: Labid ibn al-A’sam ne; us ne kaha: Aur kis cheez me? Us ne kaha: Nar khajoor ke ghilaf me, kanghi aur kanghi ke balon me, Dharwan ke kunwen me pathar ke neeche;” unhon ne farmaya: To Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam us ki taraf gaye aur farmaya: “Ye wahi kunwan hai jo mujhe dikhaya gaya tha; goya us ke khajoor ke darakhton ke sar shayateen ke sar hain, aur us ka pani goya mehndi ka ghola hai;” unhon ne farmaya: To Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us ke bare me hukm diya, aur use nikal liya gaya; Aisha ne farmaya: To maine kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, Aap ne kyun nahin...? Sufyan ne farmaya: Ya’ni: use zaahir kyun na kiya (khul kar dam ya ilaj talab kyun na kiya); To Aap ne farmaya: “Allah ki qasam, Us ne mujhe shifa de di hai; raha main, to main napasand karta hun ke is se logon ke khilaf shar ko ubharun;” unhon ne farmaya: Aur Labid ibn al-A’sam Banu Zurayq ka ek aadmi tha, jo Yahud ka haleef tha; Sufyan ne farmaya: Abd al-Malik ibn Jurayj ne Hisham se mulaqat se pehle hamen ye pehle bayan ki thi, kehte hue: Mujhe Urwah ke ghar walon me se kisi ne bayan kiya; phir jab Hisham aaye to unhon ne hamen ye bayan ki."
"265","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, unhon ne farmaya: Main in guriyon se khelti thi, aur laundiyan mere paas aakar mere sath in se khelti thin; jab wo Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekhtin to chhup jatin, aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam unhen mere paas bhej dete."
"266","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se daud ka muqabla kiya aur main Aap se aage nikal gayi; phir jab main gosht se bhari ho gayi to Aap ne mujh se muqabla kiya aur Aap mujh se aage nikal gaye; to Aap ne farmaya: “Ai Aisha, ye us ke badle me hai."
"267","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Tum me se koi ye na kahe: Main khabith al-nafs hun; balke use kehna chahiye: Main laqis al-nafs hun."
"268","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Aisha ne mujh se farmaya: Ai meri behan ke bete, tumhare do walid yaqinan un logon me se the jinhon ne Allah aur Rasool ko jawab diya baad is ke ke unhen zakhm pahunch chuke the... Abu Bakr aur al-Zubayr ibn al-Awwam."
"269","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Jami’ ibn Abi Rashid ne hum se bayan kiya, Mundhir al-Thawri se, al-Hasan ibn Muhammad se, ek khatoon se, Aisha se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Jab zameen me burai khul kar zaahir ho jaye to Allah Azza wa Jall zameen walon par Apna azab nazil farmata hai;” unhon ne farmaya: To maine kaha: Kya hum halak ho jayenge halanke hum me Allah ke farmabardar log honge? Aap ne farmaya: “Han; phir tum Allah Azza wa Jall ki rehmat ki taraf lautoge."
"270","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Talhah ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, apni phuphi Aisha bint Talhah se, unhon ne apni khala Aisha Ummul Momineen se, unhon ne farmaya: Ansar ke bachon me se ek ladka Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me laya gaya taake Aap us par namaz padhen, to maine kaha: Us ke liye khushkhabri hai; Jannat ki chidiyon me se ek chidiya; us ne kabhi koi burai nahin ki, aur na use gunah ne pa liya; To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Ya is ke siwa kuch aur, ai Aisha! Allah Azza wa Jall ne Jannat ko paida kiya aur us ke liye log paida kiye, unhen paida karte hue jabke wo apne baapon ki pushton me the; aur Us ne Jahannam ko paida kiya aur us ke liye log paida kiye, unhen paida karte hue jabke wo apne baapon ki pushton me the."
"271","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zakariyya ibn Abi Zaidah se, Abbas ibn Zarih se, Al-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Muawiyah ibn Abi Sufyan ne Aisha ko khat likha: Mujhe woh likh bhejen jo aap ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suna hai. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne un ko likha: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs Allah ki nafarmani mein amal kare, logon mein se us ki ta'rif karne wala malamat karne wala ban jayega."
"272","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Abi Khalid se, Al-Sha'bi se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne kabhi koi lashkar rawana nahi farmaya jis mein Zaid ibn Harithah maujud hon magar ye ke aap ne unhein un par amir muqarrar farmaya."
"273","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Abi Khalid se, Qais ibn Abi Hazim se, Abu Sahlah se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek din farmaya: Kash mere pas mere Sahaba mein se koi shakhs hota. To main ne kaha: Kya hum aap ke liye Abu Bakr ko na bulayen. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Phir farmaya: Kash mere pas mere Sahaba mein se koi shakhs hota. To main ne kaha: Kya hum aap ke liye Umar ko na bulayen. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Phir farmaya: Kash mere pas mere Sahaba mein se koi shakhs hota. To main ne kaha: Kya hum aap ke liye aap ke chachazad bhai Ali ibn Abi Talib ko na bulayen. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Phir farmaya: Kash mere pas mere Sahaba mein se koi shakhs hota. To main ne kaha: Kya hum aap ke liye Usman ko na bulayen. To aap khamosh ho gaye. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne unhein bulane ka hukm diya, aur jab woh aap ke pas aaye to aap un ke sath tanhai mein hue, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam un se guftagu farmate rahe jabke Usman ka chehra rang badalta raha. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur unhon ne mujh se Ibn Abi Khalid se, Qais se, Abu Sahlah se bayan kiya ke Aisha ne is hadith mein kaha: Mujhe un ki baton mein se kuch yaad na raha siwaye is ke ke aap ne farmaya: Agar woh tum se us qamis ko utarne ka mutalaba karen jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ne tumhein pehnayi hai to aisa na karna."
"274","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Said se, Ismail ibn Abi Hakim se, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ne kaha: Allah Azza wa Jalla aam logon ko khas logon ke a'mal ki wajah se azab nahi deta, lekin jab gunah khullam khulla zahir hon aur unhein badla na jaye to aam aur khas dono pakre jate hain."
"275","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Miqdam ibn Shuraih se, un ke walid se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Jab hamein barish ata ki jati to Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam farmate: Ae Allah, behne wali nafa bakhsh barish. Sufyan ne kaha: Isi tarah main ne ise yaad kiya: sayban, lekin jo unhon ne yaad kiya hai woh zyada sahi hai: sayyiban."
"276","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim ibn Bahdalah se, Zirr ibn Hubaysh se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha se Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki wirasat ke bare mein pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki wirasat ke bare mein puch rahe ho. Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne na zard sona chhora na safed chandi, na bakri na oont, na ghulam na laundi, na sona na chandi."
"277","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, unhon ne kaha: Aisha se zikr kiya gaya ke ek aurat jootiyan pehenti hai, to unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mardana waza ikhtiyar karne wali aurton par lanat farmayi."
"278","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan aur Abdullah ibn Raja ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ke nazdik logon mein sab se zyada napasandida sakht jhagralu dushman hai."
"279","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ibn Abi Hind ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Sha'bi se, Masruq se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul: Jis Din zameen badal kar zameen ke siwa kuch aur kar di jayegi, Us Din log kahan honge. Aap ne farmaya: Pul as-Sirat par, ae Siddiq ki beti."
"280","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Mighwal ne hamein khabar di, Abd al-Rahman ibn Said ibn Wahb se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se Us ke is farman ke bare mein pucha Azza wa Jalla: Aur woh jo dete hain jo dete hain jabke un ke dil dare hue hote hain, kya ye woh hain jo zina karte hain aur chori karte hain aur sharab pite hain. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, ae Siddiq ki beti, balke ye woh hain jo namaz padhte hain aur roza rakhte hain aur sadqa dete hain."
"281","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Wa'il se, Masruq se, Aisha se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Jab aurat apne shohar ke ghar se baghair nuqsan pahunchaye kharch karti hai, to us ke liye ajar hai us par jo us ne kamaya, aur us ke liye ajar hai us par jo us ne kharch kiya, aur khazanchi ke liye bhi usi ki manind hai."
"282","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujalid ibn Sa'id se, Al-Sha'bi se, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Aisha se, ke unhon ne kaha: Maine aap ko dekha, Ya Rasul Allah, is hal me ke aap apna hath ghore ke kohaan par rakhay hue khare Dihyah al-Kalbi se guftagu kar rahe thay, to unhon ne farmaya: “Kya tum ne use waqai dekha tha?” Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, to unhon ne farmaya: “Wo Jibril thay, aur wo tumhe salam kehte hain,” to unhon ne kaha: Un par salam aur Allah ki rehmat ho; Allah unhe zaair aur mehman ke tor par behtareen jaza de; kya hi behtareen rafeeq aur kya hi behtareen mehman."
"283","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Sahlah bint Suhayl Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me hazir huin aur kaha: Main Salim ke mere pas aane ki wajah se Abu Hudhayfah ke chehre me nagawari dekhti hun, to unhon ne farmaya: “Use doodh pila do,” to unhon ne kaha: Main use kaise doodh pilaun jabke wo bara mard hai? To Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam muskuraye aur farmaya: “Main pehle se janta hun ke wo bara mard hai,” unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne use doodh pilaya, phir wo Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me hazir huin aur kaha: Jab se maine use doodh pilaya hai maine Abu Hudhayfah ke chehre me koi nagawar cheez nahi dekhi; Abd al-Rahman ne kaha: Aur wo Badr me hazir hue thay."
"284","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amrah bint Abd al-Rahman ne mujhe khabar di, ke unhon ne Aisha ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Hath kaatna chauthai deenar aur us se upar me hai."
"285","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur hum se char afrad ne Amrah se, Aisha se, Nabi tak marfu' kiye baghair ye riwayat bayan ki: Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr, Ruzayq ibn Hakim al-Ayli, Yahya ibn Sa'id, aur Abd Rabbih ibn Sa'id; aur Al-Zuhri un sab se zyada zabt wale thay, magar Yahya ki hadith me marfu' hone ki taraf dalalat maujud hai, jo mujhe bhuli nahi halanke mujh par lambi muddat guzar chuki hai: “Hath kaatna chauthai deenar aur us se upar me hai."
"286","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne mujhe khabar di, Aisha se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Har nasha awar mashroob haram hai,” to Sufyan se kaha gaya: Malik aur doosre al-bit' ka zikr karte hain, to unhon ne kaha: Ibn Shihab ne hum se al-bit' bayan nahi kiya; Ibn Shihab ne hum se sirf wahi bayan kiya jaisa maine tumhe bataya."
"287","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwah ibn al-Zubayr se, Aisha se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Abu Musa ki qirat suni aur farmaya: “Ye shakhs Aale Dawud ke khush ilhanon me se hissa diya gaya hai,” aur Sufyan is me kabhi shak karte, kehte: Amrah se ya Urwah se, is me khabar ka zikr kiye baghair; phir wo Urwah par jam gaye, is me khabar ka zikr ek se zyada martaba karte hue aur shak ko tark karke."
"288","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqamah se, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Aisha se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke pas sona aaya, to wo raat me bechain uthay, jabke wo saat se zyada aur nau se kam tha; unhon ne subah nahi ki yahan tak ke use taqseem kar diya, phir farmaya: “Muhammad apne Rab ke bare me kya gumaan rakhe, agar wo is hal me faut hota ke ye us ke pas hota?” Sufyan ne kaha: Mera khayal hai ke un ke pas sadqa aaya tha, ya kisi shakhs ka haq tha jiske zaya hone ka unhe andesha tha."
"289","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Wa'il ibn Dawud se, un ke bete Bakr ibn Wa'il se, Al-Zuhri se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Aisha se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un se farmaya: “Ai Aisha, agar tum se koi gunah sarzad hua hai to Allah se maghfirat mango; kyunke jab banda gunah karta hai phir tauba karta hai aur Allah Azza wa Jall se maghfirat mangta hai, to Allah use muaf farma deta hai;” Abu Bakr ne kaha: Aur Sufyan kabhi yun kehte: “Agar tum se koi gunah sarzad hua hai to Allah se maghfirat mango; kyunke tauba nadamat aur maghfirat talab karna hai...” Aur aksar auqat wo ise pehle alfaz par bayan karte thay."
"290","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Amrah se, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Main Jannat me dakhil hua aur wahan qirat suni, to maine kaha: Ye kaun hai? To unhon ne kaha: Harithah ibn al-Nu'man; neki aisi hi hoti hai, neki aisi hi hoti hai,” to Sufyan se kaha gaya: Kya ye Amrah se hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, is me koi shak nahi; Al-Zuhri ne isi tarah kaha."
"291","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Umayyah ibn Safwan ibn Abdullah ibn Safwan Al-Jumahi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: main ne apne dada Abdullah ibn Safwan ko Ibn Al-Zubayr ke daur-e-hukumat mein Al-Hijr mein kehte hue suna: main ne Hafsah ko kehte hue suna: main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: “Ek lashkar yaqeenan is Ghar ka qasd karega, us par chadhai karte hue, hatta ke jab woh zameen ke ek chatyal maidan mein honge to un ka darmiyani hissa dhansa diya jayega; un ka agla pichle ko pukarega, aur un mein se koi nahi bachega siwaye akele bach nikalne wale ke jo un ki khabar dega.” To ek shakhs ne mere dada se kaha: main gawahi deta hun ke tum ne Hafsah se jhoot nahi bola, aur Hafsah ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se jhoot nahi bola. Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur Umayr ibn Qays ise Umayyah se riwayat karte the, aur mujhe jurrat na hoti ke main un se is ke bare mein puchhun; woh Khalid ibn Muhammad aur Abdullah ibn Shaybah ke sath baithte the, jo us din Quraysh ke sab se bare logon mein se the, aur woh Suq Al-Layl mein baithte the, jabke woh us waqt masjid ke darwaze par the. Umayyah ne mujh se Khalid ibn Muhammad ko un ke liye talash karne mein madad mangi, aur main nahi janta ke main ne unhe un ke liye paya ya nahi; jab unhon ne mujh se madad mangi to mujhe un par jurrat hui aur main ne un se pucha, to unhon ne mujhe ye bayan kiya."
"292","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Muslim ibn Subayh se, Shutayr ibn Shakl se, Hafsah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam roze ki halat mein apni kisi zauja ke chehre se kuch lete (yani bosa lete) the."
"293","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Nafi’ ke ashab mein se beshumar (raviyon) ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi’ se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Hafsah ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam jab fajr un par wazeh ho jati to do rakat namaz padhte the."
"294","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Nabhan jo Umm Salamah ke azaad karda ghulam hain, ne mujhe khabar di, Umm Salamah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Jab tum mein se kisi ke pas ek mukatab ho aur us ke pas ada karne ke liye kuch ho to use chahiye ke us se parda kare.” Sufyan ne farmaya: Al-Zuhri se mera hifz yahin par khatm hua; is ke baad Ma’mar ne mujhe khabar di Al-Zuhri se, Nabhan se, unhon ne farmaya: main Umm Salamah ke khacchar ki lagam pakadta tha, aur unhon ne mujh se farmaya: Ai Nabhan, tumhare muahide mein se tum par kitna baqi hai? To main ne kaha: Ek hazar dirham. Unhon ne farmaya: To unhon ne farmaya: Kya tumhare pas ada karne ke liye kuch hai? Main ne kaha: Ji han. Unhon ne farmaya: To ise falan ko ada kar do — un ke kisi bhai ya bhatije ko — aur unhon ne parda dal liya, farmate hue: Tum par salam ho ai Nabhan; ye tumhara mujhe akhri dekhna hai. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Jab tum mein se kisi ke pas ek mukatab ho aur us ke pas ada karne ke liye kuch ho to use chahiye ke us se parda kare.” To main ne kaha: Mere pas ada karne ke liye kuch nahi hai, aur na hi main ada karne wala hun."
"295","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ammar Al-Duhni ne hum se bayan kiya — hum ne ise un ke siwa kisi ke pas nahi paya — ke unhon ne Abu Salamah ibn Abd Al-Rahman ko bayan karte hue suna, Umm Salamah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Mere ghar aur mere mimbar ke darmiyan jo hai woh Jannat ke baghon mein se ek bagh hai, aur mere mimbar ke paye Jannat mein garhe hue hain."
"296","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ubayd ibn Umayr se, Umm Salamah se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Jab Abu Salamah ka inteqal hua to main ne kaha: Ajnabi sarzameen mein ajnabi; main un par zaroor aisa rouungi ke us ka charcha hoga. Unhon ne farmaya: To main rone ki tayyari karne lagi, aur Uparle Misr se ek aurat aayi jo rone mein meri madad karna chahti thi, to jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne use dekha to us se milte hue farmaya: “Kya tum ek aise ghar mein shaitan ko dakhil karna chahti ho jis se Allah ne use nikal diya hai? Kya tum ek aise ghar mein shaitan ko dakhil karna chahti ho jis se Allah ne use nikal diya hai?” Umm Salamah ne farmaya: To main ne rona tark kar diya aur na roi."
"297","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar aur Yahya ibn Sa’id ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Zuhri se, Umm Salamah se. Aur Ma’mar ne hamen Al-Zuhri se bayan kiya, Hind bint Al-Harith se, Umm Salamah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek raat farmaya: “Subhan Allah! Kaise fitne nazil hue hain, aur kaise khazane khole gaye hain! Hujron waliyon ko jagao; kyunke duniya mein kitni hi kapde pehni hui (aurten) Qayamat ke din nangi hongi."
"298","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abd Al-Rahman ibn Humayd ibn Abd Al-Rahman ibn Awf ne hum se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Sa’id ibn Al-Musayyib ko bayan karte hue suna, Umm Salamah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Jab (Zul-Hijjah ki) das (ratein) dakhil hon aur tum mein se koi qurbani ka irada rakhe to use chahiye ke apne kisi baal ya khal ko na chhue.” Abu Bakr ne farmaya: Sufyan se kaha gaya: Un mein se baaz ise marfu bayan nahi karte. Unhon ne farmaya: Lekin main ise marfu bayan karta hun."
"299","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ayyub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa’id ibn Abi Sa’id Al-Maqburi se, Abdullah ibn Rafi’ jo Umm Salamah ke azaad karda ghulam hain se, ke Umm Salamah ne farmaya: Main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sawal kiya, kehte hue: Main ek aisi aurat hun jo apne sar ke balon ko mazbooti se gundhti hun; kya main ise janabat ke ghusl ke liye kholun? To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Nahi; tumhe kafi hai ke apne sar par pani ke teen lap baha lo, phir apne upar pani baha lo aur tum pak ho jaogi.” Ya unhon ne farmaya: “Phir tum pak ho chuki hogi."
"300","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abdullah ibn Abi Labid ne hum se bayan kiya — aur woh ahl-e-Madinah ke ibadat guzaron mein se the, magar woh qadar ke nazariye ke hamil the — ke unhon ne Abu Salamah ibn Abd Al-Rahman ko kehte hue suna: Muawiyah ibn Abi Sufyan Madinah aaye, aur jab woh mimbar par the to unhon ne Kathir ibn Al-Salt se kaha: Aisha Ummul Momineen ke pas jao aur un se Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki namaz ke bare mein pucho — Asr ke baad wali do rakaton ke bare mein. Abu Salamah ne farmaya: To main un ke sath gaya, aur Abdullah ibn Abbas ne Abdullah ibn Al-Harith ko hamare sath bheja, kehte hue: Jao aur suno ke Ummul Momineen kya farmati hain. Abu Salamah ne farmaya: To woh un ke pas aaye aur un se pucha, to unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe koi ilm nahi, lekin Umm Salamah ke pas jao aur un se pucho. To main un ke sath Umm Salamah ke pas gaya aur unhon ne un se pucha, to Umm Salamah ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ek din Asr ke baad mere pas dakhil hue aur mere sath do rakat namaz padhi, halanke main ne unhe inhe padhte hue kabhi nahi dekha tha. To main ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, aap ne ek aisi namaz padhi hai ke main ne aap ko ise padhte hue kabhi nahi dekha tha. Unhon ne farmaya: “Main Zuhr ke baad do rakat padha karta tha, aur Banu Tamim ka ek wafd — ya sadaqa — mere pas aaya aur mujhe un se mashghul kar diya, to ye wohi do rakat hain."
"301","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Zaynab bint Abi Salamah se, unki walida Umm Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Main sirf ek bashar hoon; tum mere samne jhagra late ho, aur ho sakta hai tum me se baaz apna muqaddama bayan karne me baaz se zyada faseeh ho, pas jiske haq me main uske bhai ke haq me se kisi cheez ka faisla kar doon to wo use na le, kyunke main uske liye uske zariye sirf aag ka ek tukda kaat raha hoon."
"302","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Zaynab bint Abi Salamah se, unki walida Umm Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mere paas tashreef laye jabke mere paas ek mukhannath tha, maine use Abdullah ibn Abi Umayyah se kehte hue suna: Ae Abdullah, agar Allah kal tumhen al-Taif par fatah de to Ghaylan ki beti ko apne liye le lena, kyunke wo chaar ke sath aage aati hai aur aath ke sath peeche murti hai, unhon ne kaha: To Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Ye log tumhare paas dakhil na hon,” Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Uska naam Hit tha."
"303","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Zaynab bint Abi Salamah se, unki walida Umm Salamah se ke Umm Sulaym ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sawal kiya, kehte hue: Ae Allah ke Rasool, Allah haq se haya nahi karta, kya aurat par ghusl wajib hai jab use ehtelam ho, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Jab tum me se koi pani dekhe to ghusl kare,” to Umm Salamah ne kaha: Aur kya aurat ko bhi ehtelam hota hai, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Tera dayan haath khaak aalood ho, phir mushabihat kahan se aati hai."
"304","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn Said al-Thawri ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Abi Aisha se, Umm Salamah ke ek aazad karda ghulam se, Umm Salamah se ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Fajr ke baad farmate the: “Ae Allah, main Tujh se nafa bakhsh ilm, pakeezah rizq aur maqbool amal ka sawal karta hoon."
"305","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salamah ne, jo Umm Salamah ki aulad me se ek shakhs hai, mujhe khabar di ke al-Zubayr ibn al-Awwam ne ek shakhs se Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke samne jhagra kiya, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne al-Zubayr ke haq me faisla diya, to wo shakhs bola: Usne sirf is liye uske haq me faisla diya ke wo uski phuphi ka beta hai, to Allah Azzawajal ne nazil farmaya: {Pas nahi, aapke Rabb ki qasam, wo iman nahi layenge yahan tak ke wo aapko us me hakam banayen jo unke darmiyan paida ho, phir apne dilon me us se koi tangi na payen jo aapne faisla kiya aur mukammal tasleem ke sath tasleem kar len.}"
"306","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salamah ne, jo Umm Salamah ki aulad me se ek shakhs hai, mujhe khabar di, Umm Salamah se ke unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, main Allah Azzawajal ko hijrat ke bare me auraton ka koi zikr karte hue nahi sunti, to Allah Azzawajal ne nazil farmaya: {Pas unke Rabb ne unki dua qabool ki: Main tum me se kisi amal karne wale ke amal ko zaya nahi karoonga, mard ho ya aurat} — ayat."
"307","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Yasar se, Umm Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Fatimah bint Abi Hubaysh ko istehaza ka khoon aata tha, to unhon ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sawal kiya, aur Aap ne farmaya: “Ye haiz nahi hai, balke ye ek rag hai,” aur Aap ne unhen hukm diya ke apne haiz ke dino ki muddat, ya apne mahwari ki muddat namaz chor de, phir ghusl kare, aur agar khoon ghalib aa jaye to kapra rakh kar langot bandhe aur namaz parhe."
"308","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fudayl ibn Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, al-Shabi se, Umm Salamah se ke jab Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apne ghar se nikalte to farmate: “Ae Allah, main Teri panah me aata hoon is se ke phisloon ya gumrah hoon, zulm karoon ya mujh par zulm kiya jaye, jahalat karoon ya mujh par jahalat ki jaye."
"309","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Humayd ibn Nafi se, Zaynab bint Abi Salamah se, unki walida Umm Salamah se ke ek aurat Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aayi aur boli: Ae Allah ke Rasool, meri beti ka shohar faut ho gaya hai aur wo apni aankh ki shikayat karti hai, kya wo surma laga sakti hai, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Tum me se har ek saal ke sar par gobar phenkti thi, ab to sirf chaar mah aur das din hain,” Yahya ne kaha: To maine Humayd ibn Nafi se kaha: Unka ye qaul kya hai: “Tum me se har ek saal ke sar par gobar phenkti thi,” to unhon ne kaha: Zamana-e-jahiliyyat me aurat apne sab se boseedah kapre, apne sab se haqeer libas pehenti, phir apne sab se haqeer ghar me dakhil hoti, phir jab saal ka sar aata to gobar ki ek meengni lekar doosre ki peeth par phenkti — aur shayad Abu Bakr ne kaha: peeche ki taraf — kehte hue: Main halal ho gayi."
"310","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salim ibn Shawwal ne mujhe khabar di, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki zauja Umm Habibah se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke zamane me aisa karte the: hum Muzdalifah se Mina ko andhere me sawere sawere rawana hote the, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Salim ibn Shawwal Makkah ke logon me se ek shakhs hai, humne is hadith ko Amr ibn Dinar ke siwa kisi ko us se riwayat karte hue nahi suna."
"311","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ibn Nafi ne mujhe khabar di, Zaynab bint Abi Salamah se, jinhon ne kaha: Jab Sham se Abu Sufyan ki wafat ki khabar aayi to Umm Habibah ne teesre din zard khushbu mangwai, us se apne rukhsaron aur kalaiyon par mala aur kaha: Mujhe is ki koi hajat na thi, agar maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue na suna hota: “Kisi us aurat ke liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti hai halal nahin ke woh kisi mayyat par teen (din) se zyada sog manaye, siwaye shohar ke, pas woh us par chaar mahine aur das din sog manati hai.” Pas Sufyan se kaha gaya: Malik is mein kehte hain: Humayd ibn Nafi se, Zaynab bint Jahsh se, aur Safiyyah aur Umm Habibah se. Pas Sufyan ne kaha: Ayyub ibn Musa ne hum se sirf Umm Habibah bayan ki."
"312","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Zaynab bint Abi Salamah se, Umm Habibah Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki zauja se, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya aap ko Durrah bint Abi Sufyan mein koi raghbat hai? Aap ne farmaya: “Main kya karunga?” Unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Aap us se nikah kar len. Aap ne farmaya: “Aur kya tum is ko pasand karti ho?” Maine kaha: Main aap ke sath tanhai mein akeli nahin hun (yani aap mere sath khas nahin hain), aur aap ke bare mein mere sath shareek hone mein mujhe sab se zyada mehboob meri behan hai. Aap ne farmaya: “Woh mere liye halal nahin hai.” Maine kaha: Mujhe yeh baat pahunchi hai ke aap Zaynab bint Abi Salamah se mangni kar rahe hain. Pas Aap ne farmaya: “Umm Salamah ki beti?” Maine kaha: Ji haan. Aap ne farmaya: “Allah ki qasam, agar woh meri parwarish mein meri soteli beti na bhi hoti to bhi woh mere liye halal na hoti; Thuwaybah ne mujhe aur us ke walid ko doodh pilaya tha, pas meri khidmat mein apni betiyan ya apni behnen pesh na karo."
"313","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya — is mein humein un ke siwa kisi ki hajat nahin — unhon ne kaha: Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di, Zaynab bint Abi Salamah se, Habibah bint Umm Habibah se, apni walida Umm Habibah se, Zaynab bint Jahsh se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam neend se bedar hue aur Aap ka chehra surkh tha, farmate hue: “La ilaha illallah, La ilaha illallah! Arabon ke liye halakat ho us shar se jo qareeb aa gaya hai; aaj Ya’juj aur Ma’juj ki rok mein is qadr khol diya gaya hai.” Aur Sufyan ne das (ungliyon) se halqa banaya. Maine kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya hum halak ho jayenge jabke hum mein nek log maujud hain? Aap ne farmaya: “Haan, jab burai zyada ho jayegi.” Sufyan ne kaha: Is hadith mein mujhe al-Zuhri se chaar khawateen yaad hain, jin sab ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha tha: Aap ki do azwaj, Umm Habibah aur Zaynab bint Jahsh, aur Aap ki do soteli betiyan, Zaynab bint Umm Salamah aur Habibah bint Umm Habibah, jin ke walid Ubaydullah ibn Jahsh sarzameen-e-Habsha mein faut hue."
"314","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Sha’tha Jabir ibn Zayd ne mujhe khabar di, ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Maymunah ne mujhe khabar di ke woh Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath ek hi bartan se ghusl karti thin. Phir Sufyan ne kaha: Yeh sanad Shu’bah ko bahut pasand thi: “Maine suna; unhon ne mujhe khabar di; maine suna; unhon ne mujhe khabar di” — goya woh is ke ittisal ke khwahishmand the."
"315","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Manbudh al-Makki ne hum se bayan kiya, apni walida se, jinhon ne kaha: Hum Maymunah ke pas thin jab Ibn Abbas un ke pas dakhil hue, to unhon ne kaha: Aye mere bete, main tujhe tere sar mein bikhera hua (paragandah baal) kyun dekh rahi hun? Unhon ne kaha: Meri mashata (baal banane wali) Umm Ammar haiza hain. Pas unhon ne kaha: Aye mere bete, haiz ka hathon se kya talluq hai? Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hum mein se kisi ek ki god mein apna sar rakhte jabke woh haiza hoti, phir Quran ki tilawat farmate; aur hum mein se ek Aap ki khidmat mein Aap ki khumrah (choti namaz ki chatai) lekar khadi hoti, use Aap ke liye bicha deti jabke woh haiza hoti, aur Aap us par namaz parhte. Aye mere bete, haiz ka hath se kya talluq hai?"
"316","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq al-Shaybani ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Shaddad — ya Yazid ibn al-Asamm se, aur shak karne wale Sufyan hain — Maymunah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam khumrah (choti namaz ki chatai) par namaz parhte the."
"317","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di, ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko bayan karte hue suna, Maymunah se, ke ek chuha ghee mein gir kar mar gaya, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se is ke bare mein pucha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: “Use aur us ke ird gird jo hai usay phenk do, aur use kha lo.” Abu Bakr ne kaha: Pas Sufyan se kaha gaya: Ma’mar use al-Zuhri se, Sa’id se, Abu Hurayrah se riwayat karte hain. Sufyan ne kaha: Maine al-Zuhri ko sirf Ubaydullah se, Ibn Abbas se, Maymunah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se bayan karte hue suna hai; aur maine use un se kai martaba suna hai."
"318","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq al-Shaybani ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Shaddad ibn al-Had se, Maymunah se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek ooni libas (mirt) mein namaz parhi, jis ka ek hissa Aap par tha aur ek hissa mujh par tha, jabke main haiza thin."
"319","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sulayman Abdullah ibn Abdullah, Yazid ibn al-Asamm ke bhatije — jo dono mein bade hain — ne hum se bayan kiya, apne chacha Yazid ibn al-Asamm se, Maymunah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam sajda farmate to agar ek barra (memna) Aap ke neeche se guzarna chahta to guzar sakta tha, is qadr Aap apne bazoun ko kushada farmate the."
"320","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, Maymunah se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ka guzar Maymunah ki ek azad karda laundi ki ek murda bakri ke pas se hua, jo use sadqe se di gayi thi, to Aap ne farmaya: “Is (bakri) walon par kya tha, agar woh is ki khaal le lete, use dabaghat de lete, aur is se faida uthate?” Pas unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yeh to murdar hai. Pas Aap ne farmaya: “Sirf us ka khana haram hai.” Pas Sufyan se kaha gaya: Ma’mar is mein nahin kehte: “Pas woh use dabaghat den,” aur kehte hain: al-Zuhri dabaghat ka inkar karte the. Pas Sufyan ne kaha: Lekin maine use yaad rakha hai; hum is se sirf yeh jumla chahte the jo un ke siwa kisi ne bayan nahin kiya: “Sirf us ka khana haram hai.” Aur Sufyan kabhi is mein Maymunah ka zikr nahin karte the; jab unhe is par roka jata to woh is mein kehte: Maymunah."
"321","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: A'mash ne hamein bayan kiya, Salim bin Abi al-Ja'd se, Kuraib se, Ibn Abbas se, Maimunah se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne janabat se ghusl farmaya: Aap ne apni sharmgah ko apne haath se dhoya, phir use deewar par ragda, phir use dhoya, phir namaz ke wuzu ki tarah wuzu farmaya, phir jab Aap apne ghusl se farigh hue to Apne dono qadam dhoye."
"322","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Zuhri ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ubaid bin al-Sabbaq ne mujhe khabar di, ke unhon ne Juwairiyah bint al-Harith ko farmate hue suna: Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ek din mere paas tashreef laye aur farmaya: Kya koi khana hai, to main ne arz kiya: Nahin, siwaye ek haddi ke jo hamari ek azaad kardah laundi ko sadqe mein se di gayi thi, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Use qareeb lao, kyunke woh apne halal maqam ko pahunch chuka hai, Abu Bakr ne farmaya: Yani ab woh sadqa nahin raha."
"323","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham bin Urwah ne hamein bayan kiya, ke unhon ne apne walid ko farmate hue suna: Asma bint Abi Bakr al-Siddiq ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Meri walida Quraish ke sulah ke zamane mein mere paas raghbat rakhte hue aayeen, to main ne Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se poochha: Kya main un se silah rahmi karun, Aap ne farmaya: Haan, Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur isi bare mein nazil hua: Allah tumhein un logon ke bare mein nahin rokta jinhon ne tum se jang nahin ki, poori aayat."
"324","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham bin Urwah ne hamein bayan kiya, ke unhon ne apni ahliya Fatimah bint al-Mundhir ko apni dadi Asma se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs us cheez se ser hone ka dikhawa kare jo use di hi nahin gayi woh jhoot ke do kapde pehenne wale ki tarah hai."
"325","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham bin Urwah ne hamein bayan kiya, ke unhon ne apni ahliya Fatimah bint al-Mundhir ko bayan karte hue suna, ke unhon ne Asma bint Abi Bakr ko farmate hue suna: Ek aurat ne Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se kapde ko lagne wale haiz ke khoon ke bare mein poochha, to Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Use khurach do, phir use pani se malo, phir us par pani chhidko, aur usi mein namaz padho."
"326","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham bin Urwah ne hamein bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Fatimah bint al-Mundhir ko farmate hue suna: Main ne Asma ko farmate hue suna: Ek aurat ne Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se arz kiya, kehte hue: Ae Allah ke Rasool, meri beti ko khasra nikla to us ke baal gucche gucche gir gaye, aur main ne us ki shadi kar di hai, to kya main us mein izafa jod dun, to Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ne baal jodne wali aur jis ke liye jode jayen us par la'nat farmayi hai."
"327","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham bin Urwah ne hamein bayan kiya, Fatimah bint al-Mundhir se, apni dadi Asma se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke zamane mein ek ghoda zibah kiya aur use khaya."
"328","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Walid bin Kathir ne hamein bayan kiya, Tadrus se, Asma bint Abi Bakr se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab Tabbat Yada Abi Lahab nazil hui to al-Aura Umm Jamil bint Harb cheekhti hui nikli, us ke haath mein pathar tha, kehti thi: Muzammam ko hum ne chhod diya, us ke deen se hum ne dushmani rakhi, aur us ke hukm ki hum ne nafarmani ki, aur Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam masjid mein baithe Quran ki tilawat farma rahe the aur Abu Bakr Aap ke pehlu mein the, pas jab Abu Bakr ne use dekha to arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, woh aa gayi hai aur mujhe darr hai ke woh Aap ko dekh legi, to Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Woh Mujhe nahin dekhegi, aur Aap ne Quran ki tilawat farmayi jis ke zariye Aap ne panah talab ki, jaisa ke unhon ne farmaya, aur tilawat farmayi: Aur jab Aap Quran padhte hain to Hum Aap ke aur un logon ke darmiyan jo aakhirat par iman nahin rakhte ek poshida parda daal dete hain, pas woh nikli yahan tak ke Abu Bakr par aa khadi hui aur Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko na dekha, aur boli: Ae Abu Bakr, mujhe khabar di gayi hai ke tumhare saathi ne meri hajv ki hai, to unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, is Ghar ke Rabb ki qasam, unhon ne tumhari hajv nahin ki, unhon ne farmaya: Pas woh yeh kehte hue wapas palti ke Quraish jante hain ke main un ke sardar ki beti hun, Walid ne apni hadith mein farmaya, ya kisi aur ne farmaya: Pas Umm Jamil Baitullah ka tawaf karte hue apni ooni chadar mein thokar kha kar giri, kehti thi: Muzammam halaak ho, to Umm Hakim bint Abd al-Muttalib ne farmaya: Main paak daman hun pas mujhe bura nahin kaha jata, aur sahih aqal wali hun pas mujhe sikhaya nahin jata, hum dono chachazad nasab wale hain, is ke baad Quraish zyada jaante hain."
"329","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Walid bin Kathir ne hamein bayan kiya, Tadrus se, Asma bint Abi Bakr se, ke un se kaha gaya: Tum ne mushrikon ka Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath sab se bura sulook kya dekha, to unhon ne farmaya: Mushrik masjid mein baithe Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke bare mein aur jo Aap un ke maboodon ke bare mein farmate the us ke bare mein guftagu kar rahe the, isi haal mein the ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam dakhil hue, to woh sab Aap par toot pade, pas jab woh kisi cheez ke bare mein poochhte to Aap unhein sach sach bata dete, pas woh bole: Kya tum aisa aisa nahin kehte, to Aap ne farmaya: Haan, pas unhon ne sab ne mil kar Aap ko pakad liya, Abu Bakr tak madad ki pukar pahunchi, un se kaha gaya: Apne saathi ko pahunchiye, pas woh hamare paas se nikle aur un ke baalon ki do chotiyan thin, woh masjid mein dakhil hue kehte hue: Tum par afsos, kya tum ek shakhs ko is liye qatl karoge ke woh kehta hai: Mera Rabb Allah hai, jabke woh tumhare paas tumhare Rabb ki taraf se wazeh daleelen lekar aaya hai, unhon ne farmaya: Pas unhon ne Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko chhod diya aur Abu Bakr par toot pade, pas Abu Bakr hamare paas wapas aaye aur woh apni chotiyon mein se kisi cheez ko chhute nahin the magar woh un ke saath ukhad kar aa jati, is haal mein ke woh farma rahe the: Tu paak hai Ae Jalal aur Ikram wale."
"330","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani se, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Asma bint Abi Bakr se, ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un se farmaya: Ae Asma, rok kar jama na karo warna tum se bhi rok liya jayega."
"331","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Muhayyah ne hum se apne walid se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab al-Hajjaj ibn Yusuf ne Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr ko qatl kiya to al-Hajjaj Asma bint Abi Bakr ki khidmat me hazir hua aur un se kaha: Ae ammi, Ameer ul-Momineen ne mujhe aap ke bare me wasiyat ki hai; kya aap ko koi hajat hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe koi hajat nahi, aur na hi me aap ki maa hun; balke me to ghati par saleeb diye gaye shakhs ki maa hun. Lekin thehro, me tumhe woh bayan karti hun jo mene Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se farmate hue suna: “Thaqif se ek jhoota aur ek tabahkun niklega.” Raha jhoota to hum ne use dekh liya — yani al-Mukhtar — aur raha tabahkun to woh tum ho. To al-Hajjaj ne kaha: Munafiqon ko tabah karne wala."
"332","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ke bhai ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us shakhs ne khabar di jis ne Asma bint Abi Bakr ko farmate hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: “Ae momin aurton ki jamaat, tum me se koi aurat imam se pehle apna sar na uthaye” — mardon ke kapron ki tangi ki wajah se."
"333","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe al-Zuhri se khabar di gayi, unhon ne Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf se, unhon ne apni walida Umm Kulthum bint Uqbah ibn Abi Muayt se, unhon ne kaha: Mene Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: “Behtareen sadqa dushmani rakhne wale rishtedar par hai.” Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur mene ise al-Zuhri se nahi suna. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Al-kashih ka mana hai: dushman."
"334","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safwan ibn Sulaym ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Yasar se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me hazir hua aur arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, kya mujh par koi gunah hai agar me apni biwi se jhoot bolun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, kyunke Allah jhoot ko pasand nahi farmata. Us ne arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, me us se sulah chahta hun aur use khush karna chahta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Aap par koi gunah nahi."
"335","Asma bint Umays ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Urwa ibn Amir se, Ubayd ibn Rifaa se, Asma bint Umays se, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Jafar ke beton ko nazar lag jati hai; kya me un ke liye ruqya karwaun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, kyunke agar koi cheez taqdeer se aage barhne wali hoti to nazar us se aage barh jati."
"336","Umm Hani bint Abi Talib ki riwayaat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Said se, Abu Murra maula Aqil se, Umm Hani se, unhon ne kaha: Fatah ke din mere do behnoi mere paas aaye aur mene unhe panah de di, phir Ali unhe qatl karne ke liye aaye, to me Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me hazir hui jabke Aap al-Abtah me upari Makkah me apne kheme me the lekin me ne Aap ko na paya, aur me ne Fatima ko paya, jo mujh par Ali se zyada sakht thin, aur unhon ne kaha: Kya tum kafiron ko panah deti ho aur aman deti ho, aur aisa aur waisa karti ho? Jald hi Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam tashreef laye aur Aap ke chehre par mitti ke asaar the, aur Aap ne farmaya: Ae Fatima, mere liye wuzu ka pani daalo. Unhon ne ek bartan me Aap ke liye wuzu ka pani dala, aur goya me ab bhi us me aate ke asaar dekh rahi thi, phir unhon ne Aap ko ek kapre se parda kiya, aur Aap ne wuzu farmaya, phir Aap ne ek hi kapre me aath rakatein padhin jis ke dono kinare mukhalif simt me lapete hue the, jo mene Aap ko is se pehle ya baad me kabhi padhte hue nahi dekha tha. Jab Aap farigh hue to mene arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, mene apne do behnoiyon ko panah di hai, lekin mere bhai Ali unhe qatl karna chahte hain. Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Use is ka koi haq nahi; hum ne use panah de di jise tum ne panah di, aur hum ne use aman de diya jise tum ne aman diya."
"337","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn al-Harith ko Umm Hani se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Mene Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Fatah ke din ek hi kapre me aath rakatein padhte hue dekha jis ke dono kinare mukhalif simt me lapete hue the."
"338","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Karim Abu Umayya ne kaha: Abdullah ibn al-Harith ne kaha, aur unhon ne hum se is me yeh nahi kaha ke unhon ne ise barah-e-raast suna, unhon ne kaha: Mene Uthman ke daur me Duha ki namaz ke bare me pucha jab Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke Sahaba kaseer tadad me the, aur mene kisi ko na paya jis ne mere liye Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki namaz ko sabit kiya ho siwaye Umm Hani ke, unhon ne kaha: Mene Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko ise ek martaba padhte hue dekha, Fatah ke din, aath rakatein ek hi kapre me jis ke dono kinare mukhalif simt me lapete hue the."
"339","Abdullah ibn al-Harith ne kaha: Mene is ka zikr Ibn Abbas se kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Me is ayat par se guzarta tha, Woh shaam ko aur suraj nikalte waqt Us ki tasbeeh karte hain, aur me kehta tha: Suraj nikalne wali namaz kaunsi hai? To yehi suraj nikalne wali namaz hai."
"340","Uthman ibn Mazun ki ahliya Khawla bint Hakim ki riwayaat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Maysara ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Suwayd se, Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz se, unhon ne kaha: Nek khatoon Khawla bint Hakim, jo Uthman ibn Mazun ki ahliya hain, ne dawa kiya ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam bahar tashreef laye jabke Aap apni sahabzadi ke do beton me se ek ko apne se lagaye hue the, farmate hue: Allah ki qasam, yeh tumhe jahil aur buzdil aur bakheel banate hain, halanke yeh Allah ki khushbu me se hain, aur Rab ul-Alameen ka aakhri qadam Wajj me pada tha."
"341","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abdullah ibn al-Harith ibn Abd al-Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Insan ne mujh se bayan kiya, yani Ibn Insan, Arab ke ek qabeelay me se, Abdullah ibn Abd Rabbihi ibn al-Hakam ibn Uthman ibn Bishr se, Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham se, Kab se, ke unhon ne unhen kehte hue suna: Wajj muqaddas hai; usi se Rab ne aasman ki taraf urooj farmaya us din jab Us ne zameen ki takhleeq mukammal farmayi. Al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Wajj Taif me hai."
"342","Umm Khalid bint Khalid ibn al-As ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Musa ibn Uqba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Umm Khalid bint Khalid ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko qabar ke azab se panah mangte hue suna. Musa ne farmaya: Aur main ne un ke siwa kisi ke bare me nahi suna jis ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se ise suna ho."
"343","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ishaq ibn Said al-Saidi ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Umm Khalid bint Khalid se, jinhon ne farmaya: Main sarzameen-e-Habsha se aayi jab main ek chhoti bachchi thi, aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujhe ek naqshdar ooni kapda pehnaya jis me nishan the, aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apne hath se nishanon ko malne lage, farmate hue: Sanah, sanah. Abu Bakr ne farmaya: Yani achha, achha."
"344","Umm al-Fadl bint al-Harith ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, un ki walida Umm al-Fadl se, jinhon ne farmaya: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasall"
"345","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Salim Abu Al-Nadr ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Umair, Umm Al-Fadl ke azad karda ghulam ko Umm Al-Fadl se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: Logon ko shak hua ke kya Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Arafa ke din roze se hain, to unhon ne Aap ki khidmat mein doodh ka ek bartan bheja, aur Aap ne pi liya, Sufyan kabhi is riwayat ko is tarah alfaaz mein bayan karte: Logon ko shak hai ke kya Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Arafa ke din roze se hain, to Umm Al-Fadl ne Aap ko bheja, aur jab un par is ke bare mein israr kiya jata to woh farmate: Ye Umm Al-Fadl se hai."
"346","Umm Ayyub ki riwayat, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ubaydullah ibn Abi Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke Umm Ayyub Al-Ansariyya ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hamare han tehre, aur hum ne Aap ke liye khana tayyar kiya jis mein in sabziyon mein se kuch thi, aur Aap ne use napasand farmaya, aur Aap ne Apne Sahaba se farmaya: Khao, kyunke main tum mein se kisi ki tarah nahin hun; main apne sathi ko takleef dena napasand karta hun, Al-Humaydi ne farmaya: Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko khwab mein dekha, aur maine arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, us cheez ka kya muamla hai jo Aap se riwayat ki jati hai, ke farishte usi cheez se takleef pate hain jis se Adam ki aulad takleef pati hai, Aap ne farmaya: Sach hai."
"347","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ubaydullah ibn Abi Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine apne walid ko farmate hue suna: Main Umm Ayyub Al-Ansariyya ke han tehra, aur unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Quran saat harfon par nazil hua; tum in mein se jis par bhi padhoge, durust hoge."
"348","Khadija ki rishtedar Umayma bint Ruqaiqa ki riwayat, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad ibn Al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Umayma bint Ruqaiqa ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se aurton ke ek giroh ke sath baiat ki, aur Aap ne farmaya: Us mein jis ki tum taqat aur istetaat rakhti ho, maine arz kiya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool hum par hum se zyada meherban hain; Ae Allah ke Rasool, hamari baiat qubool farmaiye, Aap ne farmaya: Main aurton se musafaha nahin karta; sau aurton se meri baat ek aurat se meri baat ki tarah hai, Abu Bakr ne farmaya: Sufyan se kaha gaya: Lekin woh is mein kehte hain: Umayma bint Ruqaiqa, Khadija ki rishtedar, Sufyan ne farmaya: Woh Khadija ki rishtedar hain, lekin Ibn Al-Munkadir ne hum se ye nahin kaha."
"349","Al-Rubayyi bint Muawwidh ibn Afra ki riwayat, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil ibn Abi Talib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ali ibn Al-Husayn ne mujhe Al-Rubayyi bint Muawwidh ibn Afra ke pas Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke wuzu ke bare mein puchne ke liye bheja, kyunke woh un ke ghar mein wuzu kiya karte the, to main un ke pas gaya aur unhon ne mere liye ek bartan nikala jis mein Ibn Hisham ke mudd se ek mudd ya sawa mudd samata tha, aur unhon ne farmaya: Isi se main Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke wuzu ke liye pani nikalti thi; Aap bartan mein hath dalne se pehle apne hathon ko teen martaba dhone se ibtida farmate, phir kulli karte aur naak mein pani dalte teen teen martaba, aur apne chehre ko teen martaba dhote, phir apne hathon ko teen teen martaba dhote, phir apne sar ka aage se peeche tak masah farmate, aur apne pairon ko teen teen martaba dhote, unhon ne farmaya: Tumhara ek chachazad bhai mere pas aaya aur mujh se is ke bare mein pucha, aur maine use khabar di, to us ne kaha: Main Kitab Allah mein do dhone aur do masah ke siwa kuch nahin janta, yani Ibn Abbas, Abu Bakr ne farmaya: Aur Sufyan ne hamare liye masah ki kaifiyat bayan ki, apne hathon ko apni kangpatiyon par rakhte, phir un se apni peshani tak masah karte, phir unhein uthate aur apne sar ke darmiyan se apni kangpatiyon par rakhte, phir gudi tak masah karte, Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur Ibn Ajlan ne hum se pehle ise Ibn Aqil se Al-Rubayyi se bayan kiya tha, masah mein izafa karte hue: phir unhon ne apni kangpatiyon se apne rukhsaron par masah kiya yahan tak ke dadhi ke sire tak pahunche, lekin jab hum ne Ibn Aqil se is ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne hamare liye masah mein rukhsaron ka zikr nahin kiya, aur un ke hafize mein kuch tha, to maine unhein talqeen karna napasand kiya."
"350","Asad Khuzaima se Umm Qais bint Mihsan Al-Asadiyya ki riwayat, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Al-Zuhri ko farmate hue suna: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Umm Qais bint Mihsan Al-Asadiyya ko farmate hue suna: Main Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein apne ek bete ke sath hazir hui jis ne abhi khana khana shuru nahin kiya tha, aur us ne Aap par peshab kar diya, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne pani mangwaya aur us par chhidak diya."
"351","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Al-Zuhri ko kehte hue suna: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Umm Qays bint Mihsan ko kehte hue suna: main apne ek bete ke sath Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hui, aur main ne us ke halaq ke dard ka ungli se dabane se ilaj kiya tha, to Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: tum is dabao se apne bachon ko kyun takleef deti ho? Ye Hindi ud istemal karo, kyunke is mein saat shifaen hain: halaq ki bimari ke liye naak mein chadhaya jata hai aur zat-ul-janb ke liye munh ke kinare se pilaya jata hai. Al-Zuhri ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne humein do bayan kien aur paanch bayan nahin kien. Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Hindi ud se murad qust hai."
"352","Umm Kurz al-Khuzaiyya ki riwayaat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Abi Yazid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Siba ibn Thabit ko bayan karte hue suna ke unhon ne Umm Kurz al-Kabiyya ko kehte hue suna: main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: ladke ke liye do bakriyan hain aur ladki ke liye ek bakri hai, tumhein is ki parwah nahin ke woh nar hon ya mada."
"353","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ibn Abi Rabah ne mujhe khabar di ke Habiba bint Maysara al-Fihriyya, jo un ki aazad karda bandi thin, ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Umm Kurz al-Khuzaiyya ko kehte hue suna: main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: aqeeqe mein ladke ke liye do barabar ki bakriyan hain aur ladki ke liye ek bakri hai."
"354","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Ubaydullah ibn Abi Yazid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Siba ibn Thabit ko kehte hue suna: main ne Umm Kurz al-Kabiyya ko kehte hue suna: main al-Hudaybiyya mein Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas qurbani ke janwaron ke gosht mein se kuch talab karne ke liye aayi, aur main ne unhein farmate hue suna: parindon ko un ke thikanon par rehne do."
"355","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Abi Yazid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Siba ibn Thabit ko bayan karte hue suna ke unhon ne Umm Kurz ko kehte hue suna: main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: nubuwwat chali gayi aur sirf mubashshirat baqi reh gayi hain. Sufyan ise ek arse tak Ubaydullah se Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se mursal ke taur par bayan karte the, phir unhon ne ise apne walid se, Siba se, Umm Kurz se bayan kiya, ye zikr karte hue ke woh is ki sanad ko tark kar diya karte the yahan tak ke baad mein unhon ne ise sabit kar diya."
"356","Umm Haram ki riwayaat. Abu Tahir Abd al-Ghaffar ibn Jafar ibn Zayd al-Muaddib ne humein khabar di, un par qiraat ki gayi jabke main sun raha tha, san 427 mein, aur unhon ne is ka iqrar kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ali Muhammad ibn Ahmad ibn al-Hasan al-Sawwaf ne hum se bayan kiya: Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan ibn Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hilal ibn Maymun al-Juhani al-Ramli ne hum se bayan kiya, Yala ibn Shaddad Abu Thabit se, Umm Haram se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne samandari muhim ka zikr farmaya: samandar mein chakkar aane wale ke liye shaheed ka sawab hai, aur doobne wale ke liye do shaheedon ka sawab hai. Unhon ne kaha: main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke Woh mujhe un mein se bana de. Unhon ne farmaya: Ae Allah, ise un mein se bana de. Phir unhon ne samandari muhim mein hissa liya, aur jab woh bahar aayin to apni sawari par sawar huin, gir gayin, aur wafaat pa gayin."
"357","Umm Sharik ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Hamid ibn Jubayr ibn Shayba al-Hajabi ne mujh se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Said ibn al-Musayyib ko kehte hue suna: Umm Sharik ne mujhe khabar di ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhein chhipkaliyon ko qatl karne ka hukm diya."
"358","Buqayra ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Muhammad ibn Ibrahim al-Taymi ko bayan karte hue suna, Buqayra se, jo al-Qaqa ibn Abi Hadrad al-Aslami ki biwi thin, unhon ne kaha: main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko mimbar par farmate hue suna: Ae logo, jab tum suno ke qareeb mein ek lashkar ko zameen mein dhansa diya gaya hai, to Qayamat ne apna saya dal diya hai."
"359","Busra bint Safwan ki riwayaat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid aur Urwa ibn al-Zubayr ne us cheez par guftagu ki jo wuzu ko wajib karti hai, aur Urwa ne sharmgah ko chhune ka zikr kiya, to mere walid ne kaha: ye aisi cheez hai jo main ne kabhi nahin suni. Urwa ne kaha: balke Marwan ibn al-Hakam ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Busra bint Safwan ko kehte hue suna: main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: jo apni sharmgah ko chhue, use wuzu karna chahiye. Main ne Marwan se kaha: main chahta hun ke aap un ke paas bhejen, to unhon ne un ke paas ek aadmi bheja jabke main maujood tha, ya unhon ne kaha: ek muhafiz, aur qasid un ke paas se wapas aaya ye kehte hue ke unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jo apni sharmgah ko chhue, use wuzu karna chahiye."
"360","Khawla bint Qays, jo Hamza ibn Abd al-Muttalib ki biwi thin, ki riwayaat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn Kathir ibn Aflah ne mujhe khabar di, Ubayd Sanuta se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Khawla bint Qays, jo Hamza ibn Abd al-Muttalib ki biwi thin, ko kehte hue suna: main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Hamza se duniya ke bare mein guftagu karte hue suna, farmate hue: duniya meethi aur hari bhari hai, jo ise haqq ke sath leta hai use is mein barkat di jati hai, lekin bahut se woh jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ke maal mein ghus jate hain, un ke liye us din Aag hogi jis din woh Us se milega. Aur Sufyan kabhi kehte the: Qayamat ke din."
"361","Kabsha ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Yazid bin Jabir Al-Azdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Abi Amra ne mujhe khabar di, apni dadi Kabsha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ek din mere paas tashreef laye aur latki hui mashkiza ke munh se khare ho kar pani nosh farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Pas main ne mashkize ka munh kaat diya. Aur Sufyan kabhi kehte: Kabsha ya Kubaysha, aur aksar woh kehte: Kubaysha."
"362","Husayn bin Mihsan ki phuphi ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Said ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bushayr bin Yasar ne mujhe khabar di, Husayn bin Mihsan se, un ki ek phuphi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me kisi haajat ke liye hazir hui, to Aap ne farmaya: Ai aurat, kya tera shohar hai? Main ne kaha: Ji haan. Aap ne farmaya: Tu us ke muamle me kahan khari hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main kotahi nahi karti magar jis se main aajiz aa jaun. Aap ne farmaya: Dekh tu us ke sath kis darje par hai, pas wohi teri Jannat hai aur teri Aag hai."
"363","Umm Mabad ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mabad bin Ka'b ne mujhe khabar di, apni walida se, jinhon ne dono qiblon ki taraf namaz parhi thi, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko khajoor aur kishmish ki mili-juli nabeez banane se mana farmate hue suna. Aap ne farmaya: Un me se har ek ko alag alag bhigo."
"364","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Mabad bin Ka'b se, apne chacha se ya apni walida se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Seekho, ai logo, pas beshak sadgi iman me se hai."
"365","Umm Sulayman bin Amr bin Al-Ahwas ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Abi Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Sulayman bin Amr bin Al-Ahwas ko apni walida se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko wadi ke nichle hisse se jamre ko kankariyan marte hue dekha jabke Aap khacchar par sawar the, Aap farma rahe the: Ai logo, tum par sukoon lazim hai; tum me se koi dusre ko qatal na kare, aur chhoti kankariyon se jo ungliyon se phenki jati hain rami karo."
"366","Umm Husayn ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus bin Abi Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Ayzar bin Hurayth se riwayat karte hue, Umm Al-Husayn se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko khutba dete hue dekha jabke Aap chadar lapete hue the, aur Aap ke bazu ka gosht kaanp raha tha."
"367","Umm Atiyya Al-Ansariyya ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub bin Abi Tamima As-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Sirin se, Umm Atiyya se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hamare paas tashreef laye jabke hum Aap ki sahabzadi ko ghusl de rahi thin, to Aap ne farmaya: Use teen martaba ya paanch martaba ya is se zyada martaba ghusl do agar tum munasib samjho, pani aur beri ke patton se, aur aakhri ghusl me kafoor ya kuch kafoor daalo, aur jab tum farigh ho jao to mujhe ittila do. Pas jab hum farigh huin to hum ne Aap ko ittila di, to Aap ne hamein apna tehband ata farmaya, farmate hue: Use is me lapet do."
"368","Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Ayyub ne hum se is ko bayan kiya, Hafsa bint Sirin se, Umm Atiyya se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah, is me izafa karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Aur hum ne un ke sar ke teen chotiyan bana din."
"369","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Hafsa bint Sirin se, ek khatoon se, un ki behan se, jin ke shohar ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath das se zyada ghazwat me shirkat ki thi, jabke woh un ke sath chhe me shareek thin, unhon ne kaha: Hum zakhmiyon ka ilaj karti thin aur bimaroon ki dekh-bhaal karti thin. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se pucha: Kya hum me se kisi par koi gunah hai agar us ke paas bahar ki chadar na ho aur woh Eid me hazir na ho? Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Us ki behan use apni chadar pehna de, aur woh Eid aur Musalmanon ki dua me hazir ho."
"370","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Hafsa se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Umm Atiyya se pucha: Kya tum ne ye Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, mere baap ki qasam, aur jab bhi woh Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se riwayat kartin to kehtin: Mere baap ki qasam, main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Kunwari larkiyon aur parda-nasheen khawateen ko bahar nikalo; woh Eid aur Musalmanon ki dua me hazir hon, aur haiz wali aurtein Musalmanon ki namazgah se alag rahen."
"371","Fatima bint Qays al-Fihriyya ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujalid ibn Said al-Hamdani ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Shabi se, unhon ne kaha: Fatima bint Qays Kufa apne bhai al-Dahhak ibn Qays ke paas aayin jo wahan ke hakim the, aur hum un ke paas gaye aur un se poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Amr ibn Hafs ibn al-Mughira ke paas thi, pas us ne mujhe qat'i talaq de di aur Yemen chala gaya, to main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur aap se us ka zikr kiya, naan-nafqa talab karte hue, aur unhon ne apni aasteen se is tarah ishara farmaya, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam us aurat se parda farmate hue, jabke Abu Bakr ne apni aasteen apne sar ke upar uthayi: Meri baat suno ay khandan-e-Qays ki beti, rehaish aur naan-nafqa aurat ke liye sirf us waqt hai jab us ka shohar us par rujoo ka haq rakhta ho, lekin agar use rujoo ka haq hasil na ho to us ke liye na rehaish hai na naan-nafqa, phir unhon ne mujh se farmaya: Apni iddat Umm Sharik bint Abi al-Akr ke ghar mein guzaro, phir farmaya: Woh aisi aurat hain jin ke ghar log guftagu karte hain, apni iddat Ibn Umm Maktum ke ghar mein guzaro, kyunke woh beenayi se mehroom mard hain, pas tum apne kapde utar sakogi aur woh tumhein nahi dekhenge."
"372","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujalid ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Shabi se, unhon ne kaha: Fatima bint Qays al-Fihriyya Kufa apne bhai al-Dahhak ibn Qays ke paas aayin jo wahan par muqarrar kiye gaye the, aur hum un ke paas sawal karte hue gaye, to unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humein dopahar ko khutba diya, farmaya: Maine tumhein na kisi raghbat se khutba diya hai na khauf se, lekin ek riwayat ki wajah se jo Tamim al-Dari ne mujh se bayan ki, jis ki khushi ne mujhe dopahar ke aaram se rok diya, Tamim al-Dari ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne kuch chachazad bhaiyon se, ke woh Sham ki taraf se samundar ke raste nikle, to ek tez hawa ne unhein aa liya aur unhein samundar ke ek jazeere ki taraf dhakel diya, jahan unhon ne peshani ke ghane baalon wala ek janwar paya, hum ne kaha: Ay janwar tu kya hai, us ne kaha: Main al-Jassasa hun, hum ne kaha: Humein khabar de, us ne kaha: Na main tumhein khabar dungi na tum se kisi cheez ke baare mein poochungi, lekin is khanqah mein ek aadmi hai jo tumhein khabar dene ka aur tum se khabar lene ka mushtaq hai, pas hum khanqah mein dakhil hue aur ek kana aadmi paya jo zanjeeron mein jakda hua tha, gham zahir karta tha aur bahut shikayat karta tha, jab us ne humein dekha to kaha: Kya tum tabedari kar chuke ho, hum ne use bataya, us ne kaha: Buhaira-e-Tabariya ka kya haal hua, hum ne kaha: Jaisa tha, apne pani se apne logon ko sairab karta hai aur un ki kheton ko sairab karta hai, us ne kaha: Amman aur Baysan ke darmiyan khajoor ke darakhton ka kya haal hua, unhon ne kaha: Woh har saal apna phal dete hain, us ne kaha: Chashma-e-Zughar ka kya haal hua, unhon ne kaha: Us ke log us se peete hain aur us se apne kheton ko sairab karte hain, us ne kaha: Agar ye khushk ho jayein to main in bandhanon se azaad ho jaunga aur apne in dono paon se Madina ke siwa koi pani ki jagah na chhodunga jise raund na dun, phir Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Yahan tak meri khushi pahunchi, phir farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, us ka koi ghati ka rasta nahi magar us par ek farishta khinchi hui talwar ke sath khada hai, use us mein dakhil hone se lautata hua, al-Shabi ne kaha: Main al-Muharrar ibn Abi Hurayra se mila, aur us ne mujh se apne walid se Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se bayan kiya, us mein izafa karte hue: aur Makka, aur us ne kaha: Mashriq ki taraf se, phir bhi woh mashriq ki taraf se nahi hai, al-Shabi ne kaha: Main al-Qasim ibn Muhammad se mila, aur us ne mujh se Aisha se Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah bayan kiya."
"373","Asma bint Yazid ibn al-Sakan al-Ashhaliyya ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, ke unhon ne Asma bint Yazid ibn Sakan ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne humein Dajjal ke baare mein bayan farmaya, us ke muamle ko qareeb karte hue, aur maine kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, main apne ghar walon ke liye aata gundhti hun, aur mera khayal nahi ke woh us ke nikalne se pehle mukammal hoga, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar woh nikalta hai jabke main tum mein hun to main tumhari taraf se us se jhagda karunga, lekin agar woh mere baad nikalta hai to Allah har Musalman par mera janashin hai."
"374","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, Asma bint Yazid ibn Sakan se, ke unhon ne unhein kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mere paas se guzre jabke main kuch aurton mein thi, aur unhon ne humein salam kiya, phir farmaya: Ehsan faramosh karne waliyon se bacho, maine kaha: Ehsan faramoshi kya hai, farmaya: Shayad tum mein se ek apne walidain ke paas ghair shadi shuda lambi muddat rahe aur kunwari budhi ho jaye, phir Allah Ta'ala use shohar ata farmaye aur us se use maal aur aulad ata farmaye, phir woh ghussa ho aur us ka inkar kar de, kehti hue: Maine tum se kisi din kabhi koi bhalayi nahi dekhi."
"375","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Sufyan Shaykh ki kitab se saqit ho gaye halanke woh na-guzir hain, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi al-Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, unhon ne kaha: Main Asma bint Yazid ke paas aaya, aur unhon ne mere qareeb khajooron ya taza khajooron ka ek tokra kiya, aur kaha: Khao, maine kaha: Mujhe raghbat nahi hai, unhon ne mujhe jhidakte hue kaha: Khao, kyunke main hi hun jis ne Aisha ko Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke liye sanwara, main unhein aap ke paas layi aur unhein aap ke dayein bithaya, phir Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas doodh ka ek bartan laya gaya, to aap ne piya, phir use unhein thama diya, lekin unhon ne haya se apna sar jhuka liya, pas maine kaha: Rasul Allah ke hath se le lo, to unhon ne use liya aur piya, phir unhon ne un se farmaya: Apni saheli ko de do, maine kaha: Balke aap piyen Ya Rasul Allah, phir mujhe thamayen, pas unhon ne piya, phir mujhe thamaya, aur maine bartan ko pher liya taake mera munh wahan lage jahan un ka munh laga tha, phir farmaya: Apni saheliyon ko de do, unhon ne kaha: Humein raghbat nahi hai, Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jhoot aur bhook ko jama na karo, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un mein se ek par sone ka ek kanghan dekha, aur farmaya: Kya tum pasand karti ho ke Allah Ta'ala us ki jagah tumhein aag ke kanghan pehnaye, unhon ne kaha: Hum us par toot padin hatta ke hum ne use utar diya aur phenk diya, aur humein is ghadi tak maloom nahi woh kahan hai, phir Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se ek ke liye ye kafi nahi ke chandi ke moti le, phir kuch za'faran le aur use ghol kar un par mal de, to woh aise lagen jaise sone ke hon."
"376","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi al-Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, ke unhon ne Asma bint Yazid ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se kuch aurton ke hamrah bai'at ki, aur farmaya: Jitna tum se ho sake aur tum taqat rakho, hum ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, humari bai'at qubool farmayen, farmaya: Main aurton se musafaha nahi karta, main sirf tum se wohi leta hun jo Allah Ta'ala ne liya hai."
"377","Ansar ke mardon ki riwayat. Muadh ibn Jabal ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Mujhe us ne khabar di jo Muadh ibn Jabal ke paas hazir tha jab maut un ke paas aayi, kehte hue: Mujh se kheme ke parde ko hata do taake main tumhein ek riwayat bayan karun jo maine Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suni, mujhe tumhein use bayan karne se sirf is ne roka ke kahin tum us par bharosa karke a'mal chhod na do, maine Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs apne dil ke ikhlas se, ya apne dil ke yaqeen se, kahe ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi, woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga, aur Aag use nahi chhuyegi."
"378","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Muhammad ibn al-Zibriqan al-Ahwazi Abu Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Humayd ibn Hilal se, Hissan ibn Kahil se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Samura se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi jaan nahi jo is haal mein mare ke gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi aur ke main Allah ka Rasul hun, mutma'in dil ki taraf lautte hue, magar Allah use bakhsh dega."
"379","Ubayy ibn Kab ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Jubayr ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Abbas se kaha: Nawf al-Bakkali da'wa karta hai ke Musa, jo al-Khadir ke sathi hain, woh Bani Israil wale Musa nahi hain, balke dusre Musa hain, Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Allah ke dushman ne jhoot kaha, Ubayy ibn Kab ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Musa Bani Israil mein khutba dete hue khade hue aur un se poocha gaya: Logon mein sab se zyada ilm wala kaun hai, unhon ne kaha: Main sab se zyada ilm wala hun, pas Allah Ta'ala ne unhein malamat farmayi, kyunke unhon ne ilm ko Us ki taraf nahi lautaaya, farmaya: Mera ek banda do samundaron ke sangam par hai jo tum se zyada ilm wala hai, Musa ne kaha: Mere Rab, main us tak kaise pahunch sakta hun, farmaya: Ek machhli lo aur use ek tokre mein rakh lo, phir chal pado, pas jahan tum machhli ko kho do, woh wahin hai, pas unhon ne ek machhli li aur use ek tokre mein rakh liya, phir chal pade, aur un ke khadim Yusha ibn Nun un ke sath chal pade, hatta ke jab woh chattaan tak pahunche, unhon ne apne sar rakh diye aur so gaye, machhli tokre mein harkat kar gayi aur us se nikal kar samundar mein gir gayi, samundar mein apna rasta surang ki tarah banate hue, aur Allah Ta'ala ne machhli se pani ke behne ko rok diya, pas woh us par taaq ki tarah ho gaya, jab Musa jaage to un ke sathi machhli ki khabar dena bhool gaye, aur woh apne baqi din aur raat chalte rahe, hatta ke agli subah Musa ne apne khadim se kaha: Humara subah ka khana lao, hum apne is safar mein thakan se dochar hue hain, unhon ne kaha: Musa ne thakan mehsoos nahi ki hatta ke woh us jagah se aage badh gaye jis ka Allah Ta'ala ne unhein hukm diya tha, un ke khadim ne un se kaha: Kya aap ne dekha jab hum ne chattaan par panah li thi, main machhli ko bhool gaya, aur mujhe us ka zikr bhulane wala Shaitan ke siwa koi nahi, aur us ne samundar mein apna rasta ajeeb tor par bana liya, unhon ne kaha: Machhli ka surang numa rasta tha, jabke Musa aur un ke khadim ke liye woh hairat thi, Musa Alaihis Salam ne farmaya: Yehi hai jo hum talash kar rahe the, pas woh apne qadmon par wapas laut pade, unhon ne kaha: Woh apne qadmon ke nishanat par wapas aaye hatta ke chattaan tak pahunche, jahan ek kapde mein lipta hua aadmi tha, Musa ne use salam kiya, aur al-Khadir ne kaha: Tumhare mulk mein salam kaisa hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Musa hun, us ne kaha: Bani Israil wale Musa, unhon ne kaha: Haan, main tumhare paas aaya hun taake tum mujhe us se sikhayo jo tumhein hidayat mein se sikhayi gayi hai, al-Khadir ne kaha: Tum mere sath hargiz sabr nahi kar sakoge, ay Musa, main Allah Ta'ala ke ilm mein se ek ilm par hun jo Us ne mujhe sikhaya hai aur tum use nahi jante, aur tum Allah Ta'ala ke ilm mein se ek ilm par ho jo Allah Ta'ala ne tumhein sikhaya hai aur main use nahi janta, Musa ne un se kaha: Tum mujhe, agar Allah ne chaha, sabir paoge, aur main kisi muamle mein tumhari nafarmani nahi karunga, al-Khadir ne kaha: Agar tum meri pairvi karo to mujh se kisi cheez ke baare mein na poochna hatta ke main tum se us ka zikr karun, woh samundar ke kinare chalte hue nikle, aur ek kashti un ke paas se guzri, aur unhon ne us ke logon se sawari talab ki, unhon ne al-Khadir ko pehchan liya aur unhein baghair kiraye ke sawar kar liya, jab woh kashti par sawar hue to Musa ko achambha hua jab al-Khadir ne kulhade se kashti ke takhton mein se ek takhta ukhad diya, Musa ne kaha: Logon ne humein baghair kiraye ke sawar kiya, phir bhi tum ne jaan boojh kar un ki kashti mein nuqs daal diya, use cheer kar us ke logon ko gharq karne ke liye, tum ne ek sangin kaam kiya hai, al-Khadir ne kaha: Kya maine nahi kaha tha ke tum mere sath hargiz sabr nahi kar sakoge, Musa ne un se kaha: Mujhe us par na pakdo jo main bhool gaya, aur mere muamle mein mujh par sakhti na karo, unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Musa ki pehli bhool thi, unhon ne kaha: Ek chidiya aayi aur kashti ke kinare par baith kar samundar mein ek chonch mari, aur al-Khadir ne un se kaha: Mere ilm aur tumhare ilm ne Allah ke ilm mein se kuch kam nahi kiya magar jitna is chidiya ne is samundar mein se kam kiya hai, phir woh kashti se utre, aur jabke woh kinare par chal rahe the, al-Khadir ne ek ladke ko ladkon mein khelte hue dekha, aur al-Khadir ne us ka sar pakda aur use apne hath se ukhad diya, use qatl karte hue, Musa ne un se kaha: Kya tum ne ek begunah jaan ko baghair badle qatl kar diya, tum ne ek buri cheez ki hai, us ne kaha: Kya maine tum se nahi kaha tha ke tum mere sath hargiz sabr nahi kar sakoge, aur ye pehli se sakht thi, unhon ne kaha: Agar main is ke baad tum se kisi cheez ke baare mein poochun to mujhe sath na rakhna, tumhein meri taraf se uzr mil chuka hai, unhon ne kaha: Woh chale hatta ke jab woh ek basti ke logon ke paas aaye, unhon ne us ke logon se khana manga, lekin unhon ne un ki mezbani se inkar kar diya, aur unhon ne us mein ek deewar payi jo girne wali thi, unhon ne kaha: Jhuki hui, aur al-Khadir ne apne hath se is tarah ishara kiya aur use seedha kar diya, Musa ne kaha: Hum aise logon ke paas aaye jinhon ne na humein khilaya na humari mezbani ki, agar tum chahte to us par ujrat le sakte the, us ne kaha: Ye mere aur tumhare darmiyan judayi hai, main tumhein us ki ta'beer bataunga jis par tum sabr nahi kar sake, unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Humne chaha Musa Alaihis Salam sabr karte taake humein un ki mazeed kahani bayan ki jati, Said ibn Jubayr ne kaha: Aur Ibn Abbas padha karte the: Aur un ke aage ek badshah tha jo har salim kashti ko zabardasti pakad leta tha, aur woh padha karte the: Aur raha ladka to woh kafir tha, aur us ke walidain momin the."
"380","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Maysara al-Zarrad se, Said ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas se, Us ke farman Woh Buland hai ke baare mein: Aur un ke walid nek the, unhon ne kaha: Us ne unhein un ke walid ki neki ke sabab mehfooz rakha, un ki kisi neki ka zikr kiye baghair."
"381","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Muhammad ibn Suqa ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, unhon ne kaha: Allah Taala naik aadmi ki hifazat ke sabab us ki aulaad aur us ke pote aur jis ghar mein woh rehta hai us ghar aur us ke aas paas ke gharon ki hifazat farmata hai; woh Allah Taala ki hifazat mein rehte hain. Sufyan ne kaha: Aur unhon ne mere liye is mein ye izafa kiya: aur ek pardah."
"382","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abda ibn Abi Lubaba aur Asim ibn Bahdala ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Zirr ibn Hubaysh ko kehte hue suna: Maine Ubayy ibn Kab se Muawwizatain ke baare mein poocha, kehte hue: Ae Abu al-Mundhir, aap ke bhai Ibn Masud inhein mushaf se mita dete hain. Unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se poocha to Aap ne farmaya: Mujh se kaha gaya: Kaho, to maine kaha. Pas hum kehte hain jaisa Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya."
"383","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abda ibn Abi Lubaba aur Asim ibn Bahdala ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Zirr ibn Hubaysh ko kehte hue suna: Maine Ubayy se kaha: Aap ke bhai Ibn Masud kehte hain: Jo poore saal qiyam kare woh Laylat-ul-Qadr ko pa lega. Unhon ne kaha: Allah Abu Abd al-Rahman par rehem farmaye; unhon ne sirf ye chaaha ke log is par bharosa karke na baith rahein, halanke woh jaante the ke woh Ramazan ke aakhri ashre mein hai, aur ke woh sattaisween raat hai. Phir Ubayy ne baghair istisna ke qasam khai: Yeh sattaisween raat hai. Hum ne un se kaha: Ae Abu al-Mundhir, aap ne ise kis se pehchana? Unhon ne kaha: Us nishani ya alamat se jo humein Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne batayi thi. Unhon ne humein khabar di: Ke us din ki subah ko suraj baghair shuauon ke tulu hota hai."
"384","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Asim al-Ahwal ne bayan kiya, Abu Uthman al-Nahdi se, Ubayy ibn Kab se, unhon ne kaha: Mera ek chachazaad bhai door rehta tha, aur maine kaha: Kaash tum masjid ke qareeb ghar le lo, ya ek gadha le lo. Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe pasand nahi ke mera ghar Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke ghar se mila hua ho. Maine us se jab se us ne Islam qabool kiya is se zyada mujh par giraan guzarne wali koi baat nahi suni, halanke woh qadamoon ke sawab ki baat kar raha tha. Pas main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ke liye masjid ki taraf uthaye hue har qadam ke badle ek darja hai."
"385","Abu Ayyub al-Ansari ki riwayaat. Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur mujhe Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi ne khabar di ke unhon ne Abu Ayyub al-Ansari ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman ke liye halal nahi ke apne bhai se teen din se zyada qata talluq kare; woh dono milte hain, aur ye munh pher leta hai aur ye munh pher leta hai, aur un dono mein behtar woh hai jo salam mein pehel kare. Sufyan ne kaha: Hum se al-Zuhri ne is se pehle Anas ki riwayat bayan ki thi, phir is ko is ke saath milaya, kehte hue: Pas mujhe Ata ibn Yazid ne khabar di."
"386","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi ne khabar di, Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Pakhana ya peshab ke waqt qibla ki taraf rukh na karo aur na us ki taraf peeth karo, lekin mashriq ya maghrib ki taraf rukh karo. Abu Ayyub ne kaha: Hum Shaam aaye aur bait-ul-khala qibla rukh bane hue paye, to hum ek taraf hat jaate hain aur Allah Taala se maghfirat talab karte hain. Sufyan se kaha gaya: Lekin Nafi ibn Umar al-Jumahi is ko marfu bayan nahi karte. Unhon ne kaha: Lekin maine ise yaad kiya hai aur marfu bayan karta hun jaisa maine tumhein bataya. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ahle Makkah ne sirf ek kitab li jo Humayd al-Araj Shaam se laya tha, al-Zuhri se likhi hui, jo Ibn Jurayj ko mili; Ahle Makkah woh kitab Ibn Shihab par pesh karte the, lekin hum ne to sirf un ke munh se suna hai."
"387","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Zayd ibn Aslam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ibrahim ibn Abdullah ibn Hunayn ne khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas aur al-Miswar ibn Makhrama ka al-Arj mein ehram wale ke sar dhone ke baare mein ikhtilaf hua, to unhon ne mujhe Abu Ayyub al-Ansari ke paas bheja. Main un ke paas gaya aur unhein kunwein ke do sutoonon ke darmiyan ghusl karte hue paya; jab unhon ne mujhe aate dekha to apne kapde apne seene ki taraf samet liye yahan tak ke maine unhein dekha, aur maine kaha: Aap ke bhatije Ibn Abbas ne mujhe aap ke paas bheja hai, poochte hue ke Aap ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko halat-e-ehram mein sar dhote hue kis tarah dekha tha? To unhon ne apne dono haath apne sar par phere, aage laate aur peeche le jaate hue, farmate hue: Is tarah, is tarah. Pas main un dono ke paas wapas aaya aur unhein khabar di. Al-Miswar ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Main tum se kabhi ikhtilaf nahi karunga."
"388","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sad ibn Said ne bayan kiya, Umar ibn Thabit al-Ansari se, Abu Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: Jo Ramazan ke roze rakhe phir us ke baad Shawwal ke cheh roze rakhe, to goya us ne poore saal roze rakhe. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Maine Sufyan se kaha, ya un se kaha gaya: Log is ko marfu bayan karte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Is baare mein khamosh raho; main is ko jaanta hun."
"389","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad al-Darawardi ne bayan kiya, Safwan ibn Sulaym aur Sad ibn Said se, Umar ibn Thabit se, Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan ke roze rakhe phir us ke baad Shawwal ke cheh roze rakhe, to goya us ne poore saal roze rakhe."
"390","Humein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Ismail ibn Ibrahim al-Saigh ne bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Said se, Umar ibn Thabit se, Abu Ayyub se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah."
"391","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Adi ibn Thabit se, Abdullah ibn Yazid Al-Ansari se, Abu Ayyub se, unhone kaha: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Muzdalifa mein Maghrib aur Isha ikatthi parhi."
"392","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Maine Abu Sad Al-Ama ko Ata ibn Abi Rabah se bayan karte hue suna, keh rahe the: Abu Ayyub Misr mein Uqba ibn Amir ke pas ek riwayat ke bare mein puchne ke liye gaye jo unhone Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suni thi, aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se usay sunne wala un ke aur Uqba ke siwa koi baqi na raha tha, pas jab woh pahunche to Misr ke governor Maslama ibn Mukhallad Al-Ansari ke ghar aaye, to unhe un ki kh"
"393","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ubayda Al-Dabbi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim Al-Nakhai se, Sahm ibn Minjab se, Qaza se, Al-Qartha se, Abu Ayyub se, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam jab suraj dhal jata to chaar rakat namaz padhte aur farmate: Suraj ke dhalne par aasman, ya jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain."
"394","Ubada ibn Al-Samit ki riwayat, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Mahmud ibn Al-Rabi ko Ubada ibn Al-Samit se riwayat karte hue suna, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Us shakhs ki koi namaz nahin jo us mein Kitab ki ibtida na padhe."
"395","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Al-Zuhri ko kehte hue suna: Abu Idris Al-Khawlani ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ubada ibn Al-Samit ko kehte hue suna: Hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas ek majlis mein thay, to Aap ne farmaya: Mujh se is baat par bai'at karo ke tum Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek nahin thehraoge, na chori karoge, na zina karoge, aayat: Tum mein se jo is ko poora kare to us ka ajr Allah par hai, aur jo is mein se kisi kaam ka irtikab kare phir is par use saza di jaye to woh us ke liye kaffara hai, aur jo is mein se kisi kaam ka irtikab kare aur Allah Ta'ala us ki parda poshi farmaye to phir woh Allah Ta'ala ke supurd hai: agar Woh chahe to use bakhsh de aur agar chahe to use azaab de, Sufyan ne kaha: Hum Al-Zuhri ke paas thay, aur jab unhon ne yeh riwayat bayan ki to Abu Bakr Al-Hudhali ne mujhe is ko yaad karne ke liye ishara kiya to main ne ise likh liya, phir jab Al-Zuhri khare hue to main ne Abu Bakr ko is se aagah kar diya."
"396","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said Al-Ansari aur Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan farmaya, Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban se, Abdullah ibn Muhayriz se, Al-Mukhdaji se, jinhon ne kaha: Ubada ibn Al-Samit se kaha gaya: Abu Muhammad kehte hain ke witr wajib hai, Ubada ne kaha: Abu Muhammad ne ghalati ki, main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Paanch namazein hain jo Allah ne bandon par din aur raat mein farz ki hain, jo inhen ada kare aur in ke huqooq mein se kisi haq mein kami na kare to isteta'at rakhne walon ke liye Allah Ta'ala par haq hai ke Woh use Jannat mein dakhil farmaye, aur jo inhen ada na kare to us ka Allah se koi ehad nahin: agar Woh chahe to use bakhsh de aur agar chahe to use azaab de."
"397","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ubada ibn Al-Walid ko riwayat karte hue suna, Ubada ibn Al-Samit se, jinhon ne kaha: Hum ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se sunne aur ita'at karne par bai'at ki, tangi aur aasani mein, nashaat aur na-pasandidgi mein, aur hukm walon se hukm mein jhagra na karne par, aur haq baat kehne par jahan bhi hum hon, Allah Ta'ala ke baare mein kisi malamat karne wale ki malamat se na darte hue."
"398","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Zayd ibn Judan ne hum se bayan farmaya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Muslim ibn Yasar se, Ubada ibn Al-Samit se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sona sone ke badle, misl ba misl, chandi chandi ke badle, misl ba misl, khajoor khajoor ke badle, misl ba misl, gehun gehun ke badle, misl ba misl, jau jau ke badle, misl ba misl, yahan tak ke unhon ne namak ka namak ke badle zikr farmaya: Jo zyada de ya zyada taleb kare to woh sood hai."
"399","Abu Al-Darda ki riwayaat, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan farmaya, Abd Al-Aziz ibn Rufay se, Abu Salih se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Misr ke ek aadmi se, jis ne kaha: Main ne Abu Al-Darda se Allah Ta'ala ke is farman ke baare mein poocha: Jo iman laye aur muttaqi rahe, un ke liye duniya ki zindagi mein aur aakhirat mein khushkhabri hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab se main ne is ke baare mein Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se poocha tha, tumhare aur ek aadmi ke siwa kisi ne mujh se is ke baare mein nahin poocha, main ne Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se is ke baare mein poocha to unhon ne farmaya: Jab se yeh naazil hui, tumhare aur ek aadmi ke siwa kisi ne mujh se is ke baare mein nahin poocha: nek khwab jise Musalman dekhe ya us ke liye dekha jaye."
"400","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan farmaya: Sufyan ne kaha: Phir main Abd Al-Aziz ibn Rufay se mila aur unhon ne mujh se yeh riwayat bayan ki, Abu Salih se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Misr ke ek aadmi se, Abu Al-Darda se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah."
"401","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulayka se, Yala ibn Mamlak se, Umm al-Darda se, Abu al-Darda se, ke Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jise narmi me se us ka hissa diya gaya use bhalai me se us ka hissa diya gaya, aur jo narmi me se apne hisse se mehrum rakha gaya woh bhalai me se apne hisse se mehrum rakha gaya."
"402","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulayka se, Yala ibn Mamlak se, Umm al-Darda se, Abu al-Darda se, ke Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tarazu me sab se bhari cheez husn-e-akhlaq hai, aur Allah Taala bad-zaban fahhash se bugz rakhta hai."
"403","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ibn al-Saib ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Sulami se, Abu al-Darda se, ke ek shakhs un ke pas aaya aur un se kaha: Mere walid mujhe use talaq dene ka hukm dete hain, Abu al-Darda ne kaha: Maine Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Walid Jannat ka darmiyani darwaza hai, pas use zaya kar de ya us ki hifazat kar, aur Sufyan kabhi kehte: Meri walida, aur kabhi kehte: Meri walida ya mere walid."
"404","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Amash se, Ibrahim se, Alqama se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Sham me tilawat ki: Raat ki qasam jab woh chha jaye, aur din ki jab woh roshan ho, aur nar aur mada ki, Abu al-Darda ne kaha: Kya tum ne Abdullah ko isi tarah tilawat karte hue suna hai, maine kaha: Ji han, unhon ne kaha: Woh gawahi dete hain ke unhon ne Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko isi tarah tilawat karte hue suna: aur nar aur mada."
"405","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhayl ibn Abi Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Yazid al-Sadi se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Said ibn al-Musayyib se lakadbaggha khane ke bare me pucha, unhon ne kaha: Kya use koi khata hai, maine kaha: Meri qaum me se kuch log unhe phande me pakadte hain aur khate hain, Said ne kaha: Use khana durust nahi, un ke pas ek buzurg ne kaha: Kya main tumhe woh baat na bataun jo maine Abu al-Darda se suni, maine Abu al-Darda ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne har loot, har noch-khasot, bandh kar nishana banaye gaye janwar aur har kachli wale darinde se mana farmaya."
"406","Zayd ibn Thabit al-Ansari ki riwayaat, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Tawus ko bayan karte hue suna, Hujr al-Madari se, Zayd ibn Thabit se, ke Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne umra ko waris ke liye faisla farmaya."
"407","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim ibn Abdullah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Aur Zayd ibn Thabit ne mujhe khabar di ke Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne araya ki bai ki ijazat di."
"408","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad ibn Sad al-Khurasani ne hum se bayan kiya, Shurahbil ibn Sad se, unhon ne kaha: Zayd ibn Thabit hamare pas aaye jabke hum ek bagh me parindon ke liye phande laga rahe the, to unhon ne hame hata diya, kehte hue: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Madina me shikar se mana farmaya."
"409","Sahl ibn Abi Hathma ki riwayaat, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safwan ibn Sulaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nafi ibn Jubayr ibn Mutim ne mujhe khabar di, Sahl ibn Abi Hathma se, ke Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi sutre ki taraf namaz padhe to us se qareeb ho jaye, taake shaitan us ki namaz na kaat de."
"410","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bushayr ibn Yasar Ibn Haritha ke azaad karda ghulam ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Sahl ibn Abi Hathma ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasul Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne phal ko khajuron ke badle bechne se mana farmaya, siwa is ke ke unhon ne ariya ko us ke andaze se bechne ki ijazat di, us ke log use tar khajur ki surat me khate hue."
"411","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bushayr ibn Yasar ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Sahl ibn Abi Hathma ko kehte hue suna: Abdullah ibn Sahl Khaybar ke kisi be-paani kuen ya kuon mein se ek kuen mein maqtul paye gaye, to un ke bhai Abd al-Rahman ibn Sahl aur un ke chacha Huwayyisa aur Muhayyisa ibna Masud Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hue, Abd al-Rahman baat karne ke liye aage badhe to Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Bade ko, bade ko, to Muhayyisa ne guftagu ki aur Abdullah ibn Sahl ke qatl ka zikr karte hue arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, hum ne Abdullah ibn Sahl ko maqtul paya hai, aur Yahud kufr aur خیانت wale log hain, unhi ne unhen qatl kiya hai, to Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Phir tum pachaas qasmen khao aur apne saathi ke ya apne saathi ke khoon ke mustahiq ho jao, unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, hum us cheez par kis tarah qasam khaen jis par hum hazir na the aur jise hum ne dekha nahi, Aap ne farmaya: Phir Yahud pachaas qasmon ke zariye apni baraat karenge, unhon ne arz kiya: Hum mushrik qaum ki qasmon ko kis tarah qabool karen, to Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne apne maal se un ki diyat ada farma di, Sahl ne kaha: Un mein se ek chhoti untni ne mujhe laat mari."
"412","Sahl ibn Hunayf al-Ansari ki riwayaat, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine al-Amash se suna, wo keh rahe the: Maine Shaqiq ibn Salama Abu Wail se suna, wo keh rahe the: Siffin ke din jab do hakamon ne tahkim kiya to Maine Sahl ibn Hunayf ko kehte hue suna: Aye logon, apni raay par shak karo, hum Abu Jandal ke din Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath the, aur agar hum Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke hukm ko rad kar sakte to use rad kar dete, Allah ki qasam, jab se hum Islam laye hum ne kisi takleef-deh muamle ke liye apni talwaron ko apne kandhon par nahi rakha magar us ne hamen aasaani se kisi aise muamle tak pahunchaya jise hum pehchante the, magar ye muamla, Allah ki qasam, is mein koi shigaf band nahi hota magar hum par dusra shigaf khul jata hai."
"413","Rafi ibn Khadij al-Ansari ki riwayaat, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Hum batai par zameen dete the aur is mein koi harj nahi samajhte the, yahan tak ke Rafi ibn Khadij ne daawa kiya ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne is se mana farmaya hai, to hum ne un ki baat ki wajah se ise chhor diya."
"414","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hanzala ibn Qays al-Zuraqi ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Rafi ibn Khadij ko kehte hue suna: Hum Ansar mein sab se zyada kheton wale the, aur hum jis se muzaraat karte use kehte: Ye hissa tumhara hai aur ye hissa hamara hai jise wo hamare liye kaasht karta, phir kabhi ye paidawar deta aur ye na deta, to Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamen is se mana farmaya, lekin chandi ke badle se hamen mana nahi farmaya, Sufyan se kaha gaya: Lekin Malik ise Rabia se, Hanzala se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye Yahya ke paas hai to wo is se kya ummeed rakhega, Yahya dono mein zyada zabt wale hain, lekin hum ne ise Yahya se yaad kiya tha."
"415","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban se, un ke chacha Wasi ibn Habban se ke ek ghulam ne kisi shakhs ke bagh se khajoor ke narm gache churaye aur la kar apne ghar walon ke bagh mein laga diye, to use Marwan ibn al-Hakam ke paas laya gaya jinhon ne us ka haath kaatne ka irada kiya, to Rafi ibn Khadij ne gawahi di ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Phal mein aur khajoor ke gude mein haath kaatna nahi hai, to Marwan ne use chhor diya."
"416","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Karim ne hum se bayan kiya: Jis ne chori ki thi us ka naam Fil tha."
"417","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim ibn Umar ibn Qatada se, Mahmud ibn Labid se, Rafi ibn Khadij se ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Fajr ki namaz ujale mein padho kyunke ye ajr ke liye bada hai, ya unhon ne kaha: tumhare ajron ke liye."
"418","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn Said ibn Masruq ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abaya ibn Rifaa ibn Rafi se, Rafi ibn Khadij se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, hum kal dushman se milenge aur hamare paas chhuriyan nahi hain, kya hum sarkandon se zabah karen, to Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo cheez khoon baha de aur us par Allah ka naam liya gaya ho use khao, siwae daant ya nakhun ke, kyunke daant insan ki haddi hai aur nakhun Habshiyon ki chhuri hai."
"419","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn Said ibn Masruq ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abaya ibn Rifaa se, Rafi ibn Khadij se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne oont aur bakriyan ghanimat mein hasil kiyen aur hum ek oont ko das bakriyon ke barabar qarar dete the, phir un mein se ek oont hum se badak gaya to hum ne use teeron se mara, phir hum ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se daryaft kiya to Aap ne farmaya: In oonton mein wehshat hai jaise wehshi janwaron ki wehshat hoti hai, jab in mein se koi badak jaye to us ke saath aisa hi karo aur use khao, Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Ismail ibn Muslim ne is mein izafa kiya: Hum ne use teer mare yahan tak ke hum ne use gira diya."
"420","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya: Umar ibn Said ibn Masruq se, un ke walid se, Abaya se, Rafi ibn Khadij se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Hunayn ke din Abu Sufyan ibn Harb, Safwan ibn Umayya, Uyayna ibn Hisn aur al-Aqra ibn Habis ko sau sau oont diye aur Abbas ibn Mirdas ko is se kam diya, phir Sufyan ne kaha: Umar ya kisi aur ne is riwayat mein kaha ke Abbas ibn Mirdas ne guftagu ki to Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un ke liye sau pure kar diye."
"421","Abdullah ibn Zayd al-Ansari ki riwayat, jin ko azaan dikhai gai thi. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Said ibn al-Musayyib aur Abbad ibn Tamim ne khabar di, apne chacha Abdullah ibn Zayd se, unhon ne kaha: ek shakhs ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se shikayat ki ke use namaz mein kuch khayal mehsoos hota hai, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jab tak awaz na sune ya boo na paye na nikle. Aur Sufyan kabhi kehte: peeche na hate."
"422","Abu Qatada al-Ansari ki riwayat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Salama ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: main aisa khwab dekhta tha jo mujhe kanpka deta tha jabke main odhe hue na hota, phir main Abu Qatada ke paas aaya aur un se is ki shikayat ki, to unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: achha khwab Allah ki taraf se hai, aur bura khwab Shaitan ki taraf se hai; jab tum mein se koi napasandeedah bura khwab dekhe to apni baen taraf teen martaba thuke aur jo kuch us ne dekha us ke shar se Allah ki panah mange, kyunke wo use nuqsan nahi pahunchayega."
"423","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: aur hum se chaar ne ise bayan kiya: Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman jo aal-e-Talha ke aazad karda hain, Abd Rabbihi aur Yahya jo Said ke bete hain, aur Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqama, ke unhon ne ise Abu Salama ibn Abd al-Rahman se suna, wo Abu Qatada se riwayat karte the: ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: nek khwab Allah ki taraf se hai, aur bura khwab Shaitan ki taraf se hai; jab tum mein se koi napasandeedah bura khwab dekhe to apni baen taraf teen martaba phoonke aur jo kuch us ne dekha us ke shar se Allah ki panah mange, kyunke wo use nuqsan nahi pahunchayega."
"424","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, riwayat ke aaghaz ka zikr kiye baghair jaisa al-Zuhri ne use zikr kiya tha, aur al-Zuhri un sab se zyada yaad rakhne wale hain."
"425","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Abi Sulayman aur Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Amir ibn Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr se suna, wo Amr ibn Sulaym al-Zuraqi se riwayat karte the, wo Abu Qatada al-Ansari se, ke unhon ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to baithne se pehle do rakaten padhe."
"426","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Abi Sulayman aur Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Amir ibn Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr se suna, wo Amr ibn Sulaym al-Zuraqi se khabar dete the, wo Abu Qatada se, unhon ne kaha: maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko logon ki imamat karte dekha jabke Umama bint Abi al-As jo Zaynab bint Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki beti hain un ke kandhe par thin; jab wo ruku karte use utar dete, aur jab sajde se farigh hote use phir utha lete."
"427","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar ibn Kathir ibn Aflah se, Abu Muhammad se, Abu Qatada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujhe Hunayn ke din mere qatl kiye hue maqtool ka saman ata farmaya. Sufyan ne kaha: riwayat taweel hai, aur maine us mein se ye yaad kiya hai."
"428","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih ibn Kaysan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Muhammad ko kehte suna: maine Abu Qatada ko kehte suna: hum Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath nikle hatta ke jab hum al-Qaha mein the, hum mein se kuch ehram mein aur kuch baghair ehram ke the, maine apne sathiyon ko kisi cheez ki taraf dekhte dekha, to maine dekha aur ek jangli gadha dekha. Maine apne ghode par zeen kasi aur sawar hua, apna neza liya, lekin mera koda gir gaya. Maine apne sathiyon se kaha: use mujhe pakdao, lekin wo ehram mein the, to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, hum is ke khilaf kisi cheez mein tumhari madad nahi karenge. Pas maine apna koda uthaya, phir gadhe ke peeche se aaya jabke wo ek teele se pare tha, aur use apne neze se mara, use kaat kar gira diya, aur use apne sathiyon ke paas laya. Kuch ne kaha: use khao. Doosron ne kaha: use na khao. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hum se aage the, to maine apne ghode ko ed lagayi aur un tak pahunch gaya, aur un se poocha, to unhon ne farmaya: ye halal hai, pas use khao."
"429","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muhammad ibn Qays ne khabar di, Abdullah ibn Abi Qatada se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, agar main apni is talwar se Allah ke raste mein ladun hatta ke qatl kar diya jaun, sabr karne wala, sawab chahne wala, aage badhne wala, peeche na hatne wala; to kya Allah mere gunah mita dega? Unhon ne farmaya: Haan. Phir thodi der khamosh rahe, hatta ke maine samjha ke un par kuch nazil ho raha hai. Jab wo shakhs peeth pher kar gaya to farmaya: aao; ye Jibril keh rahe hain: siwaye is ke ke tum par qarz ho."
"430","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Qays se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah."
"431","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abdullah ibn Abi Qatada se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz qaim ho jaye to us waqt tak khare na ho jab tak tum mujhe na dekh lo."
"432","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar se, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abdullah ibn Abi Qatada se, un ke walid se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne aadmi ko apni sharamgah ko apne dayen haath se chhune se mana farmaya. Sufyan ne kaha: Yaani istinja karne me."
"433","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ibn Shabur ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Qazaa se, Abu al-Khalil se, Abu Harmala se, Abu Qatada se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Youm-e-Arafa ka roza is saal aur is ke baad wale saal ka kaffara ban jata hai, aur Ashura ka roza ek saal ka kaffara ban jata hai. Sufyan ne kaha: Dawud ne kaha: Aur Ata us ka roza nahin rakhte the yahan tak ke un tak ye riwayat pahunchi."
"434","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ek khatoon se suna, mera khayal hai ke wo Abdullah ibn Abi Qatada ki ahliya thin, Sufyan ko shak hai, ke Abu Qatada un ke paas aate aur un ke saath wuzu karte, billi ko pilane ke liye bartan jhuka dete, aur hum ne un se us ke juthe ke bare me pucha to unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamein khabar di ke wo napak nahin hai, farmate hue: Wo tumhare ird gird aane jaane walon me se hai, nar aur mada."
"435","Abu Talha al-Ansari ki riwayaat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, Abu Talha al-Ansari se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Farishta us ghar me dakhil nahin hota jis me kutta ya tasveer ho."
"436","Khuzayma ibn Thabit al-Ansari ki riwayaat. Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, qaza-e-hajat ke liye jaane wale aadmi ke bare me farmate hue: Kya tum me se koi teen pathar nahin pa sakta. Hisham ne kaha: Aur Abu Wajza ne mujhe khabar di, Umara ibn Khuzayma ibn Thabit se, un ke walid se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Un me gobar na ho."
"437","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se Hisham se isi tarah bayan kiya, siwaye is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Abu Khuzayma se, Umara se."
"438","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim al-Taymi se, Amr ibn Maymun al-Awdi se, Abu Abdullah al-Jadali se, Khuzayma ibn Thabit al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamein musafir ke liye teen din aur un ki raaton tak mozon par masah karne ki ijazat di, aur muqeem ke liye ek din aur raat; aur agar hum un se mazeed mangte to wo hamein mazeed ata farmate."
"439","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Umar ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ibrahim al-Taymi se, Amr ibn Maymun al-Awdi se, Abu Abdullah al-Jadali se, Khuzayma ibn Thabit al-Ansari se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah, siwaye is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Agar sawal karne wala sawal me zyada karta to wo use mazeed ata farmate."
"440","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Usama ibn al-Had ne hum se bayan kiya, Umara ibn Khuzayma ibn Thabit se, un ke walid se ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah haq baat se haya nahin farmata; aurton ke paas un ki pusht me na jao."
"441","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se Hisham se isi tarah bayan kiya, siwa is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Abu Khuzayma se, Umara se."
"442","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim al-Taymi se, Amr ibn Maymun al-Awdi se, Abu Abdullah al-Jadali se, Khuzayma ibn Thabit al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamein musafir ke liye teen din aur un ki raaton tak mozon par masah karne ki ijazat di, aur muqeem ke liye ek din aur ek raat ki; aur agar hum un se zyada maangte to woh hamein zyada ata farmate."
"443","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: Umar ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ibrahim al-Taymi se, Amr ibn Maymun al-Awdi se, Abu Abdullah al-Jadali se, Khuzayma ibn Thabit al-Ansari se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi tarah, siwa is ke ke unhon ne farmaya: Agar sawal karne wala kasrat se sawal karta to woh use zyada ata farmate."
"444","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Usama ibn al-Had ne hum se bayan kiya, Umara ibn Khuzayma ibn Thabit se, apne walid se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah haq baat se haya nahi farmata; aurton ke paas un ki pusht me na jao."
"445","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Yahya ibn Said al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Bushayr ibn Yasar ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Suwayd ibn al-Numan al-Ansari ko kehte hue suna: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Khaybar ki taraf nikle yahan tak ke jab hum al-Sahba me the, aur hamare aur us ke darmiyan thoda fasla tha, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne safar ka khana talab farmaya, to sawiq ke siwa kuchh na laya gaya; to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne use chabaya aur hum ne bhi un ke sath chabaya; phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne kulli farmayi aur hum ne bhi un ke sath kulli ki; phir unhon ne hamein Maghrib ki namaz parhayi aur hum ne un ke sath namaz parhi, aur unhon ne wuzu na farmaya."
"446","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Jami ibn Abi Rashid, Abd al-Malik ibn Ayan, aur Asim ibn Bahdalah ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne use Abu Wail se suna, kehte hue: Main ne Qays ibn Abi Gharazah ko kehte hue suna: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke zamane me dallal kehlate the; aap hamare paas tashreef laye jabke hum al-Baqi me hatho me chhadiyan liye hue the, to aap ne hamein is se behtar naam diya, farmaya: Ae tajiron ki jamaat; to hum aap ki taraf jama ho gaye, to aap ne farmaya: Is khareed o farokht me qasam aur jhoot shamil ho jate hain, to is me sadqe ko shamil karo."
"447","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Marwan ibn Muawiyah al-Fazari ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Shumaylah al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, Salamah ibn Ubaydullah ibn Mihsan al-Ansari se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se jo shakhs is hal me subah kare ke apni qaum me aman se ho, apne jism me tandrust ho, us ke paas us din ka khana maujud ho, to goya us ke liye duniya jama kar di gayi."
"448","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Farwah al-Juhani ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne Abdullah ibn Ukaym ko kehte hue suna: Hum al-Madain me Hudhayfah ke sath the jab unhon ne ek dihqan se pani maanga, to woh un ke paas chandi ke bartan me pani laya; to Hudhayfah ne use phenk diya - aur woh sakht mizaj rakhne wale shakhs the - aur logon ne un se baat karna napasand kiya; phir woh logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur kaha: Main tum se is par mazrat karta hun; main ne use hidayat ki thi ke mujhe is me pine ko na de; phir unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam hamare darmiyan khade hue aur farmaya: Sone aur chandi ke bartano se na piyo, aur dibaj aur resham na pehno, kyunke ye un ke liye is duniya me hai aur tumhare liye Akhirat me hai."
"449","Sufyan ne kaha: Aur Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Hudhayfah ke sath the, aur unhon ne bilkul isi ki manind zikr kiya."
"450","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Wail se, Hudhayfah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam jab raat me uthte to miswak se apna munh malte."
"451","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: al-A'mash ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Hudhayfah ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha ke Aap ek qaum ke kura-karkat ke dher par tashreef laye aur khade ho kar peshab farmaya, to main Aap se door hatne laga lekin Aap ne mujhe apni taraf khench liya hatta ke main Aap ki ediyon ke paas ho gaya, phir jab Aap farigh ho gaye to Aap ne wuzu farmaya aur apne khuffon par masah farmaya."
"452","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Mansur ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Yazid al-Nakha'i se, Hammam ibn al-Harith se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Hudhayfah ke sath the ke ek shakhs hamare paas se guzra, aur Hudhayfah se kaha gaya: Ye shakhs hukkam tak baatein pahunchata hai, to Hudhayfah ne farmaya: Main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Chughalkhor Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga, Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur qattat chughalkhor hi hai."
"453","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hamein bayan kiya, Rib'i ibn Hirash se, Hudhayfah ibn al-Yaman se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam jab sone ka irada farmate to Apna hath Apne sar ke neeche rakhte phir farmate: Ae Allah, mujhe Apne azab se bacha Us Din jab Tu Apne bandon ko jama karega — ya farmaya: uthayega."
"454","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu Ishaq al-Hamdani ne hamein bayan kiya, Muslim ibn Nudhayr se, Hudhayfah se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne meri pindli ke pathhe ke nichle hisse ko pakda — ya unki pindli — aur farmaya: Ye izar ki jagah hai, agar tum inkar karo to neecha karo, agar inkar karo to neecha karo, agar inkar karo to takhnon se neeche izar ka koi haq nahi."
"455","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: al-A'mash ne hamein bayan kiya, aur wo is hadith mein sab se zyada pukhta the, farmaya: Zayd ibn Wahb ne mujhe khabar di, farmaya: Main ne Hudhayfah ibn al-Yaman ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hamein do hadeesein bayan farmayeen, main ne un mein se ek ko dekh liya hai aur dusri ka intezar kar raha hun, Aap ne hamein bayan farmaya: Amanat logon ke dilon ki jadon mein utri, phir Quran nazil hua to unhon ne Quran se seekha aur Sunnat se seekha, phir Aap ne hamein uske uth jane ke bare mein bayan farmaya, farmaya: Aadmi ek jhapki sota hai aur amanat uske dil se le li jati hai aur uska nishan ek daane ke nishan ki tarah baqi reh jata hai, phir wo sota hai aur amanat uske dil se le li jati hai aur uska nishan ek aable ke nishan ki tarah baqi reh jata hai, phir unhon ne kankariyan leen aur unhen apni taang par ludhkaya, farmaya: Jaise ek angara tum ne apni taang par ludhkaya to us ne aabla kar diya, aur tum use ubhra hua dekhte ho halanke us mein kuch nahi hota, aur log tijarat karte rahenge halanke un mein amanat ada karne wala koi shakhs nahi hoga, hatta ke kaha jayega ke falan shakhs kitna mazboot hai, kitna hoshiyar, kitna aqalmand — halanke uske dil mein rai ke daane ke barabar iman nahi hoga, main parwah nahi karta tha ke main kisse tijarat karta hun: agar wo Musalman hota to uska Islam mera haq mujhe lauta deta, aur agar wo Yahudi ya Isai hota to uska wakeel use mujhe lauta deta, aur aaj main falan falan ke siwa kisi se tijarat nahi karta."
"456","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Jami' ibn Abi Rashid aur Sulayman al-A'mash ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Wa'il se, Hudhayfah ibn al-Yaman se, unhon ne farmaya: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne farmaya: Fitne ke bare mein hamein kaun bayan karega, main ne kaha: Main ne unhen farmate hue suna: Aadmi ki aazmaish uske ghar walon, uske maal, aur uske padosi mein namaz, sadqa, aur roze se kaffara ho jati hai, Umar ne farmaya: Main tum se uske bare mein nahi pooch raha, main tum se uske bare mein pooch raha hun jo samandar ke mauj marne ki tarah mauj marega, main ne kaha: Us se pehle ek band darwaza hai — ek shakhs ka qatl, ya uski maut, unhon ne farmaya: Kya wo darwaza toda jayega ya khola jayega, main ne kaha: Nahi, balke toda jayega, Umar ne farmaya: Ye zyada mumkin hai ke Qayamat ke Din tak kabhi band na ho, al-A'mash ne hamein bayan kiya, aur hum Hudhayfah se ye poochne se darte the ke kya Umar jante the ke wo hi darwaza hain, to hum ne Masruq ko hidayat ki aur unhon ne un se poocha, unhon ne farmaya: Haan, jaise tum jante ho ke kal se pehle aaj ki raat hai, ye is liye ke main ne unhen ek aisi hadith bayan ki thi jis mein koi iltibas nahi."
"457","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Mis'ar ne hamein bayan kiya, Asim ibn Bahdalah se, Zirr ibn Hubaysh se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Hudhayfah se kaha: Kya Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Bayt al-Maqdis mein namaz padhi, Hudhayfah ne farmaya: Tum kehte ho ke unhon ne us mein namaz padhi, ae ganje, main ne kaha: Haan, mere aur tumhare darmiyan Quran hai, Hudhayfah ne farmaya: Use lao, jis ne Quran se hujjat ki wo ghalib aaya, to main ne unhen padh kar sunaya: Paak hai Wo jo Apne bande ko raat mein Masjid-e-Haram se Masjid-e-Aqsa tak le gaya, Hudhayfah ne mujh se farmaya: Tum kahan pate ho ke unhon ne us mein namaz padhi, agar unhon ne us mein namaz padhi hoti to us mein namaz tum par farz ki jati jaise Masjid-e-Haram mein namaz farz ki gayi, phir Hudhayfah ne farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas lambi daraz peeth wala ek janwar laya gaya jise al-Buraq kaha jata hai, uska qadam had-e-nazar tak padta tha, aur wo dono al-Buraq ki peeth se na utre hatta ke unhon ne Jannat aur Jahannam aur Aakhirat ke tamam wade ko dekh liya, aur wo riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne use bandh diya — kya wo un se bhag jata, balke ghaib aur hazir ke Janne Wale ne use unke liye musakhkhar kar diya tha."
"458","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Za'idah ibn Qudamah al-Thaqafi ne hamein bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Rib'i ibn Hirash se, Hudhayfah se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Mere baad wale dono ki pairwi karo: Abu Bakr aur Umar, Ammar ki hidayat se hidayat hasil karo, aur Ibn Umm Abd ke ahd ko mazbuti se thame raho."
"459","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hamein bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham ko bayan karte hue suna, Abu Mas'ud al-Ansari, Uqbah ibn Amr se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne kutte ki qeemat, fahisha ki ujrat, aur kahin ki ujrat se mana farmaya."
"460","Al-Humaydi ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hamein bayan kiya, farmaya: Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ne ek din namaz mein takheer ki, aur Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne un se kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jibril nazil hue aur unhon ne meri imamat karayi to main ne unke sath namaz padhi, phir wo nazil hue aur unhon ne meri imamat karayi to main ne unke sath namaz padhi, phir wo nazil hue aur unhon ne meri imamat karayi to main ne unke sath namaz padhi, hatta ke unhon ne paanch namazein shumar keen, Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ne un se farmaya: Allah se daro, ae Urwah, aur ghaur karo ke tum kya keh rahe ho, Urwah ne farmaya: Bashir ibn Abi Mas'ud ne mujhe iski khabar di, apne walid se, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se."
"461","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Yazid se, Alqamah se, Abu Masud se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat mein Surah al-Baqarah ki aakhri do aayaton ki tilawat kare woh us ke liye kaafi ho jayengi. Abd al-Rahman ibn Yazid ne kaha: Phir main tawaf mein Abu Masud se mila aur un se is ke bare mein poocha to unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat mein Surah al-Baqarah ki aakhri do aayaton ki tilawat kare woh us ke liye kaafi ho jayengi."
"462","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Qays ibn Abi Hazim ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Abu Masud ko kehte hue suna: Ek aadmi Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, main fajar ki namaz se is liye peeche reh jata hun ke falan shakhs hamare liye use bahut lamba kar deta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko naseehat ke mauqe par us din se zyada ghusse mein kabhi nahin dekha. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se kuch log door bhagane wale hain; tum mein se kuch log door bhagane wale hain. Pas tum mein se jo shakhs logon ki imamat kare use chahiye ke takhfeef kare, kyunke un mein boodhe, beemar, kamzor aur hajatmand hote hain."
"463","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, Umarah ibn Umayr se, Abu Mamar se, Abu Masud se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Us namaz ka koi kifayat nahin jis mein aadmi ruku aur sajde mein apni peeth seedhi na kare. Sufyan ne kaha: Al-Amash ne isi tarah kaha tha."
"464","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Qays ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Abu Masud ko kehte hue suna: Us din suraj ko grahan laga jis din Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sahabzade Ibrahim ka inteqal hua, to logon ne kaha: Suraj ko Ibrahim ki maut ki wajah se grahan laga hai. Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain; unhen kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta. Pas jab tum ye dekho to Allah ke zikr aur namaz ki taraf jaldi karo."
"465","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, Umarah ibn Umayr se, Abu Mamar se, Abu Masud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam namaz mein hamare kandhe seedhe kiya karte the, farmate hue: Ikhtilaf na karo warna tumhare dil ikhtilaf mein pad jayenge; aur samajh aur pukhtagi wale mujh se qareeb hon, phir jo un se qareeb hon, phir jo un se qareeb hon."
"466","Sufyan ne kaha: Hum ne ise al-Amash se yaad kiya tha, aur hum ne ise yahan Makkah mein nahin paya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ismail ibn Raja ko bayan karte hue suna, Aws ibn Damaj al-Hadrami se, Abu Masud al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Logon ki imamat woh kare jo un mein Allah ki Kitab ka sab se zyada qari ho; agar qirat mein barabar hon to un mein Sunnat ka sab se zyada jane wala; agar Sunnat mein barabar hon to un mein hijrat mein sab se pehle wala; agar hijrat mein barabar hon to un mein sab se bada. Aur koi shakhs kisi ki hukumat wali jagah mein us ki imamat na kare, aur na us ke ghar mein us ki izzat wali nashist par us ki ijazat ke baghair baithe."
"467","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Qays ibn Abi Hazim se, Abu Masud se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sakhti, ghalazat aur dilon ki tundkhuwi wabar wale buland aawaz charwahon mein hai, oonton ki dumon ki jadon ke paas, Rabiah aur Mudar ki taraf se."
"468","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kathir ibn Abbas ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Hunayn ke din Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath tha, aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apne us khacchar par the jo Judhami ne Aap ko hadiya kiya tha. Jab Musalman peeth pher gaye to Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abbas, pukaro, yeh kehte hue: Ae samurah darakht walo; Ae Surah al-Baqarah walo. Aur main buland aawaz wala aadmi tha, to main ne kaha: Ae samurah walo; Ae Surah al-Baqarah walo. Woh is tarah palat kar wapas aaye jaise gaayen apne bachchon ki taraf palatti hain, aawazen buland huin, aur woh keh rahe the: Ae Ansar ki jamaat; Ae Ansar ki jamaat. Phir pukar Banu al-Harith ibn al-Khazraj tak mehdood ho gayi: Ae Banu al-Harith. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apne khacchar par hote hue seedhe khade ho gaye, farmate hue: Yehi woh waqt hai jab ladai tez ho gayi hai. Aur woh farma rahe the: Aage badho Ae Abbas. Phir Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne kankariyan lin aur phenkin, phir farmaya: Kabah ke Rab ki qasam woh shikast kha gaye. Aur Sufyan kabhi kehte: Muhammad ke Rab ki qasam. Sufyan ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se ise tafseel se bayan kiya tha, aur yehi hai jo main ne is mein se yaad rakha."
"469","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah ibn al-Harith ibn Nawfal ko kehte hue suna: Main ne al-Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib ko kehte hue suna: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, Abu Talib Aap ki hifazat aur himayat kiya karte the, to kya is ne unhen koi faida diya? Aap ne farmaya: Haan; main ne unhen Aag ki gehraiyon mein paya, aur unhen nikal kar us ke uthle kinare tak le aaya."
"470","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn al-Harith se, al-Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib se, ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, mujhe koi dua sikhaiye jis se main dua karun. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abbas, Allah se muafi aur aafiyat mango. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, mujhe koi dua sikhaiye jis se main dua karun. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abbas, Ae Rasul Allah ke chacha, Allah se muafi aur aafiyat mango. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, mujhe koi dua sikhaiye jis se main dua karun. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abbas, Ae Rasul Allah ke chacha, Allah se duniya aur aakhirat mein muafi aur aafiyat mango. Abu Bakr al-Humaydi ne kaha: Aur Sufyan is hadith mein kabhi kehte, Abdullah ibn al-Harith se, ke al-Abbas ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, aur aksar woh kehte, al-Abbas se, ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah."
"471","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Muhammad ibn Abi Harmalah ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Kurayb ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas se, al-Fadl ibn Abbas se — aur woh Muzdalifah se Jamarah ko kankariyan marne tak Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke peeche sawar thay — unhon ne farmaya: Main Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Jamarah ko kankariyan marne tak musalsal talbiyah kehte hue sunta raha."
"472","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ubaydullah ibn Abi Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Main un ke ahl-e-khana ke kamzor logon me se tha jinhen Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Muzdalifah se Mina ki taraf aage bhej diya tha."
"473","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ata ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi ki manind."
"474","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Mis'ar, Sufyan al-Thawri aur dusron ne hum se bayan kiya, Salamah ibn Kuhayl se, al-Hasan al-Urani se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Banu Abd al-Muttalib ke chhote ladkon ko Muzdalifah se Mina ki taraf aage bhej diya, aur woh hamari ranon par thapki dete rahe, farmate hue: Mere chhote beton, suraj tulu hone tak Jamarat al-Aqabah ko kankariyan na marna."
"475","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Sa'id ibn Jubayr ko farmate hue suna: Maine Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Hum Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath ek safar me thay jab ek shakhs apne oont se gir gaya, us ki gardan toot gayi, aur woh ihram ki halat me faut ho gaya. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Use pani aur beri ke patton se ghusl do, use us ke dono kapdon me kafan do, aur us ka sar na dhanko, kyunke woh Qayamat ke din talbiyah kehte hue uthaya jayega — ya unhon ne farmaya: labbayk kehte hue."
"476","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ibrahim Abu Hurrah al-Nasibi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se, isi ki manind. Aur unhon ne is me izafa kiya: Aur us ke qareeb khushbu na lao."
"477","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu Ma'bad ne mujhe khabar di, aur woh Ibn Abbas ke sab se sacche aazad kardah ghulamon me se thay, farmaya: Maine Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko khutbah dete hue suna, farmate hue: Koi mard kisi aurat ke sath tanhai me na rahe, aur kisi aurat ke liye mahram ke baghair safar karna halal nahin. Ek shakhs un ke samne khada hua aur arz kiya: Ya Rasul Allah, mujhe falan falan ghazwah me bharti kiya gaya hai, jabke meri biwi Hajj ke liye rawana ho chuki hai. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jao aur apni biwi ke sath Hajj karo. Sufyan ne farmaya: Kufi log hamesha Amr ke pas is hadith ke bare me puchne aate thay, kehte hue: Falan falan ghazwah me bharti kiya gaya wali hadith kis tarah hai."
"478","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu al-Sha'tha, Jabir ibn Zayd ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs na'lain na paye to khuffain pehen le, aur jo izar na paye to shalwar pehen le — ya'ni ihram ki halat me."
"479","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Jabir ibn Zayd ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Maine Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Madinah me aath ikatthi aur saat ikatthi namazen padhin. Maine un se kaha: Aye Abu al-Sha'tha, mera khayal hai ke unhon ne Zuhr ko muakkhar kiya aur Asr ko jaldi padha, aur Maghrib ko muakkhar kiya aur Isha ko jaldi padha. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur mera bhi yahi khayal hai."
"480","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu al-Zubayr ne humen khabar di, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath Madinah me, baghair safar aur khauf ke, aath ikatthi aur saat ikatthi namazen padhin. Maine kaha: Unhon ne aisa kyun kiya. Unhon ne farmaya: Maine kaha: Woh apni ummat par mushakkat na dalna chahte thay."
"481","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Kurayb ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Main apni khala Maimunah ke paas ek raat thehra, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam raat ko uthe aur latke hue mashkize se halka wuzu kiya — aur unhon ne use bayan kiya, use kam qarar dete hue — to main utha aur maine bhi waisa hi kiya jaisa unhon ne kiya, phir main aaya aur un ke baen taraf khara ho gaya, unhon ne mujhe apne peeche se hataya aur mujhe apne daen taraf kar diya, unhon ne namaz parhi, phir let gaye aur so gaye hatta ke kharrate lene lage, phir Bilal un ke paas aaye aur unhen namaz ki ittila di, to woh bahar tashreef le gaye aur baghair wuzu kiye namaz parhi."
"482","Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur Ibn Juraij ne mujh se use bayan kiya, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, usi ki manind yahan tak ke un ka qaul: Unhon ne mujhe apne peeche se hataya aur mujhe apne daen taraf kar diya, phir unhon ne namaz parhi, Amr ibn Dinar, jo majlis mein the, un se bole: Lao, izafa karo, ae Abu Muhammad, Ata ne kaha: Kaisa izafa, maine isi tarah suna hai, Amr ne kaha: Balke Kurayb ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Phir woh let gaye aur so gaye hatta ke kharrate lene lage, phir Bilal un ke paas aaye aur unhen namaz ki ittila di, to unhon ne baghair wuzu kiye namaz parhi, Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne farmaya: Ye Nabi ke sath khaas hai, kyunke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam: un ki aankh soti hai lekin un ka dil nahin sota."
"483","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur Amr ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ubaid ibn Umair ko farmate hue suna: Ambiya ke khwab wahi hote hain, aur unhon ne tilawat ki: Main khwab mein dekhta hun ke main tumhen zibah kar raha hun."
"484","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, aur maine use un se yaad rakha, farmaya: Ubaidullah ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Main aur al-Fadl ek gadhI par aaye jabke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Arafah mein the, hum saf ke ek hisse ke paas se guzre, utre, use charne ke liye chhor diya, aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath namaz mein dakhil ho gaye, aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne hum se kuch nahin farmaya."
"485","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Ata ibn Abi Rabah ko farmate hue suna: Maine Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam par gawahi deta hun ke unhon ne Eid ke din khutbe se pehle namaz parhi, phir unhon ne khutba diya, dekha ke unhon ne aurton ko nahin sunaya, to woh un ke paas aaye, unhen naseehat ki, unhen yaad-dihani karai, aur unhen sadqa dene ka hukm diya, jabke Bilal un ke sath apna kapra is tarah phailaye hue the — Abu Bakr ne kaha: goya apne kapre se lete hue — aur aurat apni anguthi, apni bali aur aisi cheezen dalne lagi."
"486","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Ikrimah ko farmate hue suna: Maine Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Sad mein sajda karte hue dekha, halanke ye farz sajdon mein se nahin hai."
"487","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Said ibn al-Huwayrith ko farmate hue suna: Maine Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath the jab woh qaza-e-hajat se bahar tashreef laye aur un ke paas khana laya gaya, un se kaha gaya: Kya aap wuzu nahin farmaenge, unhon ne farmaya: Kya mujhe namaz parhni hai, ke main wuzu karun."
"488","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, ke Umar qaza-e-hajat ke liye gaye, phir bahar aaye aur un ke paas khana laya gaya, un se kaha gaya: Kya aap wuzu nahin farmaenge, unhon ne farmaya: Main to apne baen se istinja karta hun, aur main to apne daen se khata hun."
"489","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu Mabad ne mujhe khabar di, farmaya: Maine Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki namaz ke ikhtitam ko takbeer ke siwa kisi cheez se nahin pehchante the, Amr ne farmaya: Maine baad mein use Abu Mabad se zikr kiya, to unhon ne inkar kiya, farmaya: Maine ye tumhen bayan nahin kiya, maine kaha: Beshak aap ne ye mujhe is se pehle bayan kiya tha, Sufyan ne farmaya: Goya woh apne bare mein dare hue the."
"490","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Asim al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Shabi se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko dekha ke unhon ne Zamzam se ek dol ka hukm diya, un ke liye pani nikala gaya, aur unhon ne khare ho kar piya."
"491","Al-Humaydi ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Ali ibn Zayd ibn Jud'an ne humein Umar ibn Harmalah se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke sath apni phuphi Maymunah ke paas dakhil hua, aur hamare sath Khalid ibn al-Walid the, to Maymunah ne Aap se arz kiya: Kya hum Aap ki khidmat me, Ya Rasulullah, woh cheez pesh na karein jo Umm Uqayq ne humein tohfe me di hai, to woh Aap ke paas bhuni hui gohein le aayeen, to jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhein dekha to teen martaba thooka aur un me se kuch na khaya, aur humein khane ka hukm farmaya, phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke paas doodh ka bartan laya gaya to Aap ne nosh farmaya jabke main Aap ki dayein janib tha aur Khalid bayein janib the, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Ae ladke, mashroob tumhara haq hai lekin agar tum chaho to Khalid ko is me apne par tarjeeh de do, to maine arz kiya: Main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke jhoothe par kisi ko tarjeeh nahi doonga, phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jise Allah khana khilaye to use kehna chahiye: Ae Allah, is me hamare liye barkat ata farma aur humein is se behtar ata farma, aur jise Allah doodh pilaye to use kehna chahiye: Ae Allah, is me hamare liye barkat ata farma aur humein is me izafa ata farma, kyunke main khane aur peene ki jagah kifayat karne wali koi cheez nahi janta siwaye is ke."
"492","Al-Humaydi ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Sa'id ibn Jubayr ko farmate hue suna: Maine Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko mimbar par khutba dete hue suna, farmate hue: Tum Allah se is haal me miloge ke nange paon chalne wale, nange badan, ghair khatna shuda hoge."
"493","Al-Humaydi ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Ubaydullah ibn Abi Yazid ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko nahi jana ke Aap kisi din ka roza us ki fazilat talash karte hue rakhte hon doosre dinon par siwaye is din ke, ya'ni Ashura ke din, aur is mahine ke, ya'ni Ramazan ke mahine."
"494","Al-Humaydi ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne Ibn Abi Layla se, unhon ne Dawud ibn Ali se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar main zinda raha to main is se ek din pehle ya is ke ek din baad roza rakhne ka hukm doonga, ya'ni Ashura ke din."
"495","Al-Humaydi ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Zayd ibn Aslam ne humein bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Wa'lah al-Misri ko farmate hue suna: Maine Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo bhi khaal dabaghat di jaye woh paak ho gayi."
"496","Al-Humaydi ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: al-Shaybani ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Main al-Sha'bi ke sath masjid me dakhil hua, to unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum hamare sathiyon me se kisi ko dekhte ho jis ke paas baithein, kya tum Abu Husayn ko dekhte ho, to maine kaha: Nahi, phir unhon ne dekha to Yazid ibn al-Asamm ko dekha, to farmaya: Kya tum is ke paas baithoge, is ki phuphi Maymunah hain, to hum is ke paas baith gaye, to Yazid ibn al-Asamm ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ke samne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke goh ke baare me farman ka zikr hua: Main ise nahi khata aur na ise haram qarar deta hun, to woh ghazabnak hue aur farmaya: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam sirf halal qarar dene ya haram qarar dene ke liye bheje gaye the, aur Aap ki maujoodgi me ise khaya gaya."
"497","Al-Humaydi ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne humein bayan kiya, farmaya: Ammar al-Duhni aur Yahya ibn Abdullah al-Jabir ne humein bayan kiya ke unhon ne Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko farmate hue suna: Ek shakhs Ibn Abbas ke paas aaya aur un se ek aise shakhs ke baare me poocha jis ne ek momin ko jaan boojh kar qatl kiya, phir tauba ki, iman laya, nek a'maal kiye, phir hidayat pa gaya, to Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Aur is ke liye hidayat kahan hai, maine tumhare Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Qayamat ke din maqtool qatil ko pakde"
"498","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hum se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Sulayman ibn Suhaym jo Ibn Abbas ke aazad karda hain, unhon ne hum se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Ibrahim ibn Abdullah ibn Ma'bad ibn Abbas ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne parda uthaya jabke log Abu Bakr ke peeche safein bandhe hue thay, aur farmaya: Nabuwwat ki khushkhabriyon mein se nek khwab ke siwa kuch baaqi nahin raha, jise Musalman dekhe ya jo us ke liye dekha jaye, beshak mujhe ruku ya sajde mein qira'at karne se mana kiya gaya hai, raha ruku to is mein Rabb ki ta'zeem karo, aur raha sajda to is mein dua mein koshish karo, kyunke yeh laaiq hai ke tumhare liye is mein qubool kiya jaye, Sufyan ne kaha: Ziyad ibn Sa'd ne mujhe is ki khabar di thi is se pehle ke main ne ise suna, aur main ne un se kaha: Kya main tumhara salam Sulayman tak pahuncha dun, unhon ne kaha: Haan, phir jab main Madinah aaya to main ne un ka salam un tak pahunchaya aur un se is ke baare mein poocha."
"499","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hum se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Ata ibn Abi Rabah ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khaye to apne haathon ko us waqt tak na ponchhe jab tak woh inhen chaat na le ya chatwa na le, Sufyan ne kaha: Amr ibn Qays ne un se kaha: Aey Abu Muhammad, Ata ne hum se yeh sirf Jabir se riwayat ki hai, Amr ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main ne ise Ata se Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte hue suna tha is se pehle ke Jabir Makkah mein humare paas aaye, Sufyan ne kaha: Amr aur Ata Jabir se mile, agar Allah chahe, ek aise saal mein jis mein woh mujawir thehre hue thay."
"500","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hum se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Amr ne hum se bayan farmaya, Ata ne hum se bayan farmaya, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ka guzar Maymunah ki aazad karda laundi ki ek bakri ke paas se hua, jo use sadqe mein se di gayi thi, murda haalat mein, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Is ke ghar walon par kya harj hai agar woh is ki khaal le lein, ise dabaghat dein aur is se faida uthayein, unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah ke Rasool, yeh to murda hai, Aap ne farmaya: Sirf is ka khana haram kiya gaya hai, aur Sufyan kabhi is mein Maymunah ka zikr karte thay aur kabhi un ka zikr nahin karte thay, to hum ise is tarah aur is tarah zikr karte hain."
"501","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se. Aur Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha — Amr ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek raat Isha me takheer farmayi. Umar bahir nikle aur arz kiya: Namaz, Ya Rasul Allah; aurten aur bache so gaye hain. Amr ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam bahir tashreef laye jabke Aap ke sar se pani tapak raha tha, farmate hue: Yahi is ka waqt hai, agar mujhe momineen par mashaqqat ka khadsha na hota to me is ko isi ghari ke siwa ada na karta. Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek raat Isha me takheer farmayi, phir bahir tashreef laye jabke Aap ke sar se pani tapak raha tha, farmate hue: Yahi is ka waqt hai, agar mujhe momineen par mashaqqat ka khadsha na hota to me is ko isi ghari ke siwa ada na karta. Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam bahir tashreef laye apne pehlu se pani ponchte hue, farmate hue: Yahi is ka waqt hai, agar mujhe apni ummat par mashaqqat ka khadsha na hota. Aur Sufyan kabhi is hadith ko Ibn Abbas se, Amr aur Ibn Jurayj se mila kar bayan karte the, is me riwayat ka zikr kiye baghair; lekin jab us me woh kehte: hum se bayan kiya aur me ne suna, ya me ne suna, ya hamen khabar di, to is ko is par aur is ko is par bayan karte the."
"502","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Me ne Tawus ko Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue suna, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko saat haddiyon par sajda karne ka hukm diya gaya, aur Aap ko apne baal ya apne kapre sametne se mana kiya gaya."
"503","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ibn Tawus ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko saat haddiyon par sajda karne ka hukm diya gaya: Apne hathon par, apne ghutnon par, apne paon ki ungliyon ke siron par, aur apni peshani par; aur Aap ko, agar Allah chahe, baal aur kapre sametne se mana kiya gaya. Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur Ibn Tawus ne hamen dikhaya, apna hath apni peshani par rakh kar phir us ko pherte hue yahan tak ke naak ke sire tak pahunche; aur mere walid is ko ek shumar karte the."
"504","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu Umayyah Abd al-Karim ibn Abi al-Mukhariq ne hum se bayan kiya, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se: ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko saat haddiyon par sajda karne ka hukm diya gaya, aur Aap ko hukm diya gaya ke na baal sameten aur na libas."
"505","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sulayman al-Ahwal, jo Ibn Abi Najih ke mamun hain, ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Me ne Tawus ko kehte hue suna: Me ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Jab Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam raat ko tahajjud ki namaz ke liye khare hote to farmate: Ae Allah, Tere hi liye hamd hai; Tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo kuch un me hai un ka Noor hai; Tere hi liye hamd hai, Tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo kuch un me hai un ka Qayyam rakhne wala hai; Tere hi liye hamd hai, Tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo kuch un me hai un ka Badshah hai; Tere hi liye hamd hai, Tu Haq hai, Tera wada haq hai, Teri mulaqat haq hai, Jannat haq hai, Jahannam haq hai, Qayamat haq hai, Muhammad haq hain, aur ambiya haq hain. Ae Allah, me ne Tere hi aage sar jhukaya, Tujh par iman laya, Tujh par tawakkul kiya, Teri taraf ruju kiya, Tere hi zariye jhagda kiya, Tere hi huzur faisla pesh kiya. Pas mere agle pichle, poshida aur zahir gunah bakhsh de. Tu hi aage karne wala hai aur Tu hi piche karne wala hai; Tere siwa koi mabud nahi — ya unhon ne kaha: Tere siwa koi mabud nahi. Sufyan ne shak kiya. Aur Abd al-Karim ne is me izafa kiya: Aur gunah se bachne ki taqat aur neiki ki quwwat nahi magar Tere zariye — jo Sulayman ne nahi kaha."
"506","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman, jo Khandan-e-Talhah ke azad karda hain, ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Kurayb Abu Rashdin ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Me ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Juwayriyah ke ghar se Fajr ki namaz ke baad bahir tashreef laye — un ka naam Barrah tha, to Aap ne un ka naam Juwayriyah rakha, is ko napasand karte hue ke kaha jaye: Woh Barrah ke paas se nikle. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Aap Fajr ki namaz ke baad un ke paas se nikle, phir din charhne ke baad un ke paas wapas tashreef laye jabke woh apni namaz ki jagah par baithi thin, aur un se farmaya: Kya tum isi nashist me rahin? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Me ne tumhare baad teen martaba chaar kalime kahe; agar un ka wazan tumhare kahe hue sab kalamon se kiya jaye to woh un par bhari hon: Subhan Allahi wa bi Hamdihi, Us ki makhluq ki ginti ke barabar, Us ki Zaat ki khushi ke barabar, Us ke Arsh ke wazan ke barabar, aur Us ke kalimon ki siyahi ke barabar."
"507","Hajj ke bare me: Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Me ne Ata ko Ibn Abbas se bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Baitullah ke gird aur al-Safa aur al-Marwah ke darmiyan sirf is liye ramal farmaya taake mushrikeen par apni quwwat zahir karen."
"508","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Muhassab kuch nahi; woh sirf ek manzil hai jahan Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne qiyam farmaya."
"509","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se ye hadith bayan ki, aur Hisham ibn Urwah ne al-Muhassab ke bare me bayan kiya, aur Salih ibn Kaysan ne bayan kiya; in hadithon ko hum se inhon ne bayan kiya, aur un me is jaisi koi baat nahi."
"510","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se ye hadith do martaba bayan ki: ek martaba us me unhon ne kaha: Me ne Ata ko kehte hue suna: Me ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne singhi lagwayi jabke Aap ihram me the."
"511","Aur ek dafa main ne unhein kehte hue suna: main ne Taus ko Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte hue suna, woh keh rahe thay: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne halat-e-ehram mein seengi lagwai; aur main nahi janta ke Amr ne yeh un dono se suna tha ya do martaba mein se ek ghalti thi."
"512","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne halat-e-ehram mein seengi lagwai."
"513","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sulayman al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: main ne Taus ko Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Log har taraf rawana ho jate thay, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs na jaye yahan tak ke us ka aakhri ahad Baitullah se ho; Sufyan ne kaha: main ne is hadith mein is se behtar kuch nahi suna jo Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya."
"514","Sufyan ne kaha: aur Ibn Taus ne humein khabar di, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Logon ko hukm diya gaya tha ke un ka aakhri ahad Baitullah se ho, siwaye is ke ke haiza aurat ke liye takhfeef kar di gayi."
"515","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Abu al-Sha'tha ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne halat-e-ehram mein nikah farmaya; Abu al-Sha'tha ne kaha: Ae Amr, tumhara kya khayal hai? main ne kaha: Log kehte hain ke woh Maymunah hain; Abu al-Sha'tha ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne mujhe khabar di ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne halat-e-ehram mein nikah farmaya."
"516","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Ibrahim ibn Uqbah jo Musa ibn Uqbah ke bhai hain, ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha: main ne Kurayb ko bayan karte hue suna ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam wapsi par rawana hue, jab aap al-Rawha par thay to ek qafile se mile, unhein salam kiya to unhon ne aap ke salam ka jawab diya, aap ne farmaya: Log kaun hain? unhon ne kaha: Musalman; aur log kaun hain? Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: main Allah ka Rasul hun; ek aurat jaldi se aap ki taraf aayi, apne ek bachche ko kajave se utha kar aap ki taraf buland karte hue kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, kya is ke liye Hajj hai? Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Haan, aur tumhare liye ajr hai; Sufyan ne kaha: aur Ibn al-Munkadir ne pehle humein yeh mursal bayan kiya tha, mujh se kaha gaya: unhon ne yeh sirf Ibrahim se suna hai, to main Ibrahim ke paas gaya aur un se is ke bare mein pucha, to unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha: main ne yeh Ibn al-Munkadir se bayan kiya tha, aur unhon ne apne tamam ghar walon ke sath Hajj kiya."
"517","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Muhammad ibn Suqah ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Ibn al-Munkadir se kaha gaya: Kya aap Hajj karte hain jabke aap par qarz hai? unhon ne kaha: Hajj qarz ko behtar taur par ada karne wala hai."
"518","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: al-Munkadir ibn Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne mujhe apne walid se khabar di ke un se kaha gaya: Kya aap bachon ke sath Hajj karte hain? unhon ne kaha: Haan, main unhein Allah ki bargah mein pesh karta hun."
"519","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: main ne Sulayman ibn Yasar ko kehte hue suna: main ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Khath'am ki ek aurat ne Yawm al-Nahr ki subah Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se pucha jabke al-Fadl aap ke peeche sawar thay: Allah ka apne bandon par Hajj ka farz mere walid par is haal mein aa gaya hai ke woh bahut buddhe hain, sawari par khud ko sambhal nahi sakte, kya aap dekhte hain ke hum un ki taraf se Hajj kar sakte hain? aap ne farmaya: Haan; Sufyan ne kaha: aur Amr ibn Dinar ne pehle humein al-Zuhri se, Sulayman ibn Yasar se, Ibn Abbas se is mein izafa kar ke bayan kiya tha: main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, kya yeh unhein nafa dega? aap ne farmaya: Haan, jis tarah agar tum mein se kisi par qarz ho aur woh use ada kar de; jab al-Zuhri hamare paas aaye to main ne is ki tehqeeq ki aur unhon ne yeh nahi kaha tha."
"520","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Taus ne mujhe khabar di, kaha: main ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Raha woh jis se Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mana farmaya to woh ghalla hai: ke use farokht kiya jaye yahan tak ke us par qabza kar liya jaye; aur Sufyan kabhi kehte: yahan tak ke use naap liya jaye; Ibn Abbas ne apni raye se kaha: aur main har cheez ko isi ki manind hi samajhta hun."
"521","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Main ne Tawus se kaha: Ai Abu Abd al-Rahman, kash aap batai par zameen dena chhor den, kyunke log kehte hain ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne is se mana farmaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ai Amr, un mein is bare mein sab se zyada janne wale ne — yani Ibn Abbas ne — mujhe khabar di ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne is se mana nahin farmaya, lekin farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ka apne bhai ko apni zameen de dena us ke liye is se behtar hai ke woh us par muqarrar lagan le. Aur Muadh jab Yemen aaye to unhon ne unhen isi par qayam rakha; aur main — yani Amr — un ki madad karta hun aur unhen deta hun: agar woh nafa kamayen to mere liye bhi hai aur un ke liye bhi, aur agar nuqsan uthayen to mujh par bhi hai aur un par bhi. Aur al-Haqalah Ansar mein hai, pas us ke bare mein puchho. Pas main ne Ali ibn Rifaa se pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Yeh batai par zameen dena hai."
"522","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Kathir al-Dari se, Abu al-Minhal se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Madinah tashreef laye jabke log khajuron mein do aur teen saal ke liye peshgi qeemat de rahe the. Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo peshgi de woh maloom khajuron, maloom wazan, maloom paimane mein, maloom muddat tak peshgi de."
"523","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne Ibn Abi Husayn aur Fitr se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu al-Tufayl ko kehte suna: Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Aap ke log kehte hain ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Baitullah ka aur al-Safa aur al-Marwah ke darmiyan tez chakkar lagaya aur ke yeh sunnat hai. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Unhon ne sach bhi kaha aur jhoot bhi. Fitr ka matlab tha: unhon ne sach kaha — Aap ne tez chakkar lagaya tha — aur unhon ne jhoot kaha — yeh sunnat nahin hai."
"524","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Main Arafah mein Ibn Abbas ke paas aaya aur unhen anar khate paya. Unhon ne kaha: Qareeb aao aur khao; shayad tum roze se ho. Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne is din roza nahin rakha tha."
"525","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Aale Abbas ke azad karda ghulam Muhammad ibn Hunayn ne mujhe khabar di, kaha: Main ne Abdullah ibn Abbas ko mahine se pehle roza rakhne wale par taajjub karte suna, kehte hue: Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum use dekho to roza rakho; aur jab use dekho to iftar karo; aur agar tum par badal chha jaye to ginti tees poori karo."
"526","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Main ne Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ko Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte suna ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Fatah wale saal Ramazan ke mahine mein Madinah se nikle, roze se the yahan tak ke jab al-Kadid pahunche to iftar kar liya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke amal mein se sirf baad wale par amal kiya jata hai. Sufyan ne kaha: Main nahin janta ke al-Zuhri ne yeh Ubaydullah se kaha ya Ibn Abbas se."
"527","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Abdullah ibn Said ibn Jubayr ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas se ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam Madinah tashreef laye jabke Yahud Ashura ke din ka roza rakh rahe the. Unhon ne farmaya: Yeh kya din hai jis ka tum roza rakhte ho. Unhon ne kaha: Yeh bahut bada din hai; Allah ne is mein Musa ko nijat di aur is mein Firaun ke gharane ko gharq kiya, to Musa ne shukr mein is ka roza rakha. Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hum tum se zyada Musa ke haqdar hain. Pas Aap ne is ka roza rakha aur us ke roze ka hukm diya."
"528","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Mansur ibn al-Mutamir ne hum se bayan kiya, Salim ibn Abi al-Jad se, Kurayb se, Ibn Abbas se ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni biwi ke paas aaye to kahe: Allah ke naam se; Ai Allah, shaitan ko hum se door rakh aur shaitan ko us se bhi door rakh jo Tu hamen ata farmaye — phir agar un ke darmiyan bachcha muqaddar ho jaye to shaitan use kabhi nuqsan nahin pahunchayega."
"529","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Ziyad ibn Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn al-Fadl se, Nafi ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas se: ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Shohar deeda aurat apne nafs ki apne wali se zyada haqdar hai, aur kunwari se us ke bare mein ijazat li jayegi; us ki khamoshi us ki ijazat hai."
"530","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Asim ibn Kulayb ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas se ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne ek shakhs ko hukm diya, jab woh lanat karne wale donon ke darmiyan lian karaye to panchwin martaba us ke munh par apna hath rakhe. Aur Sufyan kabhi us mein kehte: Kyunke yeh faisla kun hai."
"531","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne al-Qasim ibn Muhammad ko farmate hue suna: Ibn Abbas ne do laan karne walon ka zikr kiya, aur Abdullah ibn Shaddad ne un se kaha: Kya ye wahi aurat hai jis ke bare me Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar main baghair daleel ke kisi ko sangsar karne wala hota to is aurat ko sangsar karta? Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Nahi; wo to wo aurat hai jo alaniya karti thi."
"532","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Abdullah ibn Uthman ibn Khuthaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhare kapron me se behtareen safed hain; tumhare zinda unhen pehnen, aur apne murdon ko unhi me kafan do. Aur tumhare surmon me se behtareen ithmid hai, kyunke ye nazar ko saaf karta hai aur baal ugata hai."
"533","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Agar log wasiyyaton me chauthai tak kami kar den to ye mujhe zyada mehboob hai, Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke is farman ki wajah se: Teesra hissa — aur teesra hissa zyada hai."
"534","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, ke Saad ibn Ubadah ne Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se apni walida par aaid nazr ke bare me fatwa manga, jo use pura karne se pehle faut ho gain thin. Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un se farmaya: Tum us ki taraf se use pura kardo."
"535","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Awsajah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke ek shakhs Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke zamanay me faut hua aur us ne apne aazad karda ghulam ke siwa koi waris na chhora, aur Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne us ko us ki virasat de di."
"536","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne wafat pai nau ko chhorte hue, aur wo aath ko bari dete the."
"537","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Main ne Abd al-Karim al-Jazari ko farmate hue suna: Main ne Ikrimah ko farmate hue suna: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko bayan karte hue suna ke Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne bartan me phoonkne ya us me saans lene se mana farmaya."
"538","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sulayman ibn Abi Muslim al-Ahwal — aur wo siqa the — ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Main ne Saeed ibn Jubayr ko farmate hue suna: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko farmate hue suna: Jumeraat — aur Jumeraat kya hai? Phir wo roye yahan tak ke un ke aansuon ne kankariyon ko bhigo diya. Un se kaha gaya: Ae Abu Abbas, Jumeraat kya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Jumeraat ko Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ka dard shadeed ho gaya, aur unhon ne farmaya: Mere liye lao; main tumhare liye ek tehreer likh doon ga jis ke baad tum kabhi gumrah na hoge. Unhon ne ikhtilaf kiya, aur nabi ki maujudgi me ikhtilaf karna munasib nahi. Unhon ne farmaya: Inhen kya hua? Kya wo hizyan keh rahe hain? Un se wazahat talab karo. Unhon ne use un ke samne dohraya, to unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe chhor do; jis me main hoon wo us se behtar hai jis ki taraf tum mujhe bulate ho. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur unhon ne unhen teen baton ki wasiyat farmai, farmaya: Mushrikon ko Jazeerat al-Arab se nikaal do; wafdon ka aise hi ikram karo jaisa main un ka ikram karta tha. Sufyan ne farmaya: Sulayman ne kaha: Main nahi janta ke Saeed ne teesri ka zikr kiya aur main bhool gaya, ya wo us par khamosh rahe."
"539","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Musa ibn Abi Aishah — aur wo siqaton me se the — ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas se, ke jab Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam par Quran nazil hota to wo use yaad karne ke iraday se us ke sath apni zaban ko harkat dete. To Allah ne nazil farmaya: Is me jaldi karne ke liye is ke sath apni zaban ko harkat na do. Beshak is ka jama karna aur is ka parhana Hamare zimme hai."
"540","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, farmaya: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed ibn Jubayr se — aur unhon ne us me Ibn Abbas ka zikr nahi kiya — unhon ne farmaya: Jab Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam par Quran nazil hota to wo use yaad karne ke iraday se us ke sath jaldi karte. To Allah ne nazil farmaya: Is me jaldi karne ke liye is ke sath apni zaban ko harkat na do. Beshak is ka jama karna aur is ka parhana Hamare zimme hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur Rasul Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam kisi surat ke khatmay ko na jante the yahan tak ke un par nazil hota: Allah ke naam se, Nihayat Reham karne wala, Nihayat Meherban."
"541","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ibn as-Sa'ib ne hum se bayan kiya — aur main ne unhen ek manzar ka zikr karte suna jo unhon ne dekha tha, phir woh saans lete aur rote, us mein falan aur falan aur falan aur falan aur Miqsam. Sa'id ibn Jubayr ne kaha: Kya tum sab ne suna jo khane ke bare mein kaha jata hai? Miqsam ne kaha: Logon se bayan karo, ai Abu Abdullah. Sa'id ibn Jubayr ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Barkat khane ke darmiyan mein utarti hai, pas us ke kinaron se khao aur us ke darmiyan se na khao."
"542","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ikrimah ko kehte suna: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Hamare liye buri misaal nahi: apna atiya wapas lene wala us kutte ki tarah hai jo apni qai ki taraf lautta hai."
"543","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo tasveer banayega use azab diya jayega aur us par bojh dala jayega ke us mein rooh phoonke, halanke woh nahi phoonk sakta; aur jo jhoota khwab ghadega use azab diya jayega aur us par bojh dala jayega ke jau ke do danon ke darmiyan gaanth lagaye, halanke woh gaanth nahi laga sakta; aur jo kisi qaum ki guftagu sune jo us se nafrat karti ho to Qayamat ke Din us ke kaan mein pighla hua sisa undela jayega. Sufyan ne kaha: Al-anuk sisa hai."
"544","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il ibn Umayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi se, Yazid ibn Hurmuz se, unhon ne kaha: Najdah ne Ibn Abbas ko khat likha un se aurat aur ghulam ke bare mein puchte hue jo fatah mein hazir hon — kya un ke liye hissa muqarrar kiya jata hai; bachchon ke qatl ke bare mein; yateem ke bare mein — us se yateemi ka naam kab khatm hota hai; aur qareebi rishtedaron ke bare mein — woh kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Likho, ai Yazid; agar ye na hota ke woh himaqat mein padega to main use na likhta. Likho: Tum ne mujhe qareebi rishtedaron ke bare mein likha — woh kaun hain; aur hum dawa karte the ke hum hi woh hain, lekin hamari qaum ne ise hum se inkar kiya. Tum ne mujhe aurat aur ghulam ke bare mein likh kar pucha jo fatah mein hazir hon — kya unhen kuch diya jata hai; aur un ke liye kuch muqarrar nahi kiya jata, lekin unhen kuch diya jata hai. Tum ne mujhe yateem ke bare mein likh kar pucha — us se yateemi ka naam kab khatm hota hai; aur us se yateemi ka naam khatm nahi hota jab tak woh bulughat ko na pahunche aur us mein rushd mehsoos na kiya jaye. Tum ne mujhe bachchon ke qatl ke bare mein likh kar pucha; aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhen qatl nahi kiya, aur tum unhen qatl na karoge magar jab tak tum un ke bare mein woh na jano jo Musa ke sathi ne us ladke ke bare mein jana jise us ne qatl kiya."
"545","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Ibn Abbas ko pahunchi ke Ali ne murtaddon ko jalaya — yani zindiqon ko — to Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Agar main wahan hota to unhen qatl karta, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke farman ki wajah se: Jo apna din badal de, use qatl karo. Aur main unhen na jalata, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke farman ki wajah se: Allah ke azab se azab dena kisi ko zaib nahi deta. Sufyan ne kaha: Ammar al-Duhni, majlis mein hote hue — Amr ibn Dinar ki majlis mein — jabke Ayyub ye hadith bayan kar raha tha, ne kaha: Ali ne unhen nahi jalaya; balke us ne un ke liye surangen khodin aur unhen un se dhuwan diya yahan tak ke us ne unhen qatl kiya. Amr ibn Dinar ne kaha: Kya tum ne un ke shair ko nahi suna jabke woh kehta hai:"
"546","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Juwayriyah al-Jarmi ko kehte suna: Main ne Ibn Abbas se al-badhaq ke bare mein pucha, jabke woh Ka'bah se apni peeth lagaye hue the — aur Allah ki qasam, main Arabon mein sab se pehla tha jis ne un se pucha — to unhon ne kaha: Muhammad al-badhaq se pehle guzre; aur jo nasha laaye woh haram hai."
"547","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Yahya ibn Abi Ya'qub ne mujh se bayan kiya — aur woh meri umr ka tha ya mujh se chhota tha — al-Hakam ibn Aban se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Jibril se pucha: Musa ne do muddaton mein se kaunsi puri ki? Unhon ne kaha: Un dono mein se zyada puri aur zyada mukammal."
"548","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah se — phir Sufyan ke akhri zamane mein us ne us mein Ibn Abbas ko sabit kiya — unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke pas, Uhud se wapsi par, ek shakhs aya jis ne kaha: Ai Rasulullah, main ne ek badal dekha jo ghee aur shehed tapka raha tha, aur main ne logon ko us se lapte hue dekha — koi us se zyada le raha tha aur koi kam; aur main ne ek rassi dekhi jo asman tak pahunchi: aap ne use pakda, aur Allah ne aap ko buland kiya; phir aap ke baad ek shakhs ne use pakda aur buland hua; phir us ke baad ek aur ne aur buland hua; phir us ke baad ek aur ne, aur woh us ke sath kat gayi; phir woh us ke liye jod di gayi aur woh buland hua. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ai Rasulullah, mujhe is ki ta'beer karne den. Unhon ne kaha: Ta'beer karo. Unhon ne kaha: Raha badal, to woh Islam hai; aur raha us ka ghee aur shehed tapkana, jabke log us se lap rahe hain, to woh Quran hai — us ki mithas aur us ki narmi — koi us se zyada le raha hai aur koi kam; aur rahi asman tak pahunchi hui rassi, to woh hai jis par aap haq mein hain: aap ne use pakda aur Allah ne aap ko buland kiya; phir aap ke baad ek shakhs use pakdega aur us se buland hoga; phir us ke baad ek aur aur buland hoga; phir us ke baad ek aur, aur woh us ke sath kategi; phir woh us ke liye jod di jayegi aur woh buland hoga. Ai Rasulullah, kya main ne durust paya? Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne hissa durust paya aur hissa ghalat kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Main aap ko qasam deta hun, ai Rasulullah. Unhon ne kaha: Qasam na do, ai Abu Bakr."
"549","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Khalid al-Makhzumi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Ja'far ko kehte suna: Jab Ja'far ibn Abi Talib ki wafat ki khabar ayi to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ja'far ke ghar walon ke liye khana tayyar karo, pas un par woh aa pada hai jo unhen mashghul rakhega."
"550","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Ja'far ko kehte suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam mere pas se guzre, mere aur Banu Abd al-Muttalib ke ek ladke ke pas se, aur hamen ek janwar par sawar kiya, pas hum teen the."
"551","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mis'ar ibn Kidam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Fahm ke ek aadmi ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hum Muzdalifah mein Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr ke saath thay jab unhon ne hamare liye ek oont zibah kiya. Abdullah ibn Ja'far ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat mein gosht pesh kiya jata tha. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Behtareen gosht peeth ka gosht hai."
"552","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere walid ne khabar di ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Ja'far ko kehte hue suna: Maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko tar khajooron ke saath kakdi khate hue dekha."
"553","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ali ibn Husayn ne khabar di, Amr ibn Uthman ibn Affan se, Usamah ibn Zayd se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Musalman kafir se wirasat nahi pata aur kafir Musalman se wirasat nahi pata."
"554","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne khabar di ke unhon ne Usamah ibn Zayd ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne Madinah ke qilon mein se ek qile par se jhanka aur farmaya: Kya tum dekhte ho jo main dekhta hun? Main fitnon ko tumhare gharon ke darmiyan barish ke girne ki tarah girte hue dekh raha hun."
"555","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se beshumar martaba shumar se bahar bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere walid ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Usamah ibn Zayd se poocha gaya — aur main un ke paas tha, aur woh Arafah se Muzdalifah pahunchne tak Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke peeche sawar thay — ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam jab rawana hue to kaise chale? Unhon ne kaha: Woh narm raftaar se chale; jab khula maidan paate to tez chalte. Sufyan ne kaha: Hisham ne kaha: Aur al-nass al-anaq se upar hai."
"556","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Amir ibn Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas ko kehte hue suna: Ek aadmi Sa'd ke paas taa'oon ke baare mein poochne aaya, jabke Usama ibn Zayd un ke saath thay, to Usama ne kaha: Maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Yeh ek azaab ya waba hai jo tum se pehle ke kuch logon par ya Bani Israil ke ek giroh par bheji gayi; yeh kabhi aati hai aur kabhi chali jati hai; pas jab yeh kisi zameen mein phoot pade aur tum us mein ho to us se bhaag kar us se mat niklo, aur jab tum us ke baare mein kisi zameen mein suno to us mein dakhil mat ho. To Amr ne kaha: Shayad yeh kuch logon ke liye azaab ya waba hai aur kuch logon ke liye shahadat hai. Sufyan ne kaha: Amr ka yeh qaul mujhe pasand aaya."
"557","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ubaydullah ibn Abi Yazid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Mujhe Usama ibn Zayd ne khabar di ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Sood udhaar mein hai. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Sufyan kabhi is ko marfoo'an bayan na karte thay, aur is baare mein un se poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Main kabhi sarrafi ke jhagdon ki na-pasandeedgi ki wajah se is se ruk jata hun; lekin marfoo' ke taur par to yeh marfoo' hi hai."
"558","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan aur Marwan ibn Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman al-Taymi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Uthman al-Nahdi se, Usama ibn Zayd se, ke Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Maine apne baad apni ummat ke liye mardon ke liye aurton se zyada nuqsan deh koi aazmaish nahi chhori."
"559","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Wa'il ko kehte hue suna: Usama ibn Zayd se kaha gaya: Kya aap Uthman se baat nahi karenge? Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum samajhte ho ke main un se sirf tumhein suna kar baat karta hun; main un se tanhayi mein baat karta hun baghair koi aisa darwaza khole ke main us ko kholne wala pehla shakhs hun. Phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak main kisi aise shakhs ke baare mein jo mujh par hukmaran banaya gaya tha yeh nahi kahunga ke woh logon mein behtareen hai, us cheez ke baad jo maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suni; maine Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs hukmaran tha us ko laya jayega aur Aag mein phenk diya jayega, aur us ki aantein bahar nikal aayengi, aur woh Aag mein aise chakkar lagayega jaise gadha chakki ke gird chakkar lagata hai; phir Aag wale us ke paas jama honge aur kahenge: Kya aap hamein neki ka hukum nahi dete thay aur burayi se mana nahi karte thay? Woh kahega: Main tumhein neki ka hukum deta tha aur khud us par amal nahi karta tha, aur tumhein burayi se rokta tha aur khud us ka irtikab karta tha."
"560","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Uqba aur Muhammad ibn Abi Harmala ne hum se bayan kiya — Sufyan ne kaha: un mein se ek ne kaha: Mujhe Kurayb ne khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, Usama se, aur doosre ne kaha: Mujhe Kurayb ne khabar di, Usama se — aur woh Arafat se Muzdalifa tak Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke hum-sawar thay — unhon ne kaha: Main Allah ke Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ke saath Arafat se rawana hua, aur jab woh ghaati par pahunche to utre aur peshab kiya, aur unhon ne yeh nahi kaha: unhon ne pani bahaya; phir main un ke paas chhoti mashk laya aur unhon ne halka wuzu kiya, to maine kaha: Namaz, Ae Allah ke Rasool. Unhon ne farmaya: Namaz tumhare aage hai. Phir jab woh Muzdalifa pahunche to unhon ne Maghrib padhi, phir unhon ne apne kajawon ki rassiyan kholin, phir unhon ne Isha padhi. Sufyan ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Uqba aur Muhammad ne is hadith ki kisi cheez mein ikhtilaf nahi kiya siwaaye is ke ke ek ne kaha: Kurayb, Usama se, aur doosre ne kaha: Kurayb, Ibn Abbas se, Usama se."
"561","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Salih ibn Kaysan ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Sulayman ibn Yasar ko Abu Rafi se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujhe wahan padhao dalne ka hukm nahi farmaya tha, yani Al-Abtah me, balke maine khud Aap ka khayma lagaya, phir Aap tashreef laye aur wahan qiyam farmaya; hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, aur Amr ibn Dinar is hadees ko Salih ibn Kaysan se riwayat kiya karte the, pas jab Salih hamare pas aaye to Amr ne hum se kaha: un ke pas jao aur un se is hadees ke bare me poocho."
"562","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Salim Abu al-Nadr jo Umar ibn Ubaydullah ibn Ma'mar ke aazad karda hain ne Ubaydullah ibn Abi Rafi se, unhon ne apne walid se bayan kiya; Sufyan ne kaha: aur hamein Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne munqata taur par bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Main tum me se kisi ko is haal me na paun ke wo apne palang par tek lagaye hue ho jabke us ke pas mere muamle ki koi baat pahunche, us me se jiska maine hukm diya ya jis se mana kiya, aur wo kahe: main nahi janta; hum ne Allah ki Kitab me jo kuch paya hum ne usi ki pairwi ki; Al-Humaydi ne kaha: Sufyan ne kaha: mujhe Ibn al-Munkadir ki hadees zyada yaad hai kyunke maine use pehle suna tha, halanke ye bhi mujhe yaad hai."
"563","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibrahim ibn Maysara ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Amr ibn al-Sharid ko kehte hue suna: Al-Miswar ibn Makhrama ne mera haath pakda aur kaha: chalo Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas ke pas chalen, pas main un ke sath nikla jabke un ka haath mere ek kandhe par tha, aur Abu Rafi un ke pas aaye aur Al-Miswar se kaha: kya tum is se, yani Sa'd se, nahi kahoge ke mere ghar ke mere do kamre khareed le, to Sa'd ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main chaar sau deenar se zyada nahi dunga, qiston me ya udhaar me, to Abu Rafi ne un se kaha: Allah ki qasam main ise paanch sau deenar naqd se kam me rokta tha, aur agar maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko ye farmate hue na suna hota: Padosi apni mili hui jaydad ka zyada haqdar hai, to main tumhe na bechta."
"564","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Urwa ibn al-Zubayr aur Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib ne khabar di ke unhon ne Hakim ibn Hizam ko kehte hue suna: maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se manga to Aap ne mujhe ata farmaya, phir maine Aap se manga to Aap ne mujhe ata farmaya, phir maine Aap se manga to Aap ne mujhe ata farmaya, phir Aap ne farmaya: ye maal taza aur meetha hai, pas jo ise sakhi dil ke sath le us ke liye is me barkat di jati hai, aur jo ise lalchi dil ke sath le us ke liye is me barkat nahi di jati, aur wo us khane wale ki tarah hai jo khata hai aur ser nahi hota; aur upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai; Sufyan ne kaha: maine is ke siwa kuch nahi suna."
"565","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Hisham ibn Urwa ne apne walid se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Hakim ibn Hizam ko kehte hue suna: maine kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, maine zamana-e-jahiliyat me chalees ghulam aazad kiye, to Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: tum ne apni pehle ki ki hui nekiyon ke sath Islam qabool kiya."
"566","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muhammad ibn Jubayr ibn Mut'im ne apne walid se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: mere kai naam hain: main Muhammad hun, aur main Ahmad hun, aur main Al-Mahi hun jin ke zariye kufr mitaya jata hai, aur main Al-Hashir hun jin ke qadmon par log jama kiye jayenge, aur main Al-Aqib hun, aur Al-Aqib wo hai jin ke baad koi nabi nahi."
"567","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Al-Zuhri ko Muhammad ibn Jubayr ibn Mut'im se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat karte hue suna ke unhon ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Maghrib me Surah Al-Tur ki qirat farmate hue suna; Sufyan ne kaha: unhon ne is hadees ke bare me kaha ke Jubayr ne kaha: maine ise Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se is haal me suna jabke main mushrik tha, aur qareeb tha ke mera dil ud jaye; lekin Al-Zuhri ne hamein ye nahi kaha tha."
"568","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Al-Zuhri ko Muhammad ibn Jubayr ibn Mut'im se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat karte hue suna ke unhon ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Qata rehmi karne wala Jannat me dakhil nahi hoga; Sufyan ne kaha: is ki tashreeh ye hai: rishtedaari todne wala."
"569","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, aur maine unhe is ko bayan karte hue suna, Muhammad ibn Jubayr ibn Mut'im se, unhon ne apne walid se, agar Allah chahe, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar Mut'im ibn Adi zinda hota phir mujh se in khabeeson ke bare me, ya in qaidiyon ke bare me baat karta to main unhe us ki khatir chhod deta, yani Badr ke qaidiyon ko; aur jab Sufyan is hadees ko bayan karte aur is me khabar ka zikr karte to kehte: agar Allah chahe, use tark kiye baghair; aur jab is me khabar ka zikr na karte to kabhi kehte: agar Allah chahe, aur kabhi na kehte."
"570","Hamein Al-Humaydi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Amr ibn Dinar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muhammad ibn Jubayr ibn Mut'im ne apne walid se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Arafat ke din mera ek oont gum ho gaya, pas main use talash karte hue Arafat me nikla aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko logon ke sath Arafat me wuqoof farmate hue dekha, to maine kaha: ye Hums me se hai, ye yahan kya kar raha hai; Sufyan ne kaha: Al-Ahmas wo hai jo apne deen me sakht ho, aur Quraysh ko Hums kaha jata tha; aur Shaitan ne unhe behka diya tha aur un se kaha tha: agar tum apne Haram ke siwa kisi aur ki tazeem karoge to log tumhare Haram ko halka samjhenge, pas wo Haram se bahar na nikalte the."
"571","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Humayd ibn Qays al-A'raj — jo Umar ibn Qays ke bhai hain, Banu Fazara ke azaad kardah ghulam hain — ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam apne tamam saalon mein Arafat mein wuqoof farmaya karte thay."
"572","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu al-Zubayr ne hum se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Babah ko Jubayr ibn Mut'im se bayan karte hue suna, ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ai Abd al-Muttalib ke beton — ya: Ai Abd Manaf ke beton — agar tum is muamle mein se kisi cheez par hakim banaye jao to is Ghar ka tawaf karne wale aur raat ya din mein se jis waqt chahe namaz parhne wale kisi shakhs ko mat rokna."
"573","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Najih ne mujhe khabar di, Khalid ibn Hakim ibn Hizam se, jinhon ne farmaya: Abu Ubayda ibn al-Jarrah ne zameen walon mein se ek shakhs ko kisi baat par pakar liya, to Khalid ibn al-Walid ne un se us ke baare mein guftagu ki, to un se kaha gaya: Tum ne ameer ko naraaz kar diya, Khalid ne farmaya: Maine unhen naraaz karne ka irada nahi kiya, lekin maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek azaab mein sab se sakht log woh honge jo duniya mein logon ko saza dene mein sab se sakht hain."
"574","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Amr ibn Aws al-Thaqafi ne mujhe khabar di ke Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Bakr al-Siddiq ne unhen khabar di ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhen hukm diya ke Aisha ko apne peeche sawari par bitha kar al-Tan'im se un ka Umrah karwayen, Sufyan ne farmaya: Aur yeh Shu'ba ka baab hai — unhon ne unhen khabar di ke Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhen khabar di — yaani: muttasil hai."
"575","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Abd al-Karim Abu Umayya ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn al-Harith ibn Nawfal ibn al-Harith ibn Abd al-Muttalib se, jinhon ne farmaya: Mere walid ne Uthman ke daur-e-hukumat mein meri shaadi ka waleema kiya aur hamari dawat par logon ko bulaya, aur jo log hamare paas aaye un mein Safwan ibn Umayya bhi thay, jinhon ne farmaya: Gosht ko daanton se noch kar khao, kyunke maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Yeh zyada khushgawar aur zyada mawafiq hai — ya: zyada khushgawar aur zyada shifa bakhsh hai."
"576","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mansur ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Hajabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mere mamun Musafi ibn Shayba ne mujhe khabar di, meri walida Safiyya bint Shayba se, jinhon ne farmaya: Banu Sulaym ki ek aurat ne — jinhon ne un ke gharane ke aksar logon ki wiladat karwayi thi — mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Uthman ibn Talha se Kaaba mein dakhil hone ke baad Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki un ke liye dua ke baare mein poocha, to unhon ne farmaya: Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Agar tum ne Ghar mein mendhe ke seeng dekhe hon aur main tumhen unhen dhakne ka hukm dena bhool gaya hon to unhen dhank do, kyunke Ghar mein koi aisi cheez nahi honi chahiye jo namazi ko ghafil kare."
"577","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Musawir al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ja'far ibn Amr ibn Hurayth al-Makhzumi ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, jinhon ne farmaya: Maine Makkah ki fatah ke din Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam par siyah amama dekha."
"578","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mis'ar ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Sari se, Amr ibn Hurayth se, jinhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko fajr ki namaz mein Qasam raat ki jab woh chha jaye ki tilawat farmate hue suna."
"579","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Zakariyya ibn Abi Za'ida ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Sha'bi se, jinhon ne farmaya: Abdullah ibn Muti ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid Muti ibn al-Aswad se — aur woh Quraish ke nafarmanon mein se thay jinka naam al-As rakha gaya tha, to Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne un ka naam Muti rakha, aur Quraish ke nafarmanon mein se un ke siwa koi Islam ko na pa saka — farmate hain: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Makkah ki fatah ke din farmate hue suna: Aaj ke din ke baad kisi Quraishi ko kabhi qaid karke qatal nahi kiya jayega, Sufyan ne farmaya: Yaani kufr par hone ki surat mein."
"580","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, jinhon ne farmaya: Maine Abdullah ibn Zam'a ibn al-Aswad ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se suna — aur unhon ne us shakhs ka zikr kiya jis ne oontni ki tangen kaati thin — farmaya: Us ke liye us ki qaum ka ek izzatdar aur taqatwar shakhs aage barha, Abu Zam'a ki tarah, phir Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne aurton ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Tum mein se ek shakhs amadan apni biwi ke paas jata hai aur use aise maarta hai jaise ghulam ko maarta hai, phir din ke aakhir mein use gale lagata hai, unhon ne farmaya: Aur Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne unhen hawa kharij hone par hansne par malamat ki, farmaya: Tum mein se ek shakhs us baat par kyun hansta hai jo woh khud karta hai."
"581","Al-Humaydi ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Al-Walid ibn Kathir ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu Nu'aym Wahb ibn Kaysan ko kehte hue suna: main ne Umar ibn Abi Salama ko kehte hue suna: main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki parwarish me yateem ladka tha, aur mera hath pyale me idhar udhar phirta tha, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Aye ladke, jab tum khao to Allah ka naam lo, apne dayen hath se khao, aur jo tumhare qareeb hai us me se khao. Unhon ne kaha: phir us ke baad mera khane ka tareeqa yahi raha."
"582","Al-Humaydi ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwa ne apne walid se, unhon ne Umar ibn Abi Salama se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Umm Salama ke ghar me ek hi kapde me liptay hue namaz padhte hue dekha."
"583","Al-Humaydi ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Zakariyya ibn Abi Za'ida ne al-Sha'bi se, unhon ne al-Harith ibn Malik ibn al-Barsa se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Fath-e-Makkah ke din farmate hue suna: Makkah par is din ke baad kabhi hamla nahi hoga. Sufyan ne kaha: is ki tafseer ye hai: kufr par."
"584","Al-Humaydi ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Ismail ibn Umayya ne Ibn al-Khuwar jo Banu Amir ke azaad karda ghulam hain se, unhon ne Ubayd ibn Jurayj se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne al-Harith ibn Malik ibn al-Barsa ko hajj ke mauqe par logon me pukarte hue suna — Sufyan ne kaha: main is ko isi tarah janta hun ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jo shakhs bhi kisi Musalman aadmi ka haq maarne ke liye jhooti qasam khata hai to wo Allah se is haal me milega ke Wo us par naraz hoga."
"585","Al-Humaydi ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Urwa ibn al-Zubayr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Kurz ibn Alqama al-Khuza'i ko kehte hue suna: ek aadmi ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se poocha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, kya Islam ka koi anjaam hai? Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Haan; Arab ya ajam ka jo bhi gharana ho jis ke liye Allah bhalai ka irada farmata hai, Wo us me Islam dakhil kar deta hai. Unhon ne kaha: phir kya hoga, Aye Allah ke Rasul? Aap ne farmaya: phir fitne andheri ghataon ki tarah chha jayenge. Us aadmi ne Aap se kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, agar Allah chahe, Aye Allah ke Rasul. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Haan, us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath me meri jaan hai, log us me kundli mare hue siyah saanpon ki tarah laut aayenge, jin me se baaz baaz ki gardano par waar karenge. Al-Zuhri ne kaha: Al-Aswad wo saanp hai jab wo dasna chahta hai to is tarah uth khada hota hai — aur Al-Humaydi ne apna hath uthaya — phir waar karta hai. Sufyan ne jab ye hadith bayan ki to kaha: agar tum ye Ibn Shihab se na suno to tumhen parwa karne ki zaroorat nahi."
"586","Al-Humaydi ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Amr ibn Dinar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Nafi ibn Jubayr ibn Mut'im ne Abu Shurayh al-Ka'bi se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai to use apne padosi se neki karni chahiye; aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai to use apne mehmaan ki izzat karni chahiye."
"587","Al-Humaydi ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Ibn Ajlan ne Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi se, unhon ne Abu Shurayh se, unhon ne Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind riwayat kiya, is izafe ke sath: mehmaan nawazi teen din hai, aur jo is se zyada ho wo sadqa hai; aur us ka inaam ek din aur ek raat hai; aur us ke liye halal nahi ke wo us ke paas itna thehre ke use tangi me daal de."
"588","Al-Humaydi ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Amr ibn Dinar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Amr ibn Abdullah ibn Safwan al-Jumahi ne khabar di ke unhon ne apne mamoon me se Azd ke ek aadmi jise Yazid ibn Shayban kaha jata hai ko kehte hue suna: Ibn Mirba' al-Ansari hamare paas aaye jab ke hum Arafat me us jagah the jise Amr imam ke mauqaf se door rakhta tha, aur unhon ne kaha: main tumhari taraf Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ka qasid hun, tum apne in munasik par qayam raho, kyunke tum Ibrahim ke wirse me se ek wirse par ho, Alehi Salam. Abu Bakr ne kaha: aur Sufyan kabhi kehte: jamay raho, aur kabhi kehte: tumhare walid Ibrahim."
"589","Al-Humaydi ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Kathir ibn Kathir ibn al-Muttalib ne apne khandan me se ek fard se bayan kiya ke unhon ne apne dada al-Muttalib ibn Abi Wada'a ko kehte hue suna: main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko Banu Sahm ke darwaze ki taraf namaz padhte hue dekha jab ke log Aap ke samne se guzar rahe the, aur Aap ke aur tawaf ke darmiyan koi sutra nahi tha."
"590","Sufyan ne kaha: aur Ibn Jurayj ne pehle hamen Kathir se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne al-Muttalib se bayan kiya; phir jab main ne un se is ke bare me poocha to unhon ne kaha: ye mere walid se nahi hai; balke mere khandan me se ek fard ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne ise al-Muttalib se suna hai."
"591","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Umayya ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulayka se, ke unhon ne Uqba ibn al-Harith ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Ihab ki beti se nikah kiya, phir ek siyah faam aurat aayi aur kaha: Maine tum dono ko doodh pilaya hai, to main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me Aap ki dayen taraf se aaya aur Aap se pucha, to Aap ne mujh se munh pher liya, phir main Aap ki khidmat me bayen taraf se aaya to Aap ne mujh se munh pher liya, phir main Aap ke samne hua aur Aap se pucha, kehte hue: Ya Rasulullah, agarche woh siyah hai, agarche woh, agarche woh, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kaise, jabke keh diya gaya hai?"
"592","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Isa ibn Talha ibn Ubaydullah ko bayan karte hue suna, Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As se, ke ek shakhs ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se pucha: Ya Rasulullah, maine rami se pehle zibah kar liya, Aap ne farmaya: Rami karo, aur koi harj nahi, aur ek aur ne kaha: Maine zibah se pehle sar munda liya, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Zibah karo, aur koi harj nahi, Sufyan se kaha gaya: Kya ye us me se hai jo aap ne Al-Zuhri se yaad kiya, unhon ne kaha: Haan, goya sunte hue, siwa iske ke woh taweel hai aur maine us me se ye yaad kiya, phir Bulbul jo Bulayl ibn Harb bhi kehlate hain ne un se kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi aap se riwayat karte hain ke aap ne kaha: Maine ise yaad nahi kiya, unhon ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha, maine is sab ko yaad nahi kiya, lekin isko maine pukhta kar liya."
"593","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ilm ko logon ke dilon se cheen kar nahi uthata, balke ulama ko utha kar uthata hai, phir jab Woh koi aalim baqi nahi rakhta to log jahil sardaron ko bana lete hain aur un se puchte hain, to woh baghair ilm ke fatwe dete hain, pas woh khud gumrah hote hain aur gumrah karte hain, Urwa ne kaha: Phir main ek saal thehra, phir maine tawaf me Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As se mulaqat ki aur un se iske bare me pucha, to unhon ne mujhe iski khabar di."
"594","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Abu Iyad se, Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne bartanon se mana farmaya to kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, sab logon ko mashkiza muyassar nahi aata, to Aap ne unhe matti ke gharon ki ijazat de di jo qeer se lipe hue na hon."
"595","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ibn al-Saib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di: Maine Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Do khaslaten aasan hain, magar un par amal karne wale thode hain, aur koi Musalman unki hifazat nahi karta magar Jannat me dakhil hota hai, unhon ne kaha: Woh kya hain, Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne farmaya: Har namaz ke baad das martaba Subhan Allah kaho, das martaba Allahu Akbar kaho, aur das martaba Alhamdulillah kaho, aur apne bistar par taintis martaba Subhan Allah kaho, taintis martaba Alhamdulillah kaho, aur chautis martaba Allahu Akbar kaho, phir Sufyan ne kaha: Un me se ek chautis hai, ye zaban par do sau pachaas hain, aur tarazu par do hazar paanch sau hain, Abdullah ibn Amr ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ko apne haath par unhe ginte hue dekha, phir Aap ne farmaya: Tum me se kaun apne din aur raat me do hazar paanch sau bure aamal karta hai, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, unki hifazat kaise na ki jaye, Aap ne farmaya: Shaitan tum me se ek ke paas aata hai aur us se kehta hai: Falan falan yaad kar, falan falan yaad kar, yahan tak ke woh unhe kahe baghair uth khada hota hai, Sufyan ne kaha: Ye pehli cheez hai jo hum ne Ata se puchi, aur Ayyub ne logon ko hukm diya, jab Ata Basra aaye, ke unke paas jayen aur un se is hadith ke bare me puchen."
"596","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ibn al-Saib ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ki khidmat me aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main Aap ki khidmat me hijrat par baiat ke liye aaya hun, apne walidain ko rota hua chhod kar, Aap ne farmaya: Unke paas wapas jao aur unhe hansao jaisa tum ne unhe rulaya."
"597","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib ibn Abi Thabit se, Abu al-Abbas al-Saib ibn Farrukh se, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam se isi ki manind, siwa iske ke unhon ne kaha: Phir un dono me jihad me koshish kar."
"598","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Najih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Amir ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Amr ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Woh hum me se nahi jo hamare chhoton par rehem na kare aur hamare bade ka haq na pehchane."
"599","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhayb jo Abdullah ibn Amir ke azaad karda hain ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs chidya ya us se upar koi cheez uske haq ke baghair qatl kare, Allah Azza wa Jalla us se uske qatl ke bare me sawal karega, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, uska haq kya hai, Aap ne farmaya: Use zibah kare aur khaye, aur uska sar kaat kar phenk na de, Sufyan se kaha gaya: Hammad ibn Zayd is me kehte hain: Amr ne mujhe khabar di, Suhayb al-Hadhdha se, Sufyan ne kaha: Maine Amr ko kabhi Suhayb al-Hadhdha kehte hue bilkul nahi suna, unhon ne Suhayb jo Abdullah ibn Amir ke azaad karda hain ke siwa kuch nahi kaha."
"600","Al-Humaydi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Dinar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Aws al-Thaqafi ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Amr ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam ne farmaya: Adl karne wale Qayamat ke din Allah ke paas Rahman ki dayen janib noor ke mimbaron par honge aur Uske dono haath dayen hain, jo apne faisle aur apne ghar walon aur jo unke supurd kiya gaya us me adl karte hain."
